    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "あんただって、もっといい顔してた時があるよ、チューム。",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "（しばらく彼を見つめる）……あんただ。",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "ああ、ああ——砂漠は男の顔に優しくねぇ。だがあんたは？……くそ。目に染みるぜ、V。その顔が恋しくて、言葉にならん。",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "ああ、ああ——砂漠は男の顔に優しくねぇ。だがあんたは、エルマーノ？くそ、いい眺めだ。そのブサイクな面が恋しかったぜ。",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "二人とも立ってる。大事なのはそれだけ。",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "……待て。オレのバイク。まだ持ってるのか？ずっと、取っといてくれたのか？",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "あたしのガレージにあるよ、ジャッキー。あんたを待ってる。はい——キー。",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "本当に持っとくんだな。（笑）よし、よし——じゃああんたが運転しな、チカ。ほら。いい手に渡ってたって見せてくれ。",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "本当に持っとくんだな。（笑）よし——じゃああんたが運転しな、エルマーノ。ほら。いい手に渡ってたって見せてくれ。",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "乗って、ジャッキー。家に帰ろう。",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "オレのために動かし続けてくれたのか。ずっと……くそ、V。そいつが昔のオレに残った最後のカケラだ。",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "行こう、エルマーノ。ひと走りしてくればいい。",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "行こうぜ、V。家に帰ろう。……それとな——葬式はもうナシだ。当分の間はな、いいか？",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "行こうぜ、エルマーノ。家に帰ろう。……それとな——葬式はもうナシだ。当分の間はな、いいか？",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "イホレ……やったな。本当にやりやがった。信じられんぜ、V。",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "（息を整える）……ええ。やったね。",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "オレたちは生きてる、チカ。二人ともな。",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "コンペキからロクに息もついてねぇ。……ちょっと止まるだけで気持ちいいな。",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "ヘッ……ああ。だな。……あそこにいたのがオレたちだって誰も知らねぇのは残念だ。",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "ところで——ケースはどこにしまったの？",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "……ジャッキー？",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "持ってた。この手にな、V、確かに持ってたんだ……",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "ジャッキー！バイオチップ——チップの入ったケースよ、どこ！？",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "離すまいとしたんだ、誓って。スマッシャー——あのイホ・デ・プータが……ケースに弾が当たって、パックリ割れた。チップはスクラップだ。だから捨てた。……すまねぇ、V。本当だ。",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "くそっ！あれがあたしたちの切符だったのよジャッキー！全部それのために働いてきたのに！",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "正直？あれは価値以上に厄介事を運んできたと思う。",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "二人とも息をしてる、カブロン。意味のある稼ぎはそれだけ。",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "ああ……分かってる。チンガオ。だがな——あんたはまだここにいて怒れてるだろ？",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "あんたとあたし。スマッシャーを倒してコンペキ・プラザから歩いて出た。誰も信じないよ。",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "……ああ。あんたが正しいのかもな。ああいう企業のテックは寿命を縮めるだけだ。",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "ヘヘッ、ああ。語り継がれる話だぜ V！  \\n（間）で……次は？",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "あたしたちの好きなように、エルマーノ。今度こそ、あたしたちの物語を書くのはあたしたちだけ。",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "……ヘッ。その響き、いいねぇ。じゃあ行こうぜ。ナイトシティは勝手にソロクリアされちゃくれねぇ！",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "ヌードルバー。",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "ミスティズ・エソテリカ。",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "エル・コヨーテ・コホ。",
    ["Afterlife."] = "アフターライフ。",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "ジンジャー・パンダ。",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "レッドウッド・マーケット。",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "リジーズ・バー。",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "（秘密の昼寝スポット）。",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V：ジャッキーをこんな厄介事に巻き込むわけにはいかない。あれだけの目に遭った後じゃなおさら。",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "メインミッション中はジャッキーを呼べない——こんなことに巻き込むわけにはいかない。",
    ["Shigure"] = "時雨",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "おい、まずいぞ……",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "エスタモス・ビエン・チンガドス！",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "ムエルテ、カブロン！",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "運よく今は誰もいねぇ。だが長居はできん。",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "あれは——あれはアダム・スマッシャーか？",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "うわ、やべぇ！",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "オレたちは死なねぇ——今日はな！",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "ビエン・ペンサド。アラサカの爺さんのAVがまだ屋上に停まってるはずだ。",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "行くぞ、V——ここから出よう。",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — インストール完了",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "ヴィクから電話。伝言が残ってる。ジャッキーのことで話がある——電話では言えないことだと。\\n\\nクリニックまで会いに行こう。\\n\\n（MOD設定は Esc → Mods → JackieLives）",
    ["Vik:"] = "ヴィク：",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "ずっと前に話しとくべきだった、黙ってて悪かったよ。あの夜、ジャッキーはオレの台の上じゃ死んでなかった。脈を戻して、ツテを頼って、アラサカが遺体を探しに来る前に運び出したんだ。あいつは生きてる、V——バッドランドで身を潜めてる、そしてそれは伏せとかなきゃならん。あの子はあんな目に遭って生き延びる道理がなかった。そして口がきけるようになって最初に聞いたのが、お前が無事だったかどうかだった。今まで話すのは危険すぎたんだ、V。すまない。地図に場所を記しとく。連れ戻してやってくれ。",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "ずっと前に話しとくべきだった、黙ってて悪かったよ。あの夜、ジャッキーはオレの台の上じゃ死んでなかった。脈を戻して、ツテを頼って、アラサカが遺体を探しに来る前に運び出したんだ。今まで話すのは危険すぎたんだ、V。あいつは生きてる。バッドランドで身を潜めてる——そしてそれは伏せとかなきゃならん。あいつはずっとお前を待ってた。地図に場所を記しとく。連れ戻してやってくれ。",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "シャード — ジャッキー・ウェルズ",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "これを読んでるってことは、V、ドクは約束を守って、あんたをここまで寄越したんだな。オレだ。生きてるぜ。",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "ヴィクがオレを繕って、サカがオレの名を石板に刻む前にこっそり運び出してくれた。それからずっと身を潜めてる。",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "ママ・ウェルズは聞いてカンカンだった。またギグに戻ったら殺されると思う——たぶんそれが正しい。オレは傭兵稼業とはおさらばだ、V。本気でな。だが、あんたにオレを埋めたと思わせたままにはできなかった。",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "読んだら電話をくれ。 — ジャッキー",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "ジャッキーを探せ — ロッキー・リッジ、バッドランド",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "ジャッキーに電話",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "ジャッキーを待て",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "ジャッキーが戻った。",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "シャード — ミスティ",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "今は「死神」のカードを伏せたままにしてるの。見ていられなかった——何ヶ月も、目を閉じるとそれしか見えなかったから。",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "ヴィクから、あの人が助かった、バッドランドで息をしてるって聞いたとき、私は店の床に座り込んで、お香が燃え尽きるまで泣いたわ。",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "喜んでるだけだなんて嘘はつかない、V。夜には叫びたくなるほど腹が立つこともある。あの人はリスクを承知であの強盗に踏み込んだ。私たちを置いていきかけた。私を置いていきかけたのよ。",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "でもカードは間違ってなかった。あの人の糸は切れなかった。ほつれただけ……そして持ちこたえた。",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "あの人に優しくしてあげて。それと、ありがとう——あの人を連れ戻しに行ってくれて。 — ミスティ",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "シャード — ママ・ウェルズ",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "そう。私のジャッキーは生きていて、それを最後に知るのがこの私。あなたも母親になってごらんなさい、V、そして誰かがこんなことをあなたに隠したら——そのとき赦しについて話しましょう。",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "あの子のために毎日ロウソクを灯した。亡霊のために料理をした。その間ずっとあの子は砂埃の中で息をして、私に嘆かせていたのね。ディオス・ミオ。",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "それでも——あの子は生きている。私の坊やが生きている。聞いてからずっと聖母様に感謝し通しよ。おかげで膝が痛いくらい。",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "でも一度だけ聞いてちょうだい、V。もしあの子がまたあんな強盗みたいなギグを引き受けたら——金と栄光のためにもう一度命を賭けたら——私はこの街があの子を奪うのを待たない。私が自分の手で殺してやる。",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "あの子を私の食卓に連れておいで。皿が用意してある。ずっと前から皿は用意してあるのよ。 — ママ・ウェルズ",
    ["Talk"] = "話す",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "ジャッキーと話す   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "ジャッキー",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "ジャッキーに発信中……",
    ["No answer."] = "応答なし。",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "来たな。座れよ、ひと息つけ——あんたはいつも動きっぱなしだ。",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "来たな。座れよ、ひと息つけ——あんたはいつも動きっぱなしだ。",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "来てくれねぇかと思ってたとこだ。誰にも言うなよ。",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "よう。……いや、何でもねぇ。あんたがそこに立ってんのを見るのが、ただ嬉しいだけさ。",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "ミ・エルマーナ。こっち来いよ。",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "静かな暮らしって、実際どうなの？",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "バーの仕事は好き？",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "ヘイウッドはまだ「家」って感じ？",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "恋しくならない？あの生活。",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "体の調子は？正直なところ。",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "あの夜のこと、どこまで覚えてる？",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "ヴィクのところにはまだ行ってる？",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "怖かった？",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "あたしのせいだと思ってる？",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "今は何が欲しいの、ジャッキー？",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "……言ってよ。ずっと言わずにいる、その何かを。",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "いい感じさ。ゆっくりな。ゆっくりってのは慣れが要るが、悪くねぇ。",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "いい日もある。真っ昼間に体が座れって言うから座る日もある。もう体とは言い争わねぇことにしてる。",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "正直か？よく眠れねぇ。四時頃には目が覚めて、そのまま建物の音を聞いてる。……だがオレは眠れねぇためにここにいるんだ。そういう取引さ。もう一度でも同じ取引をする。",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "だいたいはバーだな。あとは連中が問題を抱えてオレを見つけに来る。小せぇやつをな。オレは小せぇのが好きだ。",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "近所のガキが兄貴を探しててな。二日かかって、山ほど喋って、誰も撃たれなかった。人生で一番の仕事だ。一銭にもならねぇけどな。",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "ああ、まあ……静かだよ。ヘヘッ。それが笑い話だろ？静けさってのは技術だったんだな。最初はてんでダメだった。",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "いまだに、何かがうまくいかねぇんじゃねぇかって耳を澄ましてる自分に気づく。昼の二時にバーで布巾持って突っ立って、来もしねぇ銃撃戦を待ってんだ。まあ、マシにはなってきた。",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "そのうち慣れるよ。",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "死ぬよりマシでしょ。",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "いつだってあの生活に戻れるよ。",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "……いや。ダメだ、V。オレはあそこから運び出されたんだ。ママは夜中に電話を受けた。二度もあの人にそんな思いはさせねぇ。あんたにもだ。二度と訊かねぇでくれ。",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "ごめん。あなたが正しい。",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "わかった。",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "世話焼いてくる。飯を食わせてくる。怖がってないフリをする——そこで怖がってるってのがわかるんだ。",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "ママはオレのためにロウソクを灯すんだ。この、オレのためにだぜ。目の前のテーブルに座ってるってのに、それでも灯す。あそこから出られなかった方のオレのためだ、ってさ。",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "あの夜に何があったか、ママは半分も知らねぇし、これからも知ることはねぇ。ママが背負わなくて済むように、オレが背負ってる分さ。わかるだろ？",
    ["I understand."] = "あなたが許せば、ママは一緒に背負ってくれるよ。",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "正直な仕事さ。注ぎ方が下手だからって銃を突きつけられたことはねぇ。",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "客全員の一杯と、悩みの半分は把握してる。あれも一種の力なんだな。ゆっくり効くやつだが。",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "ずっとそうさ。同じ街角、同じ窓から同じアブエラたちが怒鳴ってる。",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "ただ、歩き方は変わったな。昔はいつかここを手に入れるつもりで歩いてた。今はただ……歩いてる。",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "……ああ。ああ、恋しいさ。撃ち合いじゃねぇ。*オレたち*がだ。夜中の二時にバカな思いつきをして、四時にはやってる、あれがな。",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "ドアを開けて入るだけで話が片付く、あの男でいられたことが恋しい。治らねぇのはそこなんだ、チカ——肋骨じゃねぇ。肋骨はくっついた。",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "ドアを開けて入るだけで話が片付く、あの男でいられたことが恋しい。治らねぇのはそこなんだ、エルマーノ——肋骨じゃねぇ。肋骨はくっついた。",
    ["We're still us."] = "あたしたちは今もあたしたちだよ。",
    ["You were never just that."] = "あなたはそれだけの人じゃなかった。",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "正直に？固ぇよ。寒い朝が一番きつい。ヴィクは一生もんだから仲良くしろってさ。",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "体の中にプレートが入ってるんだ、V。どこで終わってるか手で分かる。夜、その上に手を置いてまだちゃんと仕事してるか確かめてることがある。自慢できる傷跡の代わりに、オレが手に入れたもんだ。",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "茶化さなくていいよ。",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "あなたはまだ立ってる。",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "断片さ。車。あんたが何か叫んでて、それが聞き取れねぇ。回線越しのデックスの声。もうその時点で全部が転がり落ちてた。",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "寒かったのは覚えてる。暖けぇ夜だったのに妙だなって思ったのも。それと、あんたはもう十分抱えてたから、何も言わねぇって決めたのも覚えてる。……バカだったな。何か言うべきだった。",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "何か言ってほしかった。",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "あたしを守ろうとしてくれたんだね。",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "この話はやめよう。",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "月に一度な。金を取らねぇんだ、それがまた腹立たしくてよ。だからママの台所から何か持ってって、それでチャラってことにしてる。",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "あの人はオレが死んだままでいられるように、長いこと口をつぐんでてくれた。ヴィクみてぇな男にとって、それがどれだけの重さか分かるか？一人で背負ってたんだ。肋骨どころじゃねぇ借りさ。",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "……ああ。その場ではな——その場じゃただうるさくて、それから静かになるだけだ。後だよ。知らねぇ部屋で目が覚めて、体が動かなくて、あんたが逃げられたのかも分からねぇ。残ったのはその怖さだ。口に出して言えるまで、ずいぶんかかった。",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "言ってくれてよかった。",
    ["I was scared too."] = "あたしも怖かった。",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "何に対してだ？あの仕事にか？V、オレはあの仕事が*やりたかった*んだ。半分はオレがあんたを乗り気にさせた。あんたはずっとそれを抱えて、オレが恨んでると思ってたのか？……いや。ないね。一度も。一秒たりともだ。",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "それが聞きたかった。",
    ["I still carry it."] = "それでもまだ抱えてる。",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "なら下ろせよ。ここで、今すぐ——もう引きずらなくていい。オレはあんたの前に立ってる。見ろよ。ちゃんとここに立ってる。",
    ["...Okay."] = "……わかった。",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "小せぇもんだな、たぶん。バー。日曜のママんとこ。あとは、鉄格子のねぇ窓がある部屋とか。昔は何かに自分の名前を刻みたかった。今は、退屈するくらい長く生きてぇ。情けねぇか？",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "それって、ちゃんとした人生だよ。",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "情けなくなんかない。",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "……ヴィクに最初に訊いたのがそれだ。自分の名前より先に、何が起きたかより先に。あんたが逃げ切れたか訊いた。ああ、と言われて、オレはまた二日眠りに落ちた。あの夜が他に何を持っていったにせよ、それだけは持っていかなかった。それが、オレがずっと言わずにいることさ。",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "あたしも毎日あなたのことを訊いてた。",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "行けよ。オレはどこにも行かねぇ——今のオレは、そのためにあるんだ。",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "よう。また来いよな？ひと月も空けんなよ。",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "テキーラ・オールドファッションドに、セルベサをひと垂らし、チリを添えて。",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "ウォッカをロックで一杯、ライムジュース、ジンジャービア、それから一番大事なのが……愛をひと垂らし。",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "テキーラのダブルにグレナデンとライム。神経を溶かすにはこれが一番だ。",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "ああ、ついでに言うと、名前はジャッキー・ウェルズだ。レシピ、書き留めとくか？",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "すっかりネタが出来上がってるじゃない。",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "ナイトシティの居心地はどう？",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "あぁ〜、この街が好きだ。無限のチャンスの街。それと、兄弟同士の憎しみの街だ。",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "頼れる人間がいるってのは大事だ。ほら、その、家族みたいなさ。あんたもナイトシティで自分のを見つけられるかもな。",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "企業からドブネズミを叩き出すことはできても、ドブネズミから企業を抜くことは絶対にできねぇ。",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "ほら……バタフライ効果ってやつ？",
    ["I found mine."] = "あたしはもう見つけたよ。",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "オレは一途だし、気持ちもブレねぇ……",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "彼女、待ってたんだよ。",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "最近なに見てるの？",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "ノ・マメス！本物のイグアナだ！えっと、たしか……小アンティル諸島のやつだ。",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "そうだ！テレビでこいつらの番組を見たんだよ。三十年くらい前に絶滅したんだ。小アンティル諸島の出身でな。",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "遠くまで来たもんだな、ウロコの友よ。",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "VRで射撃訓練でもやるか？",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "すっかり自然ドキュメンタリー派になったんだ。",
    ["...An iguana."] = "……イグアナね。",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "最近、誰か困り事を持ち込んできた？",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "あのカブロンには分からせねぇとな……ヘイウッドの連中を汚ねぇやり方で扱うんじゃねぇって。",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "それだって立派なフィクサーの仕事だよ、ジャッキー。",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "ヘイウッドはあんたがいて幸運だよ。",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "二軒隣のガキが、相手の悪い奴に借りを作っちまってな。銃なんて要らなかった——要ったのは、部屋に座ってそこで一番デカい存在でいられる誰かだ。それがまだオレだったってわけさ。",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "誰も記録なんて残さねぇ。フィクサーもいねぇ、取り分もねぇ、掲示板に名前も載らねぇ。ただ夜の十一時にバーのドアを叩く女がいるだけだ、他に行くとこがねぇからな。……オレがやった中で一番いい仕事だよ。それを仕事なんて呼ぶのは、気恥ずかしいけどな。",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "あんたの親父さんのこと、聞かせてよ。",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "ラウル・ウェルズの息子でいるよりは、間違いなくマシだ。",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "あいつは出ていった。話はそれで全部だ。そこまで短くまとめるのに三十年かかったけどな。ママは一度もあいつの悪口を言わなかった、ただの一度もだ——ただ黙って、二人分の親になっちまったのさ。",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "あんたはあの人とは全然違うよ。",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "彼女は本当によくやったね。",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "あんたの筋の通し方、どこで身につけたの、ジャッキー？",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "バレンティーノスを見てみろ。あいつらは神とサンタ・マドレに従ってる。名誉ってもんが、あいつらには意味を持ってるんだ。",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "ギャングの世界ってのは、そう複雑じゃねぇ。力こそ正義、強い奴が生き残る。",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "今日はあんたに誰かをゼロにさせる。明日は別の誰かを使って、あんたをゼロにさせる。",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "今もそれで生きてるの？",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "だから足を洗ったんでしょ？",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "今もそういうの信じてるの？神様とか、聖人とか。",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "うちのお袋がいつも言ってた、辛抱は報われるってな。だから……",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "エン・エル・ノンブレ・デル・パドレ、デル・イホ・イ・デル・エスピリトゥ・サント、アメン。",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "オレは死んだんだ、V。どう言い換えたってな——心臓が止まって、誰かの手がまた動かした。信じてるかって？何かが一瞬、ドアを押さえててくれた。それは信じてる。それが誰の手だったのかまでは、知らなくていい。",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "ママが聞いたら喜ぶだろうね。",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "死ぬことって考える？",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "死なんて……最後の飾りみてぇなもんさ。",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "昔はそれを気の利いた台詞みてぇに言ってた。バーで一杯持ちながら言ったこともある——誰だっていつかは逝く、だったら派手に逝こうぜ、ってな。で、オレは逝った、V。分かったんだ、あそこに派手さなんてねぇ。あるのはただの部屋と、あんたを繋ぎ止める仕事を代わりにやってる誰かだけだ。",
    ["You're here now."] = "あんたは今、ここにいる。",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "もう二度と逝かないでよ、エルマーノ。",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "アスタ・ルエゴ。",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "そろそろ行く時間だ、カルナル。",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "動くぞ、チカ。",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "ついてきてるか、チカ？",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "ついてきてるか、マノ？",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "エルマーノ！やっとかよ！",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "心配すんな。あたし一人でなんとかする。",
    ["You order."] = "頼んでよ。",
    ["Maybe later."] = "また今度。",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "ミスティとは長いんだろ？",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "よし、準備できた。行こう。",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "あたしも会えて嬉しいよ、ジャック。元気だった？",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "手を貸してくれ、ジャック。仕事だ。",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "先に片付けなきゃいけないことがある。",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "行こう。待ってても仕方ない。",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "またな、アミーゴ。",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "何がうまい？",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "調子はどう？仕事以外の話だよ。",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "やっぱ、もう行かなきゃ。",
    ["See you around."] = "またな。",
    ["Need your help."] = "手を貸してほしい。",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "セニョーラ・ウェルズはどうしてる？",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "一杯やりたいな。",
    ["Take care."] = "気をつけて。",
    ["To this."] = "これに乾杯。",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "タダ酒は断らないよ。",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "メジャーリーグ入りに乾杯！",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "何してんの？",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "ミスティに「よろしく」って伝えて。",
    ["Riiight…"] = "そうかぁ……",
    ["How's things?"] = "最近どうよ？",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "飲みもんは何がある？",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "お袋さんは元気？",
    ["Talk later."] = "また後で話そう。",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "書き留めるほどのことは何も。それがいいんだろ、チカ。",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "書き留めるほどのことは何も。それがいいんだろ、エルマーノ。",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "一杯もらうよ。",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "小アンティ……何だって？",
    ["Later."] = "じゃあな。",
    ["Take care, man."] = "気をつけろよ、相棒。",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "あとでかけ直す。",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "話はまた後で。",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "ああ、またな。",
    ["Gotta run."] = "もう行かなきゃ。",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "メジャーリーグで会おうぜ、ジャック。",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "あばよ、旧友。",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "ただ、その、元気にやってるか知りたかっただけ。",
    ["Come on."] = "行こう。",
    ["You got me too."] = "こっちも同じだ。",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "その勝ちはもらっとく。",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "似合ってるよ、ジャッキー。",
    ["Small ones count."] = "小さい仕事も仕事だ。",
    ["Still your turf."] = "まだお前の縄張りだ。",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "それを言えるお前がいて良かった。",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "ヴィクはいい男だ。",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "そういう言い方もあるな。",
    ["Amen to that."] = "まったくだ。",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "座る動作はまだ調整中です",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "テーブルでは座らずに立ったままになります。\n\n座りアニメーションはまだ実際の家具と連動していません。キャラクターが立っている場所でそのまま再生されるため、自動で座らせると椅子の上に浮いてしまいがちです。浮くよりは立っている方が見栄えが良いので、立ったままを既定にしています。\n\n手動で座らせることもでき、その場合は指定した位置に正確に座ります。CETオーバーレイを開き、「NCLives - Companions」→「Sitting - seat them by hand」を選択。椅子の上に、座らせたい向きで立って「Seat them here」を押し、下がってから高さと角度のスライダーで微調整してください。\n\n家に帰す前に、同じパネルで立たせ直してください。",
  },
  ["es"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "Esto huele a problemas de los gordos, V. Espero un minuto — pero déjalo, o me largo.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "El reloj corre, hermana. Suelta el pez gordo o me voy.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Esa es mi chica. Que el lío corpo espere — sigo contigo.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "El mod está cargado, pero no ha podido leer tu progreso en la historia, así que no iniciará la questline de Jackie por su cuenta.\n\nCuando hayas terminado el atraco, iníciala desde Esc -> Ajustes -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Háblame, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "No vienes seguido por aquí, ¿verdad? Jeje. Qué gusto verte, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "¿Cómo te sientes? ¿Estás bien?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "No hay nada mejor, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "¿Lista para movernos?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "Entonces hagamos lo nuestro.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "Ya es hora de irnos, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "A moverse, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Alguien te dejó algo aquí...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — gracias, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Pagaste 3,847 eurodólares de tu propio bolsillo para manejar hasta Rocky Ridge — solo para averiguar si Jackie de verdad seguía respirando acá afuera. Y luego se lo contaste al mundo entero.\\n\\nAsí que aquí tienes tus 3,847 eurodólares de vuelta, devueltos POR DIEZ: 38,470. Y la Arch de Jackie de pilón.\\n\\nNadie se echa esos kilómetros por un mod que no ama. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie y el equipo de Jackie Lives",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "¿Quieres ir a comer algo?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Come algo con Jackie: Ve a %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...y luego nos lanzamos al Afterlife, jajaja... Ya sabes, a echarnos unos shots.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Nos vemos en Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Va que va, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "En fin, ¿qué está pasando?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "¿Por qué, cuál es la prisa?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Ándale, vamos a comer algo.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "Sí, ya tuve suficiente por hoy, te lo juro.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(Quizá la próxima.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Órale, esto cae de maravilla. Sin trabajos, sin balazos — solo tú y yo.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Me podría acostumbrar a esto de la vida tranquila, ¿sabes?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Qué bien sentarse un rato, ¿no, chica?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Qué bien sentarse un rato, ¿no, hermano?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "En fin... ¿qué traes en la cabeza, V?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "¿Alguna vez extrañas la vida de mercenario, Jackie?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "Esta ciudad me ha estado desgastando últimamente.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "¿Crees que Arasaka pague algún día por lo que hizo?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "¿Extrañarla? Algunos días. La adrenalina, el equipo... pero me quitó más de lo que me dio, V. Tú lo sabes mejor que nadie.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "¿La vida? Nel. Los buenos trabajos, tal vez. Los finales no — los dos vimos cómo acaban.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "Sí. Pero salimos con vida.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "A Night City le da igual si vives o mueres, chica. Lo único que puedes hacer es encontrar a tu gente y no soltarla.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "A Night City le da igual si vives o mueres, mano. Lo único que puedes hacer es encontrar a tu gente y no soltarla.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "Este pueblo se traga a todos. El truco es no dejar que te trague entero. Me tienes a mí, te tengo a ti — ese es el truco.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "¿'Saka? Je. Los peces gordos así nunca pagan, V. Pero seguimos respirando y no saben nuestros nombres. Eso es ganar.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "Las ratas corpo siempre caen de pie. La mejor venganza es vivir bien — como ahorita, con el plato lleno enfrente.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty es mi ancla, V. Me hace mirar hacia arriba cuando quiero mirar al suelo. No sé qué sería de mí sin ella.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "¿Misty y yo? Firmes. Ella lee las cartas, dice que las estrellas tienen un plan. Yo nomás le digo que ella es mi plan.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "Se sentó con mi Mamá cada semana que estuve fuera, ¿sabes? Cada semana. Nunca voy a poder pagárselo.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Ella te hace bien.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Je, órale. Vámonos, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Je, órale. Vámonos, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "Sí, tenemos una ciudad que cuidar. Vámonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Justo detrás de ti, hermano. Muévete.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Directo al negocio, ¿eh, mano?",
    ["Let's go."] = "Vámonos.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, ¿cómo te sientes? ¿Estás bien?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Eh, ya sabes cómo es, no me quejo. Pero no venimos a echar chisme sobre mí.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mi Mamá me decía que las cosas llegan a quien sabe esperar, ¡y algunas hasta son buenas!",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "Es de mi sangre, claro. El Coyote es su antro.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Ándale, vamos a echarnos una.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Oye, V, ¿sigues viva? ¿Cómo va todo en el nido de víboras?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "Aquí nacen las leyendas.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Directo al negocio, ¿eh, chica?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "¿La extrañas? ¿La vida de mercenario?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "Es el oficio, V. Todos tenemos sangre en las manos. Lo asumes y sigues adelante.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "Entonces haz uno último fácil, un trabajo extra, conmigo.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Jeje, ¡brindo por eso!",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "Ah, gracias, Misty. Eres la mejor.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "¿Misty lo vio venir? ¿Que ibas a salir con vida?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Ahora regreso, busco a Misty y hacemos algo que me haga sentir vivo otra vez.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Antes de eso — tengo un trabajo extra, si te animas.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty lo sabía... Misty siempre sabe...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "¿Las cartas dicen que me ayudarás en un trabajo?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Aquí voy, justo detrás de ti.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "¿Y bien? ¿Lista?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "¡V, ey! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "No vienes seguido por aquí, ¿verdad? Jeje. Qué gusto verte, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Oye, V — ¿sigues viva? ¿Cómo va todo en el nido de víboras?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "¡Chica! ¡Por fin!",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "No vienes seguido por aquí, ¿verdad? Jeje. Qué gusto verte, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Oye V — ¿sigues viva? ¿Cómo va todo en el nido de víboras?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "¡V, ey! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Ya era hora.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "¿Vienes a ver si no estoy pudriéndome en un basurero, como casi todos los Welles?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Olvídalo.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Aguanta, V, ya voy.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "Sí, órale.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "Órale, órale, órale.",
    ["You're all right."] = "Eres buena onda.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Por fin está pasando algo...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Ya es tarde para echarse para atrás. Ándale, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "Y más nos vale ser rápidos.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "¿Vienes? El tiempo es oro.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Sí, sí, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "Les partimos el cuello antes de que se den cuenta.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Je, ¡el ayuntamiento debería darnos las malditas gracias!",
    ["Finally!"] = "¡Por fin!",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...¿Jackie? ¿De verdad eres tú?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "Soy yo, V. Llevo siglos mirando este teléfono preguntándome si algún día sonaría.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Hijo de puta. ¿Estás VIVO?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Te enterré. Te GUARDÉ luto.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Sí. Sí, estoy vivo, chica. Y lo siento. Quise llamar mil veces — Vik no me dejó. Dijo que 'Saka nos rastrearía a los dos de volada.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Sí. Sí, estoy vivo, mano. Y lo siento. Quise llamar mil veces — Vik no me dejó. Dijo que 'Saka nos rastrearía a los dos de volada.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Semanas, Jackie. Dejaste que creyera que ya NO ESTABAS.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Estoy tan enojada contigo que no puedo—  ...  ¿estás bien?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Lo sé. LO SÉ. Me merezco cada palabra. Ándale — dámelas todas. Lo aguanto mejor que una plancha en la morgue de Vik, je.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...De veras me asustaste, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "Entonces... háblame, V. ¿Por dónde empezamos, eh?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "Sí. Aquí estoy. Esta vez no me voy a ningún lado. ¿Qué más traes en la cabeza?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(en voz baja) ¿Algo más, chica?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(en voz baja) ¿Algo más, mano?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Basta de plática. Ven para acá — necesito verte con mis propios ojos.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "Tu moto. Sigue en mi garaje, ¿sabes?",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "Ha sido duro desde que te fuiste, viejo...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "¿Y cómo la has llevado allá en el desierto?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...Mi nave. Dios mío, no quería preguntar. Ándale, no me tortures, V — esa moto es lo único que me queda del Jackie de antes. Dime la verdad. ¿Está bien?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Tranquilo, hermano. Está sana y salva. Ven por ella.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "Sobre eso... me acostumbré a ella, Jackie. Me la voy a quedar.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Uf... Gracias, V. No tienes idea de lo que eso significa para mí. La mantuviste viva por mí todo este tiempo.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "Es tuya, Jackie. Siempre lo fue.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Je. (una larga pausa) Nel, nel — ¿sabes qué? Quédatela. Como yo lo veo, ella te mantuvo VIVA mientras yo no pude. Se te ganó, y tú te la ganaste. Solo no la dejes parada, V. Eso lo odia.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Je. (una larga pausa) Nel — ¿sabes qué? Quédatela, hermano. Ella te mantuvo VIVA mientras yo no pude. Solo no la dejes parada, V. Eso lo odia.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...La voy a cuidar. Te lo prometo.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "¿Duro cómo? Háblame, V. ¿Qué está pasando?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Todo se torció después de Konpeki. Es... complicado. Larga historia.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "Perdí más de lo que crees esa noche. Por poco me pierdo a mí misma también.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Mmm. ...Ya. Siempre te quedabas callada con las cosas pesadas, chica. Está bien. No insisto. Por ahora.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Mmm. ...Ya. Siempre te quedabas callado con las cosas pesadas, mano. Está bien. No insisto. Por ahora.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Te contaré todo. Solo que... no por teléfono.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(suspiro) ¿La verdad? Andar escondido acá me está desgastando hasta los huesos, V. Extraño la ciudad. Las luces, el ruido, la comida de mi Mamá. Quiero volver a casa. Pero no es tan sencillo.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "¿Por qué no? ¿Qué te tiene atorado allá?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Ese chip... lo que quedó dentro sigue funcionando. Un software de seguridad de Arasaka — manda mi ubicación como un faro. Así me encontraría 'Saka — por eso tengo que estar fuera de alcance. Vik trató de quitarlo. No pudo.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "Entonces encontramos a alguien que SÍ pueda. Un netrunner, un ripper — quien sea.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "Te lo vamos a sacar. No pienso perderte dos veces, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "¿De verdad harías eso? ... Claro que sí. Órale, chica. Buscamos a alguien que borre esta cosa. Quizá recupero mi vida.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "¿De verdad harías eso? ... Claro que sí. Órale, mano. Buscamos a alguien que borre esta cosa. Quizá recupero mi vida.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "Lo vamos a lograr. Pero eso es para mañana — ven para acá. Ahora.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "Lo vamos a lograr. No te preocupes. Te cuido las espaldas hasta entonces.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Tengo que ser franco contigo, choom. Después de lo que pasó... ya no puedo hacer trabajos pesados. El cuerpo no aguanta. ¿Y mi Mamá? (risita) Terminaría lo que 'Saka empezó si tan siquiera lo intentara.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Nadie te lo está pidiendo. Ya deja de dar largas y ven para acá, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Bien. Ya sangraste suficiente por esta ciudad.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...Sí. Sí, órale. Basta de plática. ¿Dónde estás? Nel — no te muevas, ya voy para allá. Aguanta, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...Sí. Sí, órale. Basta de plática. ¿Dónde estás? Nel — no te muevas, ya voy para allá. Aguanta, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "Órale. Aquí te espero. Apúrate.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Ya voy en camino, V. No te vayas a ningún lado. ...Te veo junto a la gasolinera.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Tú tampoco es que estés en tu mejor momento, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(solo lo miras un momento) ...Eres tú.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "Sí, sí — el desierto no le hace ningún favor a la cara de uno. ¿Pero tú? ...Chale. Eres un alivio para la vista, V. Extrañé esa cara más de lo que puedo decir.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "Sí, sí — el desierto no le hace ningún favor a la cara de uno. ¿Pero tú, hermano? Chale, qué gusto verte. Extrañé esa cara fea que tienes.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "Los dos seguimos de pie. Eso es lo que cuenta.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Espérate. Mi moto. ¿Todavía la tienes? ¿Todo este tiempo, la guardaste?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "Está en mi garaje, Jackie. Esperándote. Toma — tus llaves.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Así que de veras te la vas a quedar, ¿eh? (ríe) Órale, órale — entonces TÚ manejas, chica. Ándale. Muéstrame que estuvo en buenas manos.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Así que de veras te la vas a quedar, ¿eh? (ríe) Órale — entonces TÚ manejas, hermano. Ándale. Muéstrame que estuvo en buenas manos.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Súbete, Jackie. Vámonos a casa.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "La mantuviste andando por mí. Todo este tiempo... Chale, V. Ese es el último pedazo del Jackie de antes, ahí mero.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "Vámonos, hermano, y le puedes dar una vuelta.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Ándale, V. Vámonos a casa. ...Y oye — no más funerales. Por un buen rato, ¿va?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Ándale, hermano. Vámonos a casa. ...Y oye — no más funerales. Por un buen rato, ¿va?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... lo logramos. De verdad lo logramos. No lo puedo creer, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(recuperas el aliento) ...Sí. Lo logramos.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "Estamos vivos, chica. Los dos.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "Apenas he podido respirar desde Konpeki. ...Se siente bien parar un segundo.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Je... sí. Así es. ...Lástima que nadie va a saber que fuimos nosotros allá arriba.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "Por cierto -- ¿dónde guardaste el maletín?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...¿Jackie?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Lo tenía. Justo en mis manos, V, te lo juro que lo tenía...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "¡Jackie! El biochip -- el pinche maletín con el biochip, ¿¡dónde está!?",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "Traté de aferrarme a él, te lo juro. Smasher -- ese hijo de puta... Al maletín le entró un balazo, se abrió de par en par. El chip quedó hecho chatarra. Así que lo tiré. ...Lo siento, V. De verdad.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "¡Carajo! ¡Ese era nuestro boleto, Jackie! ¡Todo por lo que trabajamos!",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "¿La verdad? Esa cosa seguramente habría traído más problemas de lo que valía.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "Los dos seguimos respirando, cabrón. Ese es el único botín que importa.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "Sí... lo sé. Chinga'o. Pero oye -- sigues aquí para encabronarte por ello, ¿no?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Tú y yo. Nos echamos a Smasher y salimos caminando de Konpeki Plaza. Nadie se lo va a creer jamás.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...Sí. Tal vez tengas razón. La tecnología corpo así solo te compra una vida más corta.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Jeje sí. ¡Una historia para la posteridad, V!  \\n(Una pausa) Entonces... ¿Qué sigue?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "Lo que queramos, hermano. Por una vez, nadie escribe nuestra historia más que nosotros.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Je. Me gusta cómo suena eso. Ándale, pues. ¡Night City no se va a conquistar sola!",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Bar de fideos.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(rincón secreto para la siesta).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V: No voy a meter a Jackie en este desmadre. No después de todo lo que pasó.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "No puedo llamar a Jackie durante una misión principal — no lo voy a meter en esto.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "Ay, mierda...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "¡Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "Por suerte está despejado por ahora. Pero no hay que quedarnos.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "¿Es a— ese es Adam Smasher?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "¡Ay, MIERDA!",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "¡No nos vamos a morir — hoy no!",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. El AV del viejo Arasaka debería seguir estacionado en la azotea.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Ándale, V — larguémonos de aquí.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — instalado",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik llamó. Dejó un mensaje. Dice que tiene algo que contarte sobre Jackie — algo que no quiso decir por teléfono.\\n\\nVe a verlo a su clínica.\\n\\n(Para los ajustes del mod ve a Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik:",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Debí decírtelo hace mucho, y lamento no haberlo hecho. Jackie no murió en mi mesa esa noche. Le recuperé el pulso, pedí un favor, lo saqué antes de que Arasaka viniera a buscar el cuerpo. Está vivo, V — escondido allá en los Badlands, y así tiene que quedarse. El chamaco no tenía por qué sobrevivir a lo que sobrevivió. Y cuando pudo hablar otra vez, lo primero que preguntó fue si tú saliste con vida. Antes no era seguro decírtelo, V. Lo siento. Te marco el lugar en el mapa. Ve a traerlo de vuelta.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Debí decírtelo hace mucho, y lamento no haberlo hecho. Jackie no murió en mi mesa esa noche. Le recuperé el pulso, pedí un favor, lo saqué antes de que Arasaka viniera a buscar el cuerpo. Antes no era seguro decírtelo, V. Está vivo. Escondido allá en los Badlands — y así tiene que quedarse. Te ha estado esperando. Te marco el lugar en el mapa. Ve a traerlo de vuelta.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Chip — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Si estás leyendo esto, V, entonces el doc cumplió su palabra y te mandó para acá. Soy yo. Estoy vivo.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik me remendó y me sacó a escondidas antes de que 'Saka pudiera grabar mi nombre en una lápida. Ando escondido desde entonces.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mamá Welles se enojó tanto cuando se enteró. Creo que me mataría si volviera a hacer trabajos — quizá tenga razón. Se acabó la vida de mercenario para mí, V. En serio. Pero no podía dejar que siguieras creyendo que me habías enterrado.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Márcame cuando leas esto. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Encuentra a Jackie — Rocky Ridge, los Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Llama a Jackie",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Espera a Jackie",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie volvió.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Chip — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Ahora mantengo la carta de la Muerte boca abajo. No podía mirarla — por meses fue lo único que veía al cerrar los ojos.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Cuando Vik me dijo que lo había logrado, que estaba allá afuera respirando en los Badlands, me senté en el suelo de la tienda y lloré hasta que se consumió el incienso.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "No voy a fingir que solo estoy feliz, V. Algunas noches estoy tan enojada que podría gritar. Se metió en ese golpe sabiendo el riesgo. Casi nos deja. Casi me deja.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Pero las cartas no se equivocaron. Su hilo no se cortó. Solo se deshilachó... y aguantó.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Ten paciencia con él. Y gracias — por ir a traerlo a casa. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Chip — Mamá Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "Así que. Mi Jackie está vivo, y yo soy la última en enterarme. Espera a ser madre, V, y a que alguien te oculte algo así — entonces hablaremos del perdón.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "Le encendí una vela a ese muchacho todos los días. Le cociné a un fantasma. Y todo ese tiempo él allá en el polvo, respirando, dejándome llorar su muerte. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "Y aun así — está VIVO. Mi niño está vivo. No he parado de darle gracias a la Virgen desde que me enteré. Hasta las rodillas me duelen de tanto rezar.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Pero óyeme bien una vez, V: si vuelve a aceptar un trabajo como ese golpe — si arriesga la vida por dinero y gloria una vez más — no voy a esperar a que esta ciudad se lo lleve. Lo mato yo misma.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Tráemelo a mi mesa. Hay un plato esperando. Siempre ha habido un plato esperando. — Mamá Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Hablar",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Hablar con Jackie   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Llamando a Jackie...",
    ["No answer."] = "No contesta.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Ahí está. Siéntate, respira un poco — siempre andas en movimiento.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Ahí está. Siéntate, respira un poco — siempre andas en movimiento.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "Esperaba que te pasaras. No le digas a nadie que dije eso.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Ey. ...Nah, nada. Es solo que da gusto verte ahí de pie, nada más.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Ven acá.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "¿Cómo te trata de verdad la vida tranquila?",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "¿Te gusta atender la barra?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "¿Heywood todavía se siente como casa?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "¿No lo extrañas? La vida.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "¿Cómo va el cuerpo? En serio.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "¿Qué recuerdas de aquella noche?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "¿Todavía vas a ver a Vik?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "¿Tuviste miedo?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "¿Me culpas?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "¿Qué quieres ahora, Jackie?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Dilo. Sea lo que sea eso que llevas sin decir.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Bien. Lento. Lo lento cuesta acostumbrarse, pero está bien.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Días buenos. Y días en que me siento a media tarde porque mi cuerpo lo dice, y ya no discuto con él.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "¿La verdad? No duermo bien. Sobre las cuatro estoy despierto, tumbado escuchando el edificio. ...Pero estoy aquí para no dormir. Ese es el trato, y lo volvería a hacer.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "La barra, sobre todo. Y la gente me encuentra con sus problemas. Pequeños. Me gustan los pequeños.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Un chaval de la cuadra necesitaba encontrar a su hermano. Me llevó dos días y mucho hablar, y no dispararon a nadie. El mejor trabajo que he hecho, y no paga nada.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "Ah, es... tranquilo. Je. Ese es el chiste, ¿no? Resulta que la calma es una habilidad. Al principio se me daba fatal.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "Todavía me pillo escuchando por si algo sale mal. De pie en el bar a las dos de la tarde con un trapo en la mano, esperando un tiroteo que no llega. Va mejorando.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Ya le pillarás el truco.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Mejor que la alternativa.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Siempre podrías volver a la vida.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...No. No, V. A mí me sacaron cargando de ahí. A Mama la llamaron de noche. No le hago eso dos veces, y a ti tampoco. No me vuelvas a preguntar eso.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Lo siento. Tienes razón.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Lo entiendo.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "Encima mío. Dándome de comer. Haciendo como que no tiene miedo, que es justo como sé que lo tiene.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Me enciende una vela. A MÍ. Estoy sentado en su mesa y ella la enciende igual. Dice que es por la versión mía que no salió.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "No sabe ni la mitad de lo que pasó esa noche y nunca lo sabrá. Eso lo cargo yo para que ella no tenga que hacerlo. Eso lo entiendes, ¿verdad?",
    ["I understand."] = "Lo cargaría contigo si la dejaras.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "Es honesto. Nadie me ha sacado una pipa por servir mal una cerveza.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "Me sé la copa de cada uno y la mitad de sus penas. Resulta que eso también es una forma de poder. La forma lenta.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Siempre. Las mismas esquinas, las mismas abuelas gritando por las mismas ventanas.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Aunque ahora lo camino distinto. Antes caminaba como si algún día fuera a ser mío. Ahora solo... camino.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...Sí. Sí, lo extraño. Los tiros no. El *nosotros*. Que se nos ocurriera una tontería a las dos de la mañana y hacerla a las cuatro.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Extraño ser el tipo que lo arreglaba con solo cruzar la puerta. Esa es la parte que no sana, chica — no las costillas. Las costillas sanaron.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Extraño ser el tipo que lo arreglaba con solo cruzar la puerta. Esa es la parte que no sana, hermano — no las costillas. Las costillas sanaron.",
    ["We're still us."] = "Seguimos siendo nosotros.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "Nunca fuiste solo eso.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "¿La verdad? Rígido. Las mañanas frías son lo peor. Vik dice que eso es permanente y que me haga amigo de ello.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "Tengo una placa dentro, V. Noto dónde termina. Algunas noches me quedo con la mano encima, comprobando que sigue haciendo su trabajo. Eso es lo que tengo en lugar de una cicatriz de la que presumir.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "No tienes que hacer un chiste de eso.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "Sigues de pie.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Trozos. El coche. Tú gritando algo que no llegaba a oír. La voz de Dex en la línea y todo ya torciéndose.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Me acuerdo de tener frío y de pensar que era raro, porque era una noche cálida. Y me acuerdo de decidir que no iba a decir nada, porque tú ya tenías bastante encima. ...Fue una tontería. Debí decir algo.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "Deberías haber dicho algo.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Intentabas protegerme.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "No hagamos esto.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Una vez al mes. No me cobra, lo cual me vuelve loco, así que le llevo algo de la cocina de Mama y lo damos por saldado.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Ese hombre mantuvo la boca cerrada mucho tiempo para que yo pudiera seguir muerto. ¿Sabes lo que le cuesta eso a alguien como Vik? Lo cargó solo. Le debo más que las costillas.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...Sí. En el momento no — en el momento solo hay ruido y luego silencio. Después. Despertar en una habitación que no conocía, sin poder moverme, sin saber si tú saliste. Ese es el miedo que se quedó. Me costó mucho decirlo en voz alta.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Me alegra que lo hayas dicho.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "Yo también tuve miedo.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "¿Por qué? ¿Por el trabajo? V, yo *quería* ese trabajo. La mitad te la vendí YO. ¿Has estado cargando con eso todo este tiempo pensando que te lo echaría en cara? ...Nah. No. Ni una vez. Ni un segundo.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "Necesitaba oír eso.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Sigo cargando con ello.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "Pues suéltalo. Aquí mismo, ahora mismo — ya no tienes que arrastrar eso. Estoy de pie frente a ti. Mírame. Estoy aquí mismo, de pie.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...Vale.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Algo pequeño, creo. El bar. Los domingos donde Mama. Quizá un sitio con una ventana sin rejas. Antes quería mi nombre en algo. Ahora quiero durar lo bastante como para aburrirme. ¿Suena patético?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Suena a una vida.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "No tiene nada de patético.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...Fue lo primero que le pregunté a Vik. Antes que mi propio nombre, antes que qué me había pasado. Le pregunté si tú saliste. Dijo que sí, y me volví a apagar dos días. Todo lo demás que se llevó esa noche, eso no se lo llevó. Eso es lo que llevo sin decir.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "Yo también pregunté por ti, cada día.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Anda, ve. No me voy a ninguna parte — de eso va todo esto ahora.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Ey. Vuelve, ¿eh? Que no pase un mes.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Un Tequila Old Fashioned con un chorrito de cerveza y una guarnición de chile.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Un chupito de vodka con hielo, zumo de lima, cerveza de jengibre y, lo más importante... un chorrito de amor.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Tequila doble con granadina y lima. Nada mejor para ahogar los nervios.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "Ah, y por cierto, me llamo Jackie Welles. ¿Quieres apuntar mi receta?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "Tienes todo un numerito montado.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "¿Cómo te trata Night City?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "Ahhhh, adoro esta ciudad. La ciudad de las oportunidades infinitas. Y del odio fraternal.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "Es importante tener gente a la que acudir. Ya sabes, como, eh, familia. Igual encuentras la tuya aquí en Night City.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Puedes sacar a la rata de la corpo, pero nunca sacarás la corpo de la rata.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "Ya sabes... el efecto mariposa o lo que sea.",
    ["I found mine."] = "Yo ya encontré la mía.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Soy leal, constante en mis afectos…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Ella te esperó, ¿sabes?",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "¿Qué has estado viendo?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames! ¡Una iguana de verdad! Una, eh, de las Antillas Menores, creo.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "¡Sí! Vi un programa sobre ellas en la tele. Se extinguieron hace como treinta años. Son de las Antillas Menores.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "Has recorrido un largo camino, amigo escamoso.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "¿Te apuntas a un poco de tiro al blanco en RV?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "Ahora eres de documentales de naturaleza.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Una iguana.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "¿Ha venido alguien con un problema últimamente?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón tiene que aprender... que a la gente de Heywood no se la juega.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "Eso sigue siendo de fixer, Jackie.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Heywood tiene suerte de tenerte.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "El chaval de dos puertas más allá le debía pasta a quien no debía. No hizo falta un arma... hizo falta alguien que se sentara en una habitación y fuera lo más grande que había en ella. Resulta que eso sigo siendo yo.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Nadie lo apunta. Ni fixer, ni comisión, ni nombre en ningún tablón. Solo una señora llamando a la puerta del bar a las once de la noche porque no tiene a dónde ir. ...El mejor trabajo que he hecho nunca, y me daría vergüenza llamarlo trabajo.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Háblame de tu viejo.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "Desde luego, mejor que ser el hijo de Raúl Welles.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Se fue. Esa es toda la historia, y me costó treinta años resumirla así de corta. Mamá nunca habló mal de él, ni una sola vez... simplemente, en silencio, pasó a ser los dos.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "No te pareces en nada a él.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Hizo un trabajo de la hostia.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "¿De dónde sacaste tu código, Jackie?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Fíjate en los Valentinos. Siguen a Dios y a la Santa Madre. El honor significa algo para ellos.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "El mundo de las bandas no es muy complicado. La fuerza manda, el fuerte sobrevive.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Hoy te mandan a borrar a alguien. Mañana mandarán a otro a borrarte a ti.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "¿Sigues viviendo según eso?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "Por eso lo dejaste, ¿verdad?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "¿Todavía crees en todo eso? Dios, los santos.",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre siempre decía que la paciencia da sus frutos, así que…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Yo me morí, V. Como quieras decirlo: mi corazón se paró y las manos de alguien lo volvieron a arrancar. ¿Que si creo? Creo que ALGO sujetó la puerta un segundo. No necesito saber de quién era la mano.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "A Mama le alegraría oír eso.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "¿Piensas en morir?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "La muerte... no es más que el último floreo.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Antes lo decía como si fuera ingenioso. Lo dije una vez en un bar con una copa en la mano: todos tenemos que irnos alguna vez, ¿por qué no con estilo? Y luego me fui, V. Resulta que ahí no hay ningún estilo. Solo hay una habitación y otra persona haciendo el trabajo de mantenerte.",
    ["You're here now."] = "Ahora estás aquí.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "No te vayas otra vez, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "Va siendo hora de irnos, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "Muévete, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "¿Estás conmigo, chica?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "¿Estás conmigo, mano?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "¡Hermano! ¡Por fin!",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "No te preocupes por mí. Me las apaño.",
    ["You order."] = "Pide tú.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Quizá luego.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "Llevas ya un tiempo con Misty, ¿eh?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "Vale, ya está. Vamos.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "Yo también me alegro de verte, Jack. ¿Cómo te va?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "Necesito tu ayuda, Jack. Tengo un curro.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "Antes tengo que ocuparme de una cosa.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "Vámonos. No hay por qué esperar.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Cuídate, amigo.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "¿Qué está bueno para comer?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "¿Cómo te va? Aparte del curro, digo.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "Pensándolo bien, me tengo que ir.",
    ["See you around."] = "Nos vemos.",
    ["Need your help."] = "Necesito tu ayuda.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "¿Qué tal la Señora Welles?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "Me vendría bien una copa.",
    ["Take care."] = "Cuídate.",
    ["To this."] = "Por esto.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "A una copa gratis no le digo que no.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "¡Por llegar a las grandes ligas!",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "¿Qué te traes?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Dile a Misty que le mando saludos.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Yaaa…",
    ["How's things?"] = "¿Qué tal todo?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "¿Qué tienes para beber?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "¿Cómo está tu madre?",
    ["Talk later."] = "Hablamos luego.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Nada que merezca escribirse. Y eso es lo bueno, chica.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Nada que merezca escribirse. Y eso es lo bueno, hermano.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Me tomo una copa.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "¿Antillas Meno-qué?",
    ["Later."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Cuídate, tío.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Te llamo luego.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "Ya hablaremos.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "Sí, nos vemos.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Me tengo que ir.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "Nos vemos en las grandes ligas, Jack.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Adiós, viejo amigo.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Solo quería saber cómo, ya sabes, lo llevas.",
    ["Come on."] = "Vamos.",
    ["You got me too."] = "Y yo a ti.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Me quedo con esa victoria.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Te pega, Jackie.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "Las pequeñas también cuentan.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "Sigue siendo tu barrio.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Me alegra que estés aquí para decirlo.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Vik es buena gente.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "Se puede llamar así.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Amén a eso.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "Sentarse aún está en desarrollo",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "Se quedarán de pie en la mesa en vez de sentarse.\n\nLa animación de sentarse todavía no está ligada al mobiliario real: se reproduce allí donde esté el personaje, así que sentarlo automáticamente suele dejarlo flotando sobre la silla. De pie se veía mejor que flotando, así que de pie es lo predeterminado.\n\nPuedes sentarlo tú, y queda exactamente donde lo pongas: abre la superposición de CET, busca «NCLives - Companions» -> «Sitting - seat them by hand». Colócate sobre la silla mirando hacia donde deba mirar, pulsa «Seat them here», retrocede y ajusta los deslizadores de altura y ángulo hasta que quede bien.\n\nLevántalo con el mismo panel antes de mandarlo a casa.",
  },
  ["de"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "Das riecht nach ganz großem Ärger, V. Ich warte 'ne Minute — aber lass es, oder ich bin weg.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "Die Uhr läuft, hermana. Lass den dicken Fisch los, oder ich bin weg.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Das ist mein Mädchen. Der Konzern-Mist kann warten — ich bin noch bei dir.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "Die Mod ist geladen, konnte aber deinen Story-Fortschritt nicht auslesen und startet Jackies Questreihe daher nicht von selbst.\n\nWenn der Heist hinter dir liegt, starte sie über Esc -> Einstellungen -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Sprich mit mir, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "Kommst nicht oft her, was? Heheh. Schön, dich zu sehen, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "Wie fühlst du dich? Alles in Ordnung?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "Besser geht's nicht, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "Bereit, loszuziehen?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "Dann machen wir unser Ding.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "Zeit, dass wir los sind, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "Machen wir uns auf, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Hier wurde etwas für dich hinterlassen...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — danke, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Du hast 3.847 Eddies aus eigener Tasche bezahlt, um den ganzen Weg raus nach Rocky Ridge zu fahren — nur um herauszufinden, ob Jackie hier draußen wirklich noch atmet. Und dann hast du der ganzen Welt davon erzählt.\\n\\nAlso hier sind deine 3.847 Eddies zurück, ZEHNFACH erstattet: 38.470. Und Jackies Arch dazu.\\n\\nNiemand fährt solche Straßenkilometer für eine Mod, die er nicht liebt. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & das Jackie Lives Team",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "Willst du was essen gehen?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Iss was mit Jackie: Geh zu %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...und dann sag ich, wir gehen ins Afterlife, hahaha... Weißt schon, ein paar Shots.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Triff mich bei Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Genau so, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "Wie dem auch sei, was ist los?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "Warum, wozu die Eile?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Komm schon, gehen wir was essen.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "Ja, ich hab für heute genug, das kann ich dir sagen.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(Vielleicht nächstes Mal.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Mann, das kommt genau richtig. Keine Jobs, keine Schießerei — nur du an' ich.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Könnte mich an dieses ruhige Leben gewöhnen, weißt du?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Schön, mal 'ne Minute zu sitzen, was, chica?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Schön, mal 'ne Minute zu sitzen, was, hermano?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "Wie dem auch sei... was geht dir durch den Kopf, V?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "Vermisst du das Söldnerleben je, Jackie?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "Diese Stadt zermürbt mich in letzter Zeit.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "Glaubst du, Arasaka bezahlt je für das, was sie getan haben?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "Vermissen? Manche Tage. Den Kick, die Crew... aber es hat mehr genommen als gegeben, V. Das weißt du besser als jeder andere.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "Das Leben? Nö. Die guten Runs vielleicht. Nicht die Enden — wir haben beide gesehen, wie die laufen.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "Ja. Aber wir sind rausgekommen.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City ist es egal, ob du lebst oder stirbst, chica. Das Einzige, was du tun kannst, ist deine Leute finden und festhalten.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City ist es egal, ob du lebst oder stirbst, mano. Das Einzige, was du tun kannst, ist deine Leute finden und festhalten.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "Diese Stadt kaut jeden durch. Der Trick ist, sie dich nicht ganz verschlucken zu lassen. Du hast mich, ich hab dich — das ist der Trick.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka? Heh. So dicke Fische zahlen nie, V. Aber wir atmen noch und sie kennen unsere Namen nicht. Das ist ein Sieg.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "Corpo-Ratten landen immer auf den Füßen. Beste Rache ist gut zu leben — wie jetzt gerade, voller Teller vor uns.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty ist mein Anker, V. Hält mich am Aufblicken, wenn ich runterschauen will. Weiß nicht, was ich ohne sie wäre.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "Ich an' Misty? Grundsolide. Sie liest die Karten, sagt, die Sterne haben einen Plan. Ich sag ihr nur, dass sie mein Plan ist.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "Sie saß jede Woche, in der ich weg war, bei Mama, weißt du. Jede Woche. Das werd ich nie zurückzahlen können.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Sie tut dir gut.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Heh, na gut. Los geht's, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Heh, na gut. Los geht's, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "Ja, wir haben eine Stadt, auf die wir aufpassen müssen. Vamonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Direkt hinter dir, hermano. Bewegung.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Direkt zum Geschäft, was, mano?",
    ["Let's go."] = "Gehen wir.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, wie fühlst du dich? Alles in Ordnung?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Äh, du weißt ja, wie's ist, kann nicht klagen. Aber wir sind nicht hier, um über mich zu quatschen.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mama hat mir gesagt, gute Dinge kommen zu denen, die warten, und manche sind sogar gut!",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "Sie ist mein Blut, klar. Coyote ist ihre Kaschemme.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale, trinken wir was.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hey, V, lebst du noch? Wie läuft's in der Schlangengrube?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "Hier werden Legenden geboren.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Direkt zum Geschäft, was, chica?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "Vermisst du es? Das Söldnerleben?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "Das ist das Geschäft, V. Jeder hat Blut an den Händen. Man kommt damit klar, man macht weiter.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "Dann mach einen letzten leichten, einen Nebenjob, mit mir.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Heheh, darauf trink ich!",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "Ah, danke, Misty. Du bist die Beste.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "Hat Misty es kommen sehen? Dass du rauskommst?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Jetzt geh ich zurück, such Misty und wir machen was, das mich wieder lebendig fühlen lässt.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Bevor du das tust — hab 'nen Nebenjob, falls du Bock hast.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty wusste es... Misty weiß es immer...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "Sagen die Karten, dass du mir bei 'nem Job hilfst?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Bin direkt hinter dir.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "Und? Bist du bereit?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "Kommst nicht oft her, was? Heheh. Schön, dich zu sehen, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hey, V – lebst du noch? Wie läuft's in der Schlangengrube?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica! Endlich!",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "Kommst nicht oft her, was? Heheh. Schön, dich zu sehen, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hey V - lebst du noch? Wie läuft's in der Schlangengrube?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V, hey! Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Wurde auch Zeit.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "Kommst nachschauen, ob ich nicht in irgendeinem Müllcontainer verrotte, wie die meisten der Welles-Jungs?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Vergiss es.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Halt durch, V, ich komme.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "Ja, okay.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "Na gut, na gut, na gut.",
    ["You're all right."] = "Du bist in Ordnung.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Endlich passiert was...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Zu spät, jetzt noch zurückzuziehen. Komm schon, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "Und wir sollten besser schnell sein.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "Kommst du? Zeit ist kostbar.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "Wir brechen ihnen das Genick, bevor sie's merken.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Heh, das Rathaus sollte uns verdammt nochmal danken!",
    ["Finally!"] = "Endlich!",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...Jackie? Bist du das wirklich?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "Ich bin's, V. Hab ewig auf dieses Telefon gestarrt und mich gefragt, ob du je anrufst.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Du Hurensohn. Du LEBST?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Ich hab dich begraben. Ich hab um dich GETRAUERT.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Ja. Ja, ich lebe, chica. Und es tut mir leid. Wollte tausendmal anrufen — Vik hat mich nicht gelassen. Sagte, 'Saka würde es direkt zu uns beiden zurückverfolgen.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Ja. Ja, ich lebe, mano. Und es tut mir leid. Wollte tausendmal anrufen — Vik hat mich nicht gelassen. Sagte, 'Saka würde es direkt zu uns beiden zurückverfolgen.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Wochen, Jackie. Du hast mich glauben lassen, du wärst WEG.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Ich bin so sauer auf dich, dass ich nicht—  ...  dir geht's gut?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Ich weiß. ICH WEISS. Ich hab jedes Wort verdient. Komm schon — gib's mir. Ich vertrag's besser als 'ne Bahre in Viks Leichenhalle, heh.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...Du hast mir echt Angst gemacht, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "Also... sprich mit mir, V. Wo fangen wir überhaupt an, hm?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "Ja. Ich bin da. Geh diesmal nirgendwohin. Was geht dir sonst noch durch den Kopf?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(leise) Noch was, chica?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(leise) Noch was, mano?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Genug geredet. Komm her — ich muss dich mit eigenen Augen sehen.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "Dein Bike. Es steht immer noch in meiner Garage, weißt du.",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "Es war hart, seit du weg bist, Mann...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "Also, wie hältst du dich da draußen in der Wüste?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...Mein Bike. Dios mío, ich wollte nicht fragen. Komm schon, quäl mich nicht, V — dieses Bike ist das eine Stück vom alten Ich, das mir geblieben ist. Sag's mir einfach direkt. Geht's ihr gut?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Entspann dich, hermano. Ihr geht's bestens. Komm sie abholen.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "Was das angeht... ich hab mich an sie gewöhnt, Jackie. Ich behalte sie.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Puh... Gracias, V. Du hast keine Ahnung, was mir das bedeutet. Hast sie die ganze Zeit für mich am Laufen gehalten.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "Sie gehört dir, Jackie. War schon immer so.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Heh. (eine lange Pause) Nö, nö — weißt du was? Behalt sie. So wie ich's sehe, hat sie DICH am Atmen gehalten, als ich's nicht konnte. Sie hat dich verdient, an' du hast sie verdient. Lass sie nur nicht stehen, V. Das hasst sie.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Heh. (eine lange Pause) Nö — weißt du was? Behalt sie, hermano. Sie hat DICH am Atmen gehalten, als ich's nicht konnte. Lass sie nur nicht stehen, V. Das hasst sie.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...Ich kümmere mich um sie. Versprochen.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "Hart wie? Sprich mit mir, V. Was ist los?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Nach Konpeki ging alles schief. Es ist.. kompliziert. Lange Geschichte.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "Ich hab mehr verloren, als du weißt, in jener Nacht. Hab verdammt fast mich selbst auch verloren.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...Klar. Bei den schweren Sachen bist du immer still geworden, chica. Schon gut. Ich dräng nicht. Vorerst.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...Klar. Bei den schweren Sachen bist du immer still geworden, mano. Schon gut. Ich dräng nicht. Vorerst.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Ich erzähl dir alles. Nur... nicht am Telefon.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(seufz) Ehrlich? Das Untertauchen hier draußen zermürbt mich zu nichts, V. Vermisse die Stadt. Die Lichter, den Lärm, Mamas Kochen. Ich will nach Hause. Aber so einfach ist das nicht.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "Warum nicht? Was hält dich da draußen fest?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Dieser Chip... was auch immer drin zurückblieb, läuft noch. Irgendeine Arasaka-Sicherheitssoft - funkt raus, wo ich bin, wie ein Leuchtfeuer. So würde 'Saka mich finden — deshalb muss ich außer Reichweite bleiben. Vik hat versucht, ihn rauszuschneiden. Ging nicht.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "Dann finden wir jemanden, der es KANN. Einen Netrunner, einen Ripper — irgendwen.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "Wir kriegen ihn aus dir raus. Ich verliere dich nicht zweimal, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Würdest du das wirklich tun? ... Natürlich würdest du. Na gut, chica. Wir finden jemanden, der das Ding löschen kann. Vielleicht krieg ich mein Leben zurück.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Würdest du das wirklich tun? ... Natürlich würdest du. Na gut, mano. Wir finden jemanden, der das Ding löschen kann. Vielleicht krieg ich mein Leben zurück.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "Wir kriegen das hin. Aber das ist was für morgen — komm her. Jetzt.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "Wir kriegen das hin. Keine Sorge. Ich pass bis dahin auf dich auf.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Muss ehrlich mit dir sein, choom. Nach dem, was passiert ist... kann ich keine ernsten Jobs mehr machen. Der Körper macht's nicht mit. An' Mama? (kichert) Sie würde vollenden, was 'Saka angefangen hat, wenn ich's auch nur versuchte.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Niemand verlangt das von dir. Jetzt hör auf zu trödeln und komm her, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Gut. Du hast genug für diese Stadt geblutet.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...Ja. Ja, okay. Genug geplaudert. Wo bist du? Nö — beweg dich nicht, ich bin schon auf dem Weg zu dir. Halt durch, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...Ja. Ja, okay. Genug geplaudert. Wo bist du? Nö — beweg dich nicht, ich bin schon auf dem Weg zu dir. Halt durch, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "Okay. Ich bin gleich hier. Beeil dich.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Ich bin schon unterwegs, V. Geh ja nirgendwohin. ...Wir sehen uns bei der Tankstelle.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Du siehst selbst auch schon mal besser aus, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(schau ihn einen Moment einfach an) ...Du bist es.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "Ja, ja — die Wüste tut dem Aussehen keine Gefallen. Aber du? ...Verdammt. Ein Anblick für müde Augen, V. Hab dieses Gesicht mehr vermisst, als ich Worte hab.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "Ja, ja — die Wüste tut dem Aussehen keine Gefallen. Aber du, hermano? Verdammt, was für ein Anblick. Hab deine hässliche Visage vermisst.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "Wir stehen beide noch. Das ist, was zählt.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Moment mal. Mein Bike. Hast du sie noch? Die ganze Zeit, hast du sie behalten?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "Sie ist in meiner Garage, Jackie. Wartet auf dich. Hier — deine Schlüssel.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Also behältst du sie wirklich, was. (lacht) Na gut, na gut — dann FÄHRST du, chica. Komm schon. Zeig mir, dass sie in guten Händen war.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Also behältst du sie wirklich, was. (lacht) Na gut — dann FÄHRST du, hermano. Komm schon. Zeig mir, dass sie in guten Händen war.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Steig auf, Jackie. Fahren wir nach Hause.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "Du hast sie für mich am Laufen gehalten. Die ganze Zeit... Verdammt, V. Das ist das letzte Stück vom alten Ich, genau da.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "Fahren wir, hermano, und du kannst 'ne Runde mit ihr drehen.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Komm schon, V. Fahren wir nach Hause. ...Und hey — keine Beerdigungen mehr. Für 'ne gute lange Weile, ja?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Komm schon, hermano. Fahren wir nach Hause. ...Und hey — keine Beerdigungen mehr. Für 'ne gute lange Weile, ja?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... wir haben's geschafft. Wir haben's echt geschafft. Kann's nicht glauben, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(hol Luft) ...Ja. Haben wir.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "Wir leben, chica. Wir beide.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "Kaum Luft geholt seit Konpeki. ...Fühlt sich gut an, mal 'ne Sekunde anzuhalten.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Heh... ja. Tut's. ...Schade, dass nie jemand erfahren wird, dass wir das da oben waren.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "Übrigens -- wo hast du den Koffer verstaut?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...Jackie?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Ich hatte ihn. Direkt in meinen Händen, V, ich schwör's...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie! Der Biochip -- der verdammte Koffer mit dem Biochip, wo ist er?!",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "Ich hab versucht, ihn festzuhalten, ich schwör's. Smasher -- dieser hijo de puta... Der Koffer hat 'ne Kugel abgekriegt, ist weit aufgeplatzt. Chip ist Schrott. Also hab ich ihn fallen lassen. ...Es tut mir leid, V. Wirklich.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "Scheiße! Das war unsere Fahrkarte, Jackie! Alles, wofür wir gearbeitet haben!",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "Ehrlich? Das Ding hätte wohl mehr Ärger gemacht, als es wert war.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "Wir atmen beide noch, cabrón. Das ist der einzige Coup, der zählt.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "Ja... ich weiß. Chinga'o. Aber hey -- du bist immer noch hier, um dich drüber aufzuregen, oder?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Du und ich. Haben Smasher erledigt und sind aus dem Konpeki Plaza rausspaziert. Das wird nie jemand glauben.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...Ja. Vielleicht hast du recht. Corpo-Tech wie die kauft dir immer nur ein kürzeres Leben.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Hehe ja. Eine Geschichte für die Ewigkeit, V!  \\n(Eine Pause) Also... Was kommt als Nächstes?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "Was auch immer wir wollen, hermano. Zur Abwechslung schreibt niemand unsere Geschichte außer uns.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Heh. Das klingt gut. Komm schon, dann. Night City erobert sich nicht von selbst!",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Nudelbar.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(geheimer Nickerchen-Platz).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V: Zieh Jackie nicht in dieses Schlamassel rein. Nicht nach allem, was er durchgemacht hat.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "Kann Jackie nicht während einer Hauptmission anrufen — zieh ihn da nicht mit rein.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "Oh, Scheiße...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "Zum Glück gerade alles frei. Sollten aber nicht rumhängen.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "Ist da— ist das Adam Smasher?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "Oh, SCHEISSE!",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "Wir sterben nicht — nicht heute!",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. Der AV vom alten Arasaka sollte noch auf dem Dach geparkt sein.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Komm schon, V — nichts wie raus hier.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — installiert",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik hat angerufen. Hat eine Nachricht hinterlassen. Sagt, er hat dir etwas über Jackie zu erzählen — etwas, das er nicht am Telefon sagen wollte.\\n\\nBesuch ihn in seiner Klinik.\\n\\n(Für die Mod-Einstellungen geh zu Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik:",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Ich hätte es dir schon vor langer Zeit sagen sollen, und es tut mir leid, dass ich's nicht getan hab. Jackie ist in jener Nacht nicht auf meinem Tisch gestorben. Ich hab den Puls zurückgeholt, einen Gefallen eingefordert, ihn rausgeschafft, bevor Arasaka nach der Leiche suchte. Er lebt, V — hält sich draußen in den Badlands versteckt, und das muss so bleiben. Der Junge hatte nichts zu suchen, das zu überleben, was er überlebt hat. Und als er wieder reden konnte, war das Erste, was er fragte, ob du rausgekommen bist. Es war vorher einfach nicht sicher, es dir zu sagen, V. Es tut mir leid. Ich markiere die Stelle auf deiner Karte. Geh und hol ihn zurück.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Ich hätte es dir schon vor langer Zeit sagen sollen, und es tut mir leid, dass ich's nicht getan hab. Jackie ist in jener Nacht nicht auf meinem Tisch gestorben. Ich hab den Puls zurückgeholt, einen Gefallen eingefordert, ihn rausgeschafft, bevor Arasaka nach der Leiche suchte. Es war vorher einfach nicht sicher, es dir zu sagen, V. Er lebt. Hält sich draußen in den Badlands versteckt — und das muss so bleiben. Er hat auf dich gewartet. Ich markiere die Stelle auf deiner Karte. Geh und hol ihn zurück.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Chip — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Wenn du das liest, V, dann hat der Doc Wort gehalten und dich hierher geschickt. Ich bin's. Ich lebe.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik hat mich zusammengeflickt und rausgeschmuggelt, bevor 'Saka meinen Namen auf 'ne Grabplatte stempeln konnte. Halt mich seitdem versteckt.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mama Welles war so wütend, als sie's hörte. Glaub, sie würde mich umbringen, wenn ich wieder Jobs machen würde — vielleicht hat sie recht. Ich bin fertig mit dem Söldnerleben, V. Wirklich. Aber ich konnte dich nicht weiter glauben lassen, dass du mich begraben hast.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Ruf mich an, wenn du das liest. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Finde Jackie — Rocky Ridge, die Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Jackie anrufen",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Auf Jackie warten",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie ist zurück.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Chip — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Ich lasse die Tod-Karte jetzt verdeckt liegen. Konnte sie nicht ansehen — monatelang war sie alles, was ich sah, wenn ich die Augen schloss.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Als Vik mir sagte, dass er's geschafft hatte, dass er da draußen in den Badlands atmete, setzte ich mich auf den Ladenboden und weinte, bis der Weihrauch abgebrannt war.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "Ich tu nicht so, als wäre ich nur glücklich, V. Manche Nächte bin ich so wütend, dass ich schreien könnte. Er ging in diesen Coup mit dem Wissen um das Risiko. Er hätte uns fast verlassen. Fast mich verlassen.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Aber die Karten hatten nicht unrecht. Sein Faden riss nicht. Er franste nur aus... und hielt.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Sei nachsichtig mit ihm. Und danke — dass du losgezogen bist, um ihn heimzuholen. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Chip — Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "Also. Mein Jackie lebt, und ich bin die Letzte, die davon erfährt. Warte, bis du Mutter bist, V, und jemand hält so etwas vor dir geheim — dann reden wir über Vergebung.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "Ich hab diesem Jungen jeden einzelnen Tag eine Kerze angezündet. Ich hab für ein Gespenst gekocht. Und die ganze Zeit ist er da draußen im Staub, atmend, und lässt mich trauern. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "Und trotzdem — er LEBT. Mein Junge lebt. Ich hab nicht aufgehört, der Jungfrau zu danken, seit ich's gehört hab. Meine Knie sind wund davon.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Aber hör mir dieses eine Mal zu, V: Wenn er je wieder einen Job wie diesen Coup annimmt — sein Leben für Eddies und Ruhm noch einmal riskiert — werde ich nicht warten, bis diese Stadt ihn holt. Ich bring ihn selbst um.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Bring ihn an meinen Tisch. Ein Teller wartet. Es hat immer ein Teller gewartet. — Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Reden",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Mit Jackie reden   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Rufe Jackie an...",
    ["No answer."] = "Keine Antwort.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Da ist sie ja. Setz dich, atme mal durch — du bist ja immer in Bewegung.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Da ist er ja. Setz dich, atme mal durch — du bist ja immer in Bewegung.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "Hab gehofft, dass du vorbeikommst. Sag das bloß keinem.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Hey. ...Nee, nichts. Ist einfach gut, dich da stehen zu sehen, mehr nicht.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Komm her.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "Wie geht's dir mit dem ruhigen Leben? Wirklich.",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "Gefällt dir die Arbeit hinterm Tresen?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "Fühlt sich Heywood noch wie Zuhause an?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "Fehlt's dir manchmal? Das Leben.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "Wie hält der Körper durch? Ehrlich.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "Woran erinnerst du dich von der Nacht?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "Gehst du noch zu Vik?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "Hattest du Angst?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "Gibst du mir die Schuld?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "Was willst du jetzt, Jackie?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Sag's. Was immer es ist, das du dauernd nicht sagst.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Gut. Langsam. Langsam ist 'ne Umstellung, aber es ist gut.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Manche Tage gut. An manchen setz ich mich mitten am Nachmittag hin, weil mein Körper das sagt, und ich streite nicht mehr mit ihm.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "Ehrlich? Ich schlaf nicht richtig. Um vier bin ich wach und lieg da und hör dem Haus zu. ...Aber ich bin hier, um nicht zu schlafen. Das ist der Handel, und ich würd ihn wieder eingehen.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "Meistens die Bar. Und die Leute finden mich mit ihren Problemen. Kleinen. Ich mag die kleinen.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Ein Junge aus der Straße hat seinen Bruder gesucht. Hat mich zwei Tage und viel Reden gekostet, und keiner wurde erschossen. Beste Arbeit meines Lebens, und sie zahlt nichts.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "Ach, es ist... ruhig. Heh. Das ist ja der Witz, oder? Ruhe ist 'ne Fähigkeit, stellt sich raus. Am Anfang war ich schlecht darin.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "Ich ertapp mich dauernd dabei, dass ich darauf lausche, ob was schiefgeht. Steh um zwei nachmittags mit 'nem Lappen in der Hand in der Bar und wart auf 'ne Schießerei, die nicht kommt. Wird besser.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Du kriegst den Dreh schon raus.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Besser als die Alternative.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Du könntest jederzeit zurück ins Leben.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...Nein. Nein, V. Man hat mich da rausgetragen. Mama hat nachts einen Anruf gekriegt. Das tu ich ihr kein zweites Mal an, und dir auch nicht. Frag mich das nie wieder.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Tut mir leid. Du hast recht.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Ich verstehe.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "Bemuttert mich. Füttert mich. Tut so, als hätte sie keine Angst, und genau daran merk ich, dass sie Angst hat.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Sie zündet eine Kerze für mich an. Für MICH. Ich sitz direkt an ihrem Tisch und sie zündet sie trotzdem an. Sagt, die ist für die Version von mir, die's nicht rausgeschafft hat.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "Sie weiß nicht mal die Hälfte von dem, was in der Nacht passiert ist, und sie wird's nie erfahren. Das trag ich, damit sie's nicht muss. Das verstehst du doch, oder?",
    ["I understand."] = "Sie würde es mit dir tragen, wenn du sie ließest.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "Es ist ehrlich. Wegen 'nem schlecht gezapften Bier hat noch keiner 'ne Knarre auf mich gerichtet.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "Ich kenn den Drink von jedem und die Hälfte ihrer Sorgen. Stellt sich raus, das ist auch 'ne Art Macht. Nur die langsame.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Immer schon. Dieselben Ecken, dieselben abuelas, die aus denselben Fenstern schreien.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Ich laufe da jetzt aber anders durch. Früher lief ich, als würde es mir eines Tages gehören. Jetzt laufe ich einfach... durch.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...Ja. Ja, es fehlt mir. Nicht das Schießen. Das *Wir*. Um zwei Uhr nachts auf was Blödes kommen und es um vier machen.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Mir fehlt der Typ, der's richten konnte, indem er zur Tür reinkam. Das ist der Teil, der nicht heilt, chica — nicht die Rippen. Die Rippen sind verheilt.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Mir fehlt der Typ, der's richten konnte, indem er zur Tür reinkam. Das ist der Teil, der nicht heilt, hermano — nicht die Rippen. Die Rippen sind verheilt.",
    ["We're still us."] = "Wir sind immer noch wir.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "Du warst nie nur das.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "Ehrlich? Steif. Kalte Morgen sind das Schlimmste. Vik sagt, das bleibt, und ich soll mich damit anfreunden.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "Da ist 'ne Platte in mir, V. Ich spür, wo sie aufhört. Manche Nächte lieg ich da mit der Hand drauf und prüf, ob sie noch ihren Job macht. Das hab ich statt 'ner Narbe, mit der man angeben kann.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "Du musst keinen Witz draus machen.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "Du stehst noch.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Bruchstücke. Der Wagen. Du hast irgendwas gerufen, das ich nicht verstanden hab. Dex' Stimme in der Leitung und alles lief schon schief.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Ich weiß noch, dass mir kalt war und dass ich das seltsam fand, weil es 'ne warme Nacht war. Und ich weiß noch, dass ich beschlossen hab, nichts zu sagen, weil du schon genug am Hals hattest. ...Das war dumm. Ich hätte was sagen sollen.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "Du hättest was sagen sollen.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Du wolltest mich beschützen.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "Lass uns das nicht machen.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Einmal im Monat. Er nimmt kein Geld von mir, was mich wahnsinnig macht, also bring ich ihm was aus Mamas Küche mit und wir nennen es quitt.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Der Mann hat lange den Mund gehalten, damit ich tot bleiben konnte. Weißt du, was das einen wie Vik kostet? Er hat's allein getragen. Ich schulde ihm mehr als die Rippen.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...Ja. Nicht in dem Moment — in dem Moment ist es nur laut und dann still. Danach. Aufwachen in 'nem Raum, den ich nicht kannte, mich nicht bewegen können, nicht wissen, ob du rausgekommen bist. Das ist die Angst, die geblieben ist. Hat lang gedauert, bis ich das laut sagen konnte.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Ich bin froh, dass du's gesagt hast.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "Ich hatte auch Angst.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "Wofür denn? Für den Job? V, ich *wollte* den Job. Die Hälfte davon hab ich DIR eingeredet. Du schleppst das die ganze Zeit mit dir rum und denkst, ich würd's dir vorwerfen? ...Nee. Nein. Kein einziges Mal. Keine Sekunde.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "Das musste ich hören.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Ich trag es trotzdem.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "Dann leg's ab. Genau hier, genau jetzt — du musst das nicht mehr rumschleppen. Ich steh vor dir. Sieh mich an. Ich steh genau hier.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...Okay.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Was Kleines, glaub ich. Die Bar. Sonntag bei Mama. Vielleicht 'ne Wohnung mit 'nem Fenster ohne Gitter. Früher wollte ich meinen Namen auf irgendwas. Jetzt will ich lang genug da sein, um mich zu langweilen. Klingt das erbärmlich?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Das klingt nach einem Leben.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "Daran ist nichts erbärmlich.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...Das war das Erste, was ich Vik gefragt hab. Vor meinem eigenen Namen, vor dem, was mit mir passiert ist. Ich hab ihn gefragt, ob du rausgekommen bist. Er sagte ja, und ich bin für zwei Tage wieder weggetreten. Was die Nacht sonst genommen hat — das hat sie nicht genommen. Das ist das, was ich dauernd nicht sage.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "Ich hab auch nach dir gefragt, jeden Tag.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Los. Ich geh nirgendwo hin — das ist ja jetzt der ganze Sinn an mir.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Hey. Komm wieder, ja? Lass nicht gleich 'nen Monat vergehen.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Ein Tequila Old Fashioned mit einem Schuss Cerveza und Chili als Garnitur.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Ein Shot Wodka auf Eis, Limettensaft, Ginger Beer und, am wichtigsten... ein Schuss Liebe.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Doppelter Tequila mit Grenadine und Limette. Nichts Besseres, um die Nerven zu ertränken.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "Ach, übrigens, ich heiße Jackie Welles. Willst du dir mein Rezept aufschreiben?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "Du hast da echt 'ne ganze Nummer draus gemacht.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "Wie behandelt dich Night City?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "Ahhhh, ich liebe diese Stadt. Die Stadt der unendlichen Möglichkeiten. Und des brüderlichen Hasses.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "Es ist wichtig, Leute zu haben, an die man sich wenden kann. Weißt schon, sowas wie... Familie. Vielleicht findest du deine hier in Night City.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Du kriegst die Ratte aus dem Konzern raus, aber den Konzern nie aus der Ratte.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "Weißt schon... Schmetterlingseffekt oder so.",
    ["I found mine."] = "Meine hab ich gefunden.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Ich bin treu, beständig in meinen Gefühlen…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Sie hat gewartet, weißt du.",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "Was guckst du in letzter Zeit?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames! Ein echter Leguan! So einer, äh, von den Kleinen Antillen, glaub ich.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "Ja! Hab 'ne Sendung über die im TV gesehen. Vor etwa dreißig Jahren ausgestorben. Kommen von den Kleinen Antillen.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "Du hast einen weiten Weg hinter dir, mein schuppiger Freund.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "Lust auf ein bisschen Zielübung in VR?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "Du bist jetzt also Naturdoku-Typ.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Ein Leguan.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "Ist in letzter Zeit jemand mit einem Problem zu dir gekommen?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón muss lernen... dass man Leute in Heywood nicht verarscht.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "Das ist immer noch Fixer-Arbeit, Jackie.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Heywood kann froh sein, dich zu haben.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "Der Junge zwei Türen weiter schuldete dem Falschen was. Dafür brauchte es keine Knarre — es brauchte jemanden, der sich in einen Raum setzt und das Größte darin ist. Stellt sich raus, das bin immer noch ich.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Keiner schreibt das auf. Kein Fixer, keine Provision, kein Name auf irgendeinem Brett. Bloß 'ne Frau, die nachts um elf an die Bartür klopft, weil sie sonst nirgendwo hinkann. ...Die beste Arbeit, die ich je gemacht hab, und es wär mir peinlich, sie Arbeit zu nennen.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Erzähl mir von deinem alten Herrn.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "Verdammt noch mal besser, als der Sohn von Raúl Welles zu sein.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Er ist gegangen. Das ist die ganze Geschichte, und ich hab dreißig Jahre gebraucht, um sie so kurz zu kriegen. Mama hat nie schlecht über ihn geredet, kein einziges Mal — sie ist einfach still hingegangen und war dann beide.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "Du bist überhaupt nicht wie er.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Sie hat verdammt gute Arbeit geleistet.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "Wo hast du deinen Kodex her, Jackie?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Nimm die Valentinos. Die folgen Gott und der Santa Madre. Ehre bedeutet denen was.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "Die Gangwelt ist nicht sonderlich kompliziert. Macht ist Recht, die Starken überleben.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Heute lassen sie dich jemanden auslöschen. Morgen lassen sie jemand anderen dich auslöschen.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "Lebst du immer noch danach?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "Deshalb bist du ausgestiegen, oder?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "Glaubst du noch an das alles? Gott, die Heiligen?",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre hat immer gesagt, Geduld zahlt sich aus, also…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Ich bin gestorben, V. Wie du's auch drehst — mein Herz hat aufgehört und irgendwelche Hände haben es wieder in Gang gebracht. Ob ich glaube? Ich glaube, IRGENDWAS hat für 'ne Sekunde die Tür aufgehalten. Wessen Hand das war, muss ich nicht wissen.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "Mama würde sich freuen, das zu hören.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "Denkst du ans Sterben?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "Der Tod... ist nichts weiter als die letzte Verzierung.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Früher hab ich das gesagt, als wär's clever. Hab's mal in 'ner Bar gesagt, mit 'nem Drink in der Hand — jeder muss irgendwann gehen, warum nicht mit Stil. Und dann bin ich gegangen, V. Stellt sich raus, da ist kein Stil drin. Da ist nur ein Raum und jemand anders, der die Arbeit macht, dich zu halten.",
    ["You're here now."] = "Du bist jetzt hier.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "Geh nicht noch mal, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "Zeit, dass wir los sind, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "Los geht's, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "Bist du bei mir, chica?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "Bist du bei mir, mano?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "Hermano! Endlich!",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "Mach dir keine Sorgen um mich. Ich komm allein klar.",
    ["You order."] = "Bestell du.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Vielleicht später.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "Du bist schon 'ne Weile mit Misty zusammen, hm?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "Okay, bereit. Los geht's.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "Freut mich auch, dich zu sehen, Jack. Wie läuft's?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "Brauch deine Hilfe, Jack. Hab 'nen Job.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "Muss vorher noch was erledigen.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "Fahren wir. Warten bringt nichts.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Mach's gut, Amigo.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "Was ist hier gut?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "Wie läuft's? Abseits vom Geschäft, mein ich.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "Ach, ich muss doch los.",
    ["See you around."] = "Man sieht sich.",
    ["Need your help."] = "Brauch deine Hilfe.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "Was macht Señora Welles?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "'N Drink wär jetzt gut.",
    ["Take care."] = "Pass auf dich auf.",
    ["To this."] = "Auf das hier.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "Zu 'nem Freigetränk sag ich nicht Nein.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "Auf die große Liga!",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "Was treibst du so?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Grüß Misty von mir.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Aaalles klar…",
    ["How's things?"] = "Wie läuft's so?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "Was hast du zu trinken da?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "Wie geht's deiner Mutter?",
    ["Talk later."] = "Reden wir später.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Nichts, was der Rede wert wär. Genau das ist der Punkt, Chica.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Nichts, was der Rede wert wär. Genau das ist der Punkt, Hermano.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Ich nehm 'nen Drink.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "Kleine Antil-was?",
    ["Later."] = "Bis dann.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Pass auf dich auf, Mann.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Ich ruf später zurück.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "Wir reden später.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "Ja, bis dann.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Muss los.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "Man sieht sich in der großen Liga, Jack.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Leb wohl, alter Freund.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Wollte nur wissen, wie du, na ja, so klarkommst.",
    ["Come on."] = "Komm schon.",
    ["You got me too."] = "Und du mich auch.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Den Sieg nehme ich.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Steht dir, Jackie.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "Die kleinen zählen auch.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "Immer noch dein Revier.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Schön, dass du hier bist, um das zu sagen.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Vik ist einer von den Guten.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "Man kann es so nennen.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Dem ist nichts hinzuzufügen.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "Das Hinsetzen ist noch in Arbeit",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "Sie stehen am Tisch, statt sich zu setzen.\n\nDie Sitz-Animation ist noch nicht an echte Möbel gebunden — sie läuft dort ab, wo die Figur gerade steht, weshalb automatisches Hinsetzen sie meist über dem Stuhl schweben lässt. Stehen sah besser aus als Schweben, also ist Stehen die Voreinstellung.\n\nDu kannst sie selbst setzen, und zwar genau dorthin, wo du sie hinstellst: Öffne das CET-Overlay, wähle „NCLives - Companions“ -> „Sitting - seat them by hand“. Stell dich auf den Stuhl, in die Richtung, in die sie schauen sollen, drücke „Seat them here“, tritt zurück und justiere Höhe und Winkel mit den Reglern.\n\nStell sie mit demselben Panel wieder hin, bevor du sie nach Hause schickst.",
  },
  ["fr"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "Ça sent les gros ennuis, V. J'attends une minute — mais laisse tomber, ou je me casse.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "Le temps tourne, hermana. Lâche le gros poisson ou je m'en vais.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Voilà ma fille. Le bordel corpo peut attendre — je reste avec toi.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "Le mod est chargé, mais il n'a pas pu lire ta progression dans l'histoire, donc il ne lancera pas la quête de Jackie tout seul.\n\nUne fois le braquage derrière toi, lance-la depuis Esc -> Paramètres -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Parle-moi, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "Tu viens pas souvent par ici, hein ? Héhé. Content de te voir, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "Comment tu te sens ? Ça va ?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "Y a rien de mieux, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "Prête à bouger ?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "Alors faisons notre truc.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "Il est temps qu'on y aille, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "On bouge, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Quelqu'un t'a laissé quelque chose ici...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — merci, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Tu as payé 3 847 eddies de ta propre poche pour rouler jusqu'à Rocky Ridge — juste pour découvrir si Jackie respirait vraiment encore ici. Et ensuite t'es allé le raconter au monde entier.\\n\\nAlors voici tes 3 847 eddies en retour, rendus AU DÉCUPLE : 38 470. Et l'Arch de Jackie avec.\\n\\nPersonne se tape autant de kilomètres pour un mod qu'il n'aime pas. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie et l'équipe de Jackie Lives",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "Envie d'aller manger un morceau ?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Va manger un morceau avec Jackie : Rends-toi à %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...et ensuite je dis qu'on se fait l'Afterlife, hahaha... Tu vois, quelques shots.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Rejoins-moi au Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Ça marche, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "Bref, qu'est-ce qui se passe ?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "Pourquoi, c'est quoi le rush ?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Allez, viens, on va manger un morceau.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "Ouais, j'en ai eu assez pour aujourd'hui, crois-moi.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(La prochaine fois, peut-être.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Mec, ça fait un bien fou. Pas de boulots, pas de coups de feu — juste toi et moi.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Je pourrais m'habituer à cette vie tranquille, tu vois ?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Ça fait du bien de s'asseoir une minute, hein, chica ?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Ça fait du bien de s'asseoir une minute, hein, hermano ?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "Enfin bref... qu'est-ce qui te trotte dans la tête, V ?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "Ça t'arrive de regretter la vie de merco, Jackie ?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "Cette ville me bouffe à petit feu ces temps-ci.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "Tu crois qu'Arasaka paiera un jour pour ce qu'ils ont fait ?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "Si ça me manque ? Certains jours. L'adrénaline, l'équipe... mais ça m'a pris plus que ça m'a donné, V. Tu le sais mieux que personne.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "La vie de merco ? Nan. Les bons coups, peut-être. Pas les fins — on a tous les deux vu comment ça se termine.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "Ouais. On s'en est sortis, quand même.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City se fout que tu vives ou que tu crèves, chica. Tout ce que tu peux faire, c'est trouver les tiens et t'accrocher fort.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City se fout que tu vives ou que tu crèves, mano. Tout ce que tu peux faire, c'est trouver les tiens et t'accrocher fort.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "Cette ville broie tout le monde. Le truc, c'est de pas la laisser t'avaler entier. Tu m'as, je t'ai — c'est ça, le truc.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka ? Hé. Les gros poissons comme ça paient jamais, V. Mais on respire encore et ils connaissent pas nos noms. Ça, c'est une victoire.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "Les rats corpos retombent toujours sur leurs pattes. La meilleure vengeance, c'est de bien vivre — comme là, l'assiette pleine devant nous.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty, c'est mon ancre, V. Elle me fait regarder vers le haut quand je veux regarder par terre. Je sais pas ce que je serais sans elle.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "Misty et moi ? Du solide. Elle lit ses cartes, dit que les étoiles ont un plan. Moi je lui dis juste qu'elle est mon plan.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "Elle est restée avec Mama chaque semaine où j'étais parti, tu sais. Chaque semaine. Je pourrai jamais lui rendre ça.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Elle te fait du bien.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Hé, d'accord. On y va, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Hé, d'accord. On y va, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "Ouais, on a une ville à veiller. Vamonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Juste derrière toi, hermano. On bouge.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Direct au business, hein, mano ?",
    ["Let's go."] = "On y va.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, comment tu te sens ? Ça va ?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Bah, tu sais comment c'est, je me plains pas. Mais on est pas là pour parler de moi.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mama me disait que les bonnes choses arrivent à qui sait attendre, et y en a même des bonnes !",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "C'est mon sang, oui. Le Coyote, c'est son rade.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale, on boit un coup.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hé, V, t'es vivante ? Ça va, dans le nid de vipères ?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "C'est ici que naissent les légendes.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Direct au business, hein, chica ?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "Elle te manque ? La vie de merco ?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "C'est le métier, V. Tout le monde a du sang sur les mains. Tu fais avec, tu avances.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "Alors fais-en un dernier peinard, un petit boulot, avec moi.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Héhé, je bois à ça !",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "Ah, merci, Misty. T'es la meilleure.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "Misty l'avait vu venir ? Que tu t'en sortirais ?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Maintenant je rentre, je retrouve Misty et on fait un truc qui me fait sentir vivant à nouveau.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Avant ça — j'ai un petit boulot, si ça te dit.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty le savait... Misty sait toujours...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "Les cartes disent que tu m'aideras sur un boulot ?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Je suis juste derrière toi.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "Alors ? T'es prête ?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V, hé ! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "Tu viens pas souvent par ici, hein ? Héhé. Content de te voir, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hé, V – t'es vivante ? Ça va, dans le nid de vipères ?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica ! Enfin !",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "Tu viens pas souvent par ici, hein ? Héhé. Content de te voir, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hé V - t'es vivante ? Ça va, dans le nid de vipères ?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V, hé ! Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Il était temps.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "Tu viens vérifier que je pourris pas dans une benne, comme la plupart des Welles ?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Laisse tomber.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Tiens bon, V, j'arrive.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "Ouais, OK.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "D'accord, d'accord, d'accord.",
    ["You're all right."] = "T'es réglo.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Enfin il se passe un truc...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Trop tard pour se dégonfler maintenant. Allez, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "Et on a intérêt à faire vite.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "Tu viens ? Le temps, c'est précieux.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "On leur brise la nuque avant qu'ils s'en rendent compte.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Hé, la mairie devrait carrément nous remercier !",
    ["Finally!"] = "Enfin !",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...Jackie ? C'est vraiment toi ?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "C'est moi, V. Ça fait une éternité que je fixe ce téléphone en me demandant si t'appellerais un jour.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Espèce d'enfoiré. T'es VIVANT ?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Je t'ai enterré. J'ai fait mon DEUIL.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Ouais. Ouais, je suis vivant, chica. Et je suis désolé. J'ai voulu appeler mille fois — Vik voulait pas. Il disait que 'Saka remonterait direct jusqu'à nous deux.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Ouais. Ouais, je suis vivant, mano. Et je suis désolé. J'ai voulu appeler mille fois — Vik voulait pas. Il disait que 'Saka remonterait direct jusqu'à nous deux.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Des semaines, Jackie. Tu m'as laissée croire que t'étais PARTI.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Je suis tellement en colère contre toi que je peux pas—  ...  ça va ?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Je sais. Je SAIS. Je mérite chaque mot. Vas-y — balance-moi tout. Je peux encaisser ça mieux qu'une table à la morgue de Vik, hé.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...Tu m'as vraiment fait peur, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "Alors... parle-moi, V. Par où on commence, hein ?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "Ouais. Je suis là. Je vais nulle part cette fois. Qu'est-ce qui te trotte encore dans la tête ?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(doucement) Autre chose, chica ?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(doucement) Autre chose, mano ?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Assez parlé. Ramène-toi ici — faut que je te voie de mes propres yeux.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "Ta moto. Elle est toujours dans mon garage, tu sais.",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "Ça a été dur depuis que t'es parti, mec...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "Alors, tu tiens le coup, là-bas dans le désert ?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...Ma bécane. Dios mío, je voulais pas demander. Allez, me fais pas languir, V — cette moto, c'est le seul morceau de l'ancien moi qui me reste. Dis-moi franchement. Elle va bien ?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Détends-toi, hermano. Elle est saine et sauve. Viens la chercher.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "À ce sujet... je me suis habituée à elle, Jackie. Je la garde.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Ouf... Gracias, V. T'as pas idée de ce que ça représente pour moi. Tu l'as maintenue en vie pour moi tout ce temps.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "Elle est à toi, Jackie. Elle l'a toujours été.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Hé. (un long silence) Nan, nan — tu sais quoi ? Garde-la. Vu comme je vois les choses, c'est elle qui T'a gardée en vie pendant que je pouvais pas. Elle t'a méritée, et tu l'as méritée. La laisse juste pas à l'arrêt, V. Elle déteste ça.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Hé. (un long silence) Nan — tu sais quoi ? Garde-la, hermano. C'est elle qui T'a gardé en vie pendant que je pouvais pas. La laisse juste pas à l'arrêt, V. Elle déteste ça.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...Je prendrai soin d'elle. Promis.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "Dur comment ? Parle-moi, V. Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Tout a dérapé après Konpeki. C'est... compliqué. Longue histoire.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "J'ai perdu plus que tu crois cette nuit-là. J'ai bien failli me perdre moi-même aussi.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...Ouais. T'as toujours fait le silence sur les trucs lourds, chica. D'accord. J'insiste pas. Pour l'instant.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...Ouais. T'as toujours fait le silence sur les trucs lourds, mano. D'accord. J'insiste pas. Pour l'instant.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Je te raconterai tout. Juste... pas au téléphone.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(soupir) Franchement ? Rester planqué ici me réduit à rien, V. La ville me manque. Les lumières, le bruit, la cuisine de Mama. Je veux rentrer. Mais c'est pas si simple.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "Pourquoi pas ? Qu'est-ce qui te retient coincé là-bas ?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Cette puce... ce qui est resté dedans tourne encore. Un logiciel de sécurité Arasaka — il balance ma position comme un phare. C'est comme ça que 'Saka me retrouverait — c'est pour ça que je dois rester hors de portée. Vik a essayé de l'enlever. Il a pas pu.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "Alors on trouve quelqu'un qui PEUT. Un netrunner, un ripper — n'importe qui.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "On va te la sortir. Je te perdrai pas une deuxième fois, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Tu ferais vraiment ça ? ... Évidemment que oui. D'accord, chica. On trouve quelqu'un qui peut effacer ce truc. Peut-être que je récupère ma vie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Tu ferais vraiment ça ? ... Évidemment que oui. D'accord, mano. On trouve quelqu'un qui peut effacer ce truc. Peut-être que je récupère ma vie.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "On va y arriver. Mais ça, c'est pour demain — ramène-toi ici. Maintenant.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "On va y arriver. T'inquiète. Je t'assure les arrières jusque-là.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Faut que je sois franc avec toi, choom. Après ce qui s'est passé... je peux plus faire de vrais boulots. Le corps encaisse plus. Et Mama ? (petit rire) Elle finirait ce que 'Saka a commencé si j'essayais ne serait-ce qu'une fois.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Personne te le demande. Maintenant arrête de tergiverser et ramène-toi ici, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Bien. T'as assez saigné pour cette ville.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...Ouais. Ouais, d'accord. Assez bavardé. T'es où ? Nan — bouge pas, je suis déjà en route. Tiens bon, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...Ouais. Ouais, d'accord. Assez bavardé. T'es où ? Nan — bouge pas, je suis déjà en route. Tiens bon, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "OK. Je reste ici. Dépêche-toi.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Je suis déjà en route, V. Bouge pas d'ici. ...On se voit près de la station-service.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Toi non plus t'as pas meilleure mine, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(tu le regardes juste un moment) ...C'est toi.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "Ouais, ouais — le désert fait pas de cadeaux au physique d'un homme. Mais toi ? ...Putain. Un vrai régal pour les yeux, V. Ce visage m'a manqué plus que j'ai de mots pour le dire.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "Ouais, ouais — le désert fait pas de cadeaux au physique d'un homme. Mais toi, hermano ? Putain, quel plaisir de te voir. Ta sale tronche m'a manqué.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "On est tous les deux encore debout. C'est ça qui compte.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Attends. Ma moto. Tu l'as toujours ? Tout ce temps, tu l'as gardée ?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "Elle est dans mon garage, Jackie. Elle t'attend. Tiens — tes clés.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Alors comme ça tu la gardes vraiment, hein ? (rires) D'accord, d'accord — alors c'est TOI qui conduis, chica. Allez. Montre-moi qu'elle a été entre de bonnes mains.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Alors comme ça tu la gardes vraiment, hein ? (rires) D'accord — alors c'est TOI qui conduis, hermano. Allez. Montre-moi qu'elle a été entre de bonnes mains.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Monte, Jackie. On rentre à la maison.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "Tu l'as gardée en état de marche pour moi. Tout ce temps... Putain, V. C'est le dernier morceau de l'ancien moi, là, juste là.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "On y va, hermano, et tu pourras l'emmener faire un tour.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Allez, V. On rentre à la maison. ...Et hé — plus d'enterrements. Pas avant un bon bout de temps, d'accord ?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Allez, hermano. On rentre à la maison. ...Et hé — plus d'enterrements. Pas avant un bon bout de temps, d'accord ?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... on a réussi. On a vraiment réussi. J'y crois pas, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(tu reprends ton souffle) ...Ouais. On a réussi.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "On est vivants, chica. Tous les deux.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "J'ai à peine repris mon souffle depuis Konpeki. ...Ça fait du bien de s'arrêter une seconde.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Hé... ouais. C'est vrai. ...Dommage que personne saura jamais que c'était nous là-haut.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "Au fait -- où t'as rangé la mallette ?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...Jackie ?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Je l'avais. Juste dans mes mains, V, je te jure que je l'avais...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie ! Le biopuce -- cette putain de mallette avec le biopuce, elle est où ?!",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "J'ai essayé de la garder, je te jure. Smasher -- cet hijo de puta... La mallette a pris une balle, s'est ouverte en grand. La puce est bonne pour la ferraille. Alors je l'ai lâchée. ...Je suis désolé, V. Vraiment.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "Merde ! C'était notre ticket, Jackie ! Tout ce pour quoi on a bossé !",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "Franchement ? Ce truc aurait sûrement causé plus d'ennuis que ça valait.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "On respire tous les deux, cabrón. C'est le seul butin qui compte.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "Ouais... je sais. Chinga'o. Mais hé -- t'es encore là pour être furax à ce sujet, non ?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Toi et moi. On a mis à terre Smasher et on est sortis en marchant de Konpeki Plaza. Personne le croira jamais.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...Ouais. T'as peut-être raison. La tech corpo comme ça, ça t'achète juste une vie plus courte.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Héhé ouais. Une histoire pour les âges, V !  \\n(Un silence) Alors... C'est quoi la suite ?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "Tout ce qu'on veut, hermano. Pour une fois, personne écrit notre histoire à part nous.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Hé. J'aime bien comme ça sonne. Allez, viens. Night City va pas se conquérir toute seule !",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Bar à nouilles.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(coin secret pour la sieste).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V : Je vais pas entraîner Jackie dans ce merdier. Pas après tout ce qu'il a traversé.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "Je peux pas appeler Jackie pendant une mission principale — je vais pas l'entraîner là-dedans.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "Oh, merde...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "Par chance c'est dégagé pour l'instant. Faut pas traîner, quand même.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "C'est A— c'est Adam Smasher ?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "Oh, MERDE !",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "On va pas crever — pas aujourd'hui !",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. L'AV du vieux Arasaka devrait toujours être garé sur le toit.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Allez, V — on se tire d'ici.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — installé",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik a appelé. Il a laissé un message. Il dit qu'il a un truc à te dire sur Jackie — un truc qu'il voulait pas dire au téléphone.\\n\\nVa le voir à sa clinique.\\n\\n(Pour les réglages du mod, va dans Échap -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik :",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "J'aurais dû te le dire il y a longtemps, et je suis désolé de pas l'avoir fait. Jackie n'est pas mort sur ma table cette nuit-là. J'ai récupéré un pouls, j'ai demandé un service, je l'ai fait sortir avant qu'Arasaka vienne chercher le corps. Il est vivant, V — planqué là-bas dans les Badlands, et ça doit rester comme ça. Le gamin avait aucune raison de survivre à ce qu'il a survécu. Et quand il a pu reparler, la première chose qu'il a demandée, c'est si tu t'en étais sortie. C'était juste pas sûr de te le dire avant, V. Je suis désolé. Je marque l'endroit sur ta carte. Va le ramener.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "J'aurais dû te le dire il y a longtemps, et je suis désolé de pas l'avoir fait. Jackie n'est pas mort sur ma table cette nuit-là. J'ai récupéré un pouls, j'ai demandé un service, je l'ai fait sortir avant qu'Arasaka vienne chercher le corps. C'était juste pas sûr de te le dire avant, V. Il est vivant. Planqué là-bas dans les Badlands — et ça doit rester comme ça. Il t'attend. Je marque l'endroit sur ta carte. Va le ramener.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Puce — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Si tu lis ça, V, c'est que le doc a tenu parole et t'a envoyée jusqu'ici. C'est moi. Je suis vivant.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik m'a rafistolé et fait sortir en douce avant que 'Saka puisse graver mon nom sur une dalle. Je me planque depuis.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mama Welles était tellement en colère quand elle l'a appris. Je crois qu'elle me tuerait si je recommençais les boulots — elle a peut-être raison. J'en ai fini avec la vie de merco, V. Pour de vrai. Mais je pouvais pas te laisser continuer à croire que tu m'avais enterré.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Passe-moi un coup de fil quand tu lis ça. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Retrouve Jackie — Rocky Ridge, les Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Appeler Jackie",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Attendre Jackie",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie est de retour.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Puce — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Je garde la carte de la Mort face cachée maintenant. Je pouvais pas la regarder — pendant des mois c'est tout ce que je voyais en fermant les yeux.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Quand Vik m'a dit qu'il s'en était sorti, qu'il était là-bas à respirer dans les Badlands, je me suis assise par terre dans la boutique et j'ai pleuré jusqu'à ce que l'encens se consume.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "Je vais pas faire semblant d'être seulement heureuse, V. Certaines nuits je suis tellement en colère que je pourrais hurler. Il est entré dans ce casse en connaissant le risque. Il a failli nous quitter. Il a failli me quitter.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Mais les cartes ne se trompaient pas. Son fil ne s'est pas coupé. Il s'est juste effiloché... et il a tenu.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Sois indulgente avec lui. Et merci — d'être allée le ramener à la maison. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Puce — Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "Alors comme ça. Mon Jackie est vivant, et je suis la dernière à l'apprendre. Attends d'être mère, V, et que quelqu'un te cache une chose pareille — on reparlera du pardon à ce moment-là.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "J'ai allumé un cierge pour ce garçon chaque jour. J'ai cuisiné pour un fantôme. Et pendant tout ce temps il était là-bas dans la poussière, à respirer, à me laisser porter son deuil. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "Et pourtant — il est VIVANT. Mon garçon est vivant. Je n'ai pas arrêté de remercier la Vierge depuis que je l'ai appris. J'en ai les genoux endoloris.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Mais écoute-moi bien une fois, V : s'il reprend un jour un boulot comme ce casse — s'il risque sa vie pour des eddies et de la gloire encore une fois — je n'attendrai pas que cette ville me le prenne. Je le tuerai moi-même.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Amène-le à ma table. Il y a une assiette qui l'attend. Il y a toujours eu une assiette qui l'attend. — Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Parler",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Parler à Jackie   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Appel de Jackie...",
    ["No answer."] = "Pas de réponse.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "La voilà. Assieds-toi, souffle un peu — t'es toujours en mouvement.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Le voilà. Assieds-toi, souffle un peu — t'es toujours en mouvement.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "J'espérais que tu passerais. Va pas le répéter.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Hé. ...Non, rien. C'est juste bon de te voir debout là, c'est tout.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Viens là.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "Elle te va comment, la vie tranquille ? Vraiment.",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "Ça te plaît, le bar ?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "Heywood, ça sent toujours la maison ?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "Ça te manque, des fois ? La vie.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "Et le corps, il tient ? Franchement.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "Tu te souviens de quoi, de cette nuit-là ?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "Tu vas encore voir Vik ?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "T'as eu peur ?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "Tu m'en veux ?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "Tu veux quoi, maintenant, Jackie ?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Dis-le. Ce truc que t'arrêtes pas de pas dire.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Bien. Lentement. Le lent, c'est un ajustement, mais c'est bien.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Y a des bons jours. Et d'autres où je m'assois en plein après-midi parce que mon corps le dit, et je discute plus avec lui.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "Franchement ? Je dors mal. Vers quatre heures je suis réveillé, et je reste là à écouter l'immeuble. ...Mais je suis là pour mal dormir. C'est le marché, et je le referais.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "Le bar, surtout. Et les gens me trouvent avec leurs problèmes. Des petits. J'aime bien les petits.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Un gamin du quartier cherchait son frère. Ça m'a pris deux jours et beaucoup de paroles, et personne s'est fait tirer dessus. Le meilleur boulot que j'aie fait, et ça paie rien.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "Ah, c'est... calme. Heh. C'est ça la blague, non ? Il se trouve que le calme, c'est un talent. J'étais pas doué au début.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "Je me surprends encore à guetter que quelque chose tourne mal. Debout dans le bar à deux heures de l'aprèm, un chiffon à la main, à attendre une fusillade qui vient pas. Ça s'arrange.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Tu vas y arriver.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Ça vaut mieux que l'alternative.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Tu pourrais toujours revenir dans la vie.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...Non. Non, V. On m'a porté hors de cet endroit. Mama a reçu un appel en pleine nuit. Je lui fais pas ça deux fois, et à toi non plus. Me redemande jamais ça.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Je suis désolée. T'as raison.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Je comprends.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "Elle s'inquiète. Elle me nourrit. Elle fait comme si elle avait pas peur, et c'est comme ça que je sais qu'elle a peur.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Elle allume une bougie pour moi. Pour MOI. Je suis assis à sa table et elle l'allume quand même. Elle dit que c'est pour la version de moi qui s'en est pas sortie.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "Elle sait pas la moitié de ce qui s'est passé cette nuit-là et elle le saura jamais. C'est un truc que je porte pour qu'elle ait pas à le faire. Tu comprends ça, hein ?",
    ["I understand."] = "Elle le porterait avec toi si tu la laissais faire.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "C'est honnête. Personne m'a jamais braqué pour une bière mal tirée.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "Je connais le verre de chacun et la moitié de leurs ennuis. Il se trouve que c'est aussi une forme de pouvoir. La forme lente.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Toujours. Les mêmes coins, les mêmes abuelas qui gueulent aux mêmes fenêtres.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Mais je le marche différemment maintenant. Avant je marchais comme si j'allais le posséder un jour. Maintenant je... marche, c'est tout.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...Ouais. Ouais, ça me manque. Pas les flingues. Le *nous*. Trouver un truc débile à deux heures du matin et le faire à quatre.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Ce qui me manque, c'est d'être le gars qui pouvait arranger ça juste en passant la porte. C'est cette partie-là qui guérit pas, chica — pas les côtes. Les côtes, elles ont guéri.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Ce qui me manque, c'est d'être le gars qui pouvait arranger ça juste en passant la porte. C'est cette partie-là qui guérit pas, hermano — pas les côtes. Les côtes, elles ont guéri.",
    ["We're still us."] = "On est toujours nous.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "T'as jamais été que ça.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "Franchement ? Raide. Les matins froids, c'est le pire. Vik dit que c'est permanent et que je devrais m'en faire un ami.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "J'ai une plaque en moi, V. Je sens où elle s'arrête. Certaines nuits je reste allongé la main dessus, juste pour vérifier qu'elle fait toujours son boulot. C'est ce que j'ai à la place d'une cicatrice dont on peut se vanter.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "T'es pas obligé d'en faire une blague.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "T'es toujours debout.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Des morceaux. La bagnole. Toi qui gueulais un truc que j'entendais pas. La voix de Dex sur la ligne et tout qui partait déjà de travers.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Je me souviens d'avoir eu froid et d'avoir trouvé ça bizarre, parce que c'était une nuit chaude. Et je me souviens d'avoir décidé de rien dire parce que t'en avais déjà assez sur le dos. ...C'était con. J'aurais dû dire quelque chose.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "T'aurais dû dire quelque chose.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Tu voulais me protéger.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "On va pas faire ça.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Une fois par mois. Il me fait pas payer, ça me rend dingue, alors je lui apporte un truc de la cuisine de Mama et on dit qu'on est quittes.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Cet homme a fermé sa gueule pendant longtemps pour que je puisse rester mort. Tu sais ce que ça coûte à un type comme Vik ? Il l'a porté tout seul. Je lui dois plus que les côtes.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...Ouais. Pas sur le moment — sur le moment c'est juste fort, et puis c'est le silence. Après. Me réveiller dans une pièce que je connaissais pas, pas pouvoir bouger, pas savoir si t'étais sortie. C'est cette peur-là qui est restée. Ça m'a pris longtemps pour le dire à voix haute.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Je suis contente que tu l'aies dit.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "J'avais peur aussi.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "De quoi ? Du boulot ? V, je *voulais* ce boulot. C'est moi qui t'en ai convaincue pour moitié. Tu trimballes ça depuis tout ce temps en pensant que je t'en voudrais ? ...Non. Non. Pas une seule fois. Pas une seconde.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "J'avais besoin d'entendre ça.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Je le porte encore.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "Alors pose-le. Ici, maintenant — t'as plus à trimballer ça. Je suis debout devant toi. Regarde-moi. Je suis debout, juste là.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...D'accord.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Un truc petit, je crois. Le bar. Le dimanche chez Mama. Peut-être un endroit avec une fenêtre sans barreaux. Avant je voulais mon nom sur quelque chose. Maintenant je veux juste rester assez longtemps pour m'ennuyer. Ça fait pathétique ?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Ça ressemble à une vie.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "Y a rien de pathétique là-dedans.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...C'est la première chose que j'ai demandée à Vik. Avant mon propre nom, avant ce qui m'était arrivé. Je lui ai demandé si t'étais sortie. Il a dit oui, et je suis reparti dans les vapes pour deux jours. Ce que cette nuit a pris d'autre, elle a pas pris ça. C'est ça, le truc que j'arrête pas de pas dire.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "J'ai demandé après toi aussi, tous les jours.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Vas-y. Je bouge pas — c'est tout l'intérêt de moi, maintenant.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Hé. Reviens, hein ? Attends pas un mois.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Un Tequila Old Fashioned avec un trait de cerveza et une garniture de piment.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Un shot de vodka sur glace, du jus de citron vert, de la ginger beer et, le plus important... un trait d'amour.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Double tequila avec grenadine et citron vert. Rien de mieux pour noyer les nerfs.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "Ah, au fait, je m'appelle Jackie Welles. Tu veux noter ma recette ?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "T'as tout un numéro, dis donc.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "Night City te traite comment ?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "Ahhhh, j'adore cette ville. La ville des opportunités infinies. Et de la haine fraternelle.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "C'est important d'avoir des gens vers qui se tourner. Tu vois, genre, euh, une famille. Tu trouveras peut-être la tienne à Night City.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Tu peux sortir le rat de la corpo, mais tu sortiras jamais la corpo du rat.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "Tu vois... l'effet papillon, ou un truc du genre.",
    ["I found mine."] = "J'ai trouvé la mienne.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Je suis loyal, constant dans mes sentiments…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Elle a attendu, tu sais.",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "Tu regardes quoi en ce moment ?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames ! Un vrai iguane ! Un, euh, des Petites Antilles, je crois.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "Ouais ! J'ai vu un truc sur eux à la télé. Éteints depuis genre trente ans. Ils viennent des Petites Antilles.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "T'as fait du chemin, mon ami à écailles.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "Ça te dit un peu de tir en RV ?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "T'es passé aux documentaires animaliers.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Un iguane.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "Quelqu'un est venu te voir avec un problème récemment ?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón doit apprendre... qu'on n'entube pas les gens de Heywood.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "Ça reste du boulot de fixer, Jackie.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Heywood a de la chance de t'avoir.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "Le gamin deux portes plus loin devait du fric au mauvais type. Pas besoin d'un flingue pour ça — juste de quelqu'un qui s'assoit dans une pièce et qui est la plus grosse chose dedans. Il s'avère que c'est encore moi.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Personne ne note ça. Pas de fixer, pas de commission, pas de nom sur un tableau. Juste une dame qui frappe à la porte du bar à onze heures du soir parce qu'elle n'a nulle part où aller. ...Le meilleur boulot que j'aie jamais fait, et j'aurais honte de l'appeler un boulot.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Parle-moi de ton vieux.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "C'est vachement mieux que d'être le fils de Raúl Welles.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Il est parti. C'est toute l'histoire, et il m'a fallu trente ans pour la résumer aussi court. Mama n'a jamais dit du mal de lui, pas une seule fois — elle est juste devenue les deux, en silence.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "Tu ne lui ressembles en rien.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Elle a fait un sacré boulot.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "Il vient d'où, ton code, Jackie ?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Prends les Valentinos. Ils suivent Dieu et la Santa Madre. L'honneur, ça veut dire quelque chose pour eux.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "Le monde des gangs, c'est pas bien compliqué. La force fait la loi, les forts survivent.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Aujourd'hui, ils t'envoient effacer quelqu'un. Demain, ils enverront quelqu'un d'autre t'effacer.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "Tu vis toujours selon ça ?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "C'est pour ça que t'as arrêté, non ?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "Tu crois encore à tout ça ? Dieu, les saints ?",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre a toujours dit que la patience finit par payer, alors…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Je suis mort, V. Peu importe comment tu le dis — mon cœur s'est arrêté et les mains de quelqu'un l'ont relancé. Alors, est-ce que je crois ? Je crois que QUELQUE CHOSE a tenu la porte une seconde. J'ai pas besoin de savoir à qui était la main.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "Mama serait contente de l'entendre.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "Tu penses à la mort ?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "La mort... c'est rien de plus que la fioriture finale.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Avant, je disais ça comme si c'était malin. Je l'ai dit une fois dans un bar, un verre à la main — tout le monde doit y passer un jour, autant le faire avec style. Et puis j'y suis passé, V. Il s'avère qu'il n'y a aucun style là-dedans. Il y a juste une pièce et quelqu'un d'autre qui fait le boulot de te garder.",
    ["You're here now."] = "T'es là, maintenant.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "Ne repars pas, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "Il est temps qu'on y aille, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "On bouge, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "Tu me suis, chica ?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "Tu me suis, mano ?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "Hermano ! Enfin !",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "T'inquiète pas pour moi. Je me débrouille.",
    ["You order."] = "Commande, toi.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Peut-être plus tard.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "Ça fait un bail avec Misty, hein ?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "OK, c'est bon. On y va.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "Moi aussi, ça fait plaisir, Jack. Comment tu vas ?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "J'ai besoin de toi, Jack. Y a du boulot.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "J'ai un truc à régler avant.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "On y va. Ça sert à rien d'attendre.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Prends soin de toi, amigo.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "Qu'est-ce qui est bon, ici ?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "Comment tu vas ? À part le boulot, je veux dire.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "En fait, faut que j'y aille.",
    ["See you around."] = "À plus.",
    ["Need your help."] = "J'ai besoin de ton aide.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "Quoi de neuf du côté de Señora Welles ?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "Un verre me ferait pas de mal.",
    ["Take care."] = "Fais attention à toi.",
    ["To this."] = "À ça.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "Je refuse jamais un verre offert.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "À la cour des grands !",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "Tu fais quoi de beau ?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Passe le bonjour à Misty.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Mouais…",
    ["How's things?"] = "Ça roule ?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "T'as quoi comme boisson ?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "Comment va ta mère ?",
    ["Talk later."] = "On se parle plus tard.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Rien qui vaille la peine d'être noté. Et c'est bien ça l'intérêt, chica.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Rien qui vaille la peine d'être noté. Et c'est bien ça l'intérêt, hermano.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Je veux bien un verre.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "Petites Antil-quoi ?",
    ["Later."] = "À plus tard.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Prends soin de toi, mec.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Je te rappelle.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "On en reparle plus tard.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "Ouais, à plus.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Faut que j'file.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "On se voit dans la cour des grands, Jack.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Adieu, vieil ami.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Je voulais juste savoir comment tu tiens le coup, tu vois.",
    ["Come on."] = "Allez.",
    ["You got me too."] = "Et moi toi aussi.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Je prends cette victoire.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Ça te va bien, Jackie.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "Les petites comptent aussi.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "C'est toujours ton territoire.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Content que tu sois là pour le dire.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Vik, c'est quelqu'un de bien.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "C'est une façon de le dire.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Amen à ça.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "S'asseoir est encore en chantier",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "Ils resteront debout à table au lieu de s'asseoir.\n\nL'animation d'assise n'est pas encore liée au mobilier réel : elle se joue là où le personnage se trouve, donc une assise automatique le laisse généralement flotter au-dessus de la chaise. Debout rendait mieux que flottant, donc debout est le comportement par défaut.\n\nVous pouvez les asseoir vous-même, et ça tombe exactement où vous le placez : ouvrez la surcouche CET, allez dans « NCLives - Companions » -> « Sitting - seat them by hand ». Placez-vous sur la chaise, orienté comme ils doivent l'être, appuyez sur « Seat them here », reculez puis ajustez les curseurs de hauteur et d'angle.\n\nRelevez-les avec le même panneau avant de les renvoyer chez eux.",
  },
  ["it"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "Questa puzza di guai grossi, V. Aspetto un minuto — ma lascia perdere, o me ne vado.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "Il tempo scorre, hermana. Molla il pesce grosso o me ne vado.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Ecco la mia ragazza. Il casino corpo può aspettare — resto con te.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "La mod è caricata, ma non è riuscita a leggere i tuoi progressi nella storia, quindi non avvierà da sola la questline di Jackie.\n\nQuando il colpo sarà alle tue spalle, avviala da Esc -> Impostazioni -> Mod -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Parlami, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "Non vieni spesso da queste parti, eh? Eheh. Che bello vederti, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "Come ti senti? Tutto a posto?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "Meglio di così non si può, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "Pronta a muoverci?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "Allora facciamo quello che sappiamo fare.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "È ora di andare, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "Muoviamoci, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Qualcuno ti ha lasciato qualcosa qui...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — grazie, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Hai pagato 3.847 eddies di tasca tua per guidare fino a Rocky Ridge — solo per scoprire se Jackie stesse davvero ancora respirando quaggiù. E poi sei andato a raccontarlo al mondo intero.\\n\\nQuindi eccoti indietro i tuoi 3.847 eddies, restituiti DIECI VOLTE TANTO: 38.470. E la Arch di Jackie in più.\\n\\nNessuno macina tutti quei chilometri per una mod che non ama. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie e la squadra di Jackie Lives",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "Vuoi andare a mangiare qualcosa?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Mangia qualcosa con Jackie: Vai a %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...e poi dico di andare all'Afterlife, ahahah... Sai, a farci qualche shot.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Ci vediamo da Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Ci sto, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "Comunque, cosa sta succedendo?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "Perché, che fretta c'è?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Dai, andiamo a mangiare qualcosa.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "Sì, ne ho avuto abbastanza per oggi, credimi.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(Magari la prossima volta.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Amico, questo ci voleva proprio. Niente lavori, niente sparatorie — solo io e te.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Potrei abituarmici a questa vita tranquilla, sai?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Fa bene sedersi un attimo, eh, chica?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Fa bene sedersi un attimo, eh, hermano?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "Comunque... cos'hai per la testa, V?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "Ti manca mai la vita da mercenario, Jackie?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "Questa città mi ha logorato, ultimamente.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "Pensi che l'Arasaka pagherà mai per quello che ha fatto?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "Se mi manca? Certi giorni. L'adrenalina, la squadra... ma mi ha tolto più di quanto mi abbia dato, V. Tu lo sai meglio di chiunque altro.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "La vita? Nah. I bei colpi, forse. Non i finali — abbiamo visto entrambi come vanno a finire.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "Già. Però ce la siamo cavata.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "A Night City non frega niente se vivi o muori, chica. L'unica cosa che puoi fare è trovare la tua gente e tenertela stretta.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "A Night City non frega niente se vivi o muori, mano. L'unica cosa che puoi fare è trovare la tua gente e tenertela stretta.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "Questa città mastica tutti. Il trucco è non lasciarti inghiottire del tutto. Hai me, io ho te — quello è il trucco.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka? Eh. I pesci grossi come loro non pagano mai, V. Ma noi respiriamo ancora e loro non sanno i nostri nomi. Quella è una vittoria.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "I topi corpo cadono sempre in piedi. La miglior vendetta è vivere bene — come adesso, col piatto pieno davanti.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty è la mia àncora, V. Mi tiene lo sguardo in alto quando vorrei guardare in basso. Non so cosa sarei senza di lei.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "Io e Misty? Solidi. Lei legge le carte, dice che le stelle hanno un piano. Io le dico solo che lei è il mio piano.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "È stata con Mama ogni settimana in cui sono stato via, sai. Ogni settimana. Non riuscirò mai a ripagarla per questo.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Lei ti fa bene.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Eh, va bene. Andiamo, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Eh, va bene. Andiamo, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "Sì, abbiamo una città a cui badare. Vamonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Sono proprio dietro di te, hermano. Muoviamoci.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Dritto agli affari, eh, mano?",
    ["Let's go."] = "Andiamo.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, come ti senti? Tutto a posto?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Eh, sai com'è, non mi lamento. Ma non siamo qui a chiacchierare di me.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mama mi diceva che le cose arrivano a chi sa aspettare, e alcune sono pure belle!",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "È sangue del mio sangue, certo. Il Coyote è il suo locale.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale, beviamoci qualcosa.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Ehi, V, sei viva? Come vanno le cose nel nido di vipere?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "È qui che nascono le leggende.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Dritto agli affari, eh, chica?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "Ti manca? La vita da mercenario?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "È il mestiere, V. Tutti abbiamo le mani sporche di sangue. Ci convivi e vai avanti.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "Allora fanne uno facile, un lavoro extra, con me. L'ultimo.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Eheh, bevo a questo!",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "Ah, grazie, Misty. Sei la migliore.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "Misty l'aveva previsto? Che te la saresti cavata?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Ora torno indietro, cerco Misty e facciamo qualcosa che mi faccia sentire di nuovo vivo.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Prima che tu lo faccia — ho un lavoro extra, se ci stai.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty lo sapeva... Misty sa sempre tutto...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "Le carte dicono che mi aiuterai in un lavoro?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Sono proprio dietro di te.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "Allora? Sei pronta?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V, ehi! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "Non vieni spesso da queste parti, eh? Eheh. Che bello vederti, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Ehi, V – sei viva? Come vanno le cose nel nido di vipere?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica! Finalmente!",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "Non vieni spesso da queste parti, eh? Eheh. Che bello vederti, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Ehi V - sei viva? Come vanno le cose nel nido di vipere?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V, ehi! Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Era ora.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "Vieni a vedere se non sto marcendo in qualche cassonetto, come quasi tutti i Welles?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Lascia stare.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Aspetta, V, sto arrivando.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "Sì, ok.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "Va bene, va bene, va bene.",
    ["You're all right."] = "Sei in gamba.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Finalmente si muove qualcosa...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Troppo tardi per tirarsi indietro adesso. Dai, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "E faremmo meglio a fare in fretta.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "Vieni? Il tempo è prezioso.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "Gli spezziamo il collo prima che se ne accorgano.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Eh, il Comune dovrebbe proprio ringraziarci!",
    ["Finally!"] = "Finalmente!",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...Jackie? Sei davvero tu?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "Sono io, V. È da un'eternità che fisso questo telefono chiedendomi se avresti mai chiamato.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Figlio di puttana. Sei VIVO?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Ti ho seppellito. Ti ho PIANTO.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Sì. Sì, sono vivo, chica. E mi dispiace. Volevo chiamare mille volte — Vik non me l'ha permesso. Diceva che 'Saka ci avrebbe rintracciati dritto tutti e due.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Sì. Sì, sono vivo, mano. E mi dispiace. Volevo chiamare mille volte — Vik non me l'ha permesso. Diceva che 'Saka ci avrebbe rintracciati dritto tutti e due.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Settimane, Jackie. Mi hai lasciata credere che NON C'ERI PIÙ.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Sono così arrabbiata con te che non riesco a—  ...  stai bene?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Lo so. LO SO. Me la sono meritata ogni parola. Dai — dammele tutte. Le reggo meglio di un lettino nell'obitorio di Vik, eh.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...Mi hai fatto davvero paura, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "Allora... parlami, V. Da dove cominciamo, eh?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "Sì. Sono qui. Stavolta non vado da nessuna parte. Cos'altro hai per la testa?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(sottovoce) Qualcos'altro, chica?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(sottovoce) Qualcos'altro, mano?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Basta parlare. Vieni qui — devo vederti con i miei occhi.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "La tua moto. È ancora ferma nel mio garage, sai.",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "È stata dura da quando te ne sei andato, amico...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "Allora, come te la sei cavata là fuori nel deserto?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...La mia moto. Dios mío, non volevo chiederlo. Dai, non torturarmi, V — quella moto è l'unico pezzo del vecchio me che mi è rimasto. Dimmelo chiaro. Sta bene?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Tranquillo, hermano. È sana e salva. Vieni a prenderla.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "A proposito... mi ci sono affezionata, Jackie. Me la tengo.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Uff... Gracias, V. Non hai idea di cosa significhi per me. L'hai tenuta in vita per me tutto questo tempo.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "È tua, Jackie. Lo è sempre stata.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Eh. (una lunga pausa) Nah, nah — sai che c'è? Tienitela. Per come la vedo io, lei ha tenuto in vita TE mentre io non potevo. Si è meritata te, e tu ti sei meritata lei. Solo non lasciarla ferma, V. Lo detesta.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Eh. (una lunga pausa) Nah — sai che c'è? Tienitela, hermano. Lei ha tenuto in vita TE mentre io non potevo. Solo non lasciarla ferma, V. Lo detesta.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...Me ne prenderò cura. Promesso.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "Dura come? Parlami, V. Cosa sta succedendo?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "È andato tutto a rotoli dopo Konpeki. È... complicato. Lunga storia.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "Ho perso più di quanto immagini quella notte. Per poco non perdevo anche me stessa.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Mmm. ...Già. Sei sempre stata zitta sulle cose pesanti, chica. Va bene. Non insisto. Per ora.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Mmm. ...Già. Sei sempre stato zitto sulle cose pesanti, mano. Va bene. Non insisto. Per ora.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Ti racconterò tutto. Solo... non al telefono.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(sospiro) La verità? Starmene nascosto qui mi sta consumando fino all'osso, V. Mi manca la città. Le luci, il rumore, la cucina di Mama. Voglio tornare a casa. Ma non è così semplice.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "Perché no? Cosa ti tiene bloccato là fuori?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Quel chip... quello che è rimasto dentro funziona ancora. Un software di sicurezza dell'Arasaka - manda fuori la mia posizione come un faro. È così che 'Saka mi troverebbe — per questo devo restare fuori portata. Vik ha provato a toglierlo. Non ci è riuscito.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "Allora troviamo qualcuno che CI RIESCA. Un netrunner, un ripper — chiunque.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "Te lo tireremo fuori. Non ti perderò due volte, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Lo faresti davvero? ... Certo che sì. Va bene, chica. Troviamo qualcuno che possa cancellare questa cosa. Magari mi riprendo la mia vita.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Lo faresti davvero? ... Certo che sì. Va bene, mano. Troviamo qualcuno che possa cancellare questa cosa. Magari mi riprendo la mia vita.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "Ce la faremo. Ma questo è roba per domani — vieni qui. Adesso.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "Ce la faremo. Non ti preoccupare. Ti copro le spalle fino ad allora.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Devo essere sincero con te, choom. Dopo quello che è successo... non posso più fare lavori seri. Il corpo non regge. E Mama? (risatina) Finirebbe quello che 'Saka ha cominciato se solo ci provassi.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Nessuno te lo sta chiedendo. Ora smettila di temporeggiare e vieni qui, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Bene. Hai già versato abbastanza sangue per questa città.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...Sì. Sì, va bene. Basta chiacchiere. Dove sei? Nah — non muoverti, sto già venendo da te. Tieni duro, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...Sì. Sì, va bene. Basta chiacchiere. Dove sei? Nah — non muoverti, sto già venendo da te. Tieni duro, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "Ok. Sono qui che aspetto. Sbrigati.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Sono già in movimento, V. Non andare da nessuna parte. ...Ci vediamo alla stazione di servizio.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Nemmeno tu sei messo tanto meglio, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(lo guardi solo per un momento) ...Sei tu.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "Sì, sì — il deserto non fa nessun favore alla faccia di uno. Ma tu? ...Cavolo. Sei una gioia per gli occhi, V. Mi è mancata quella faccia più di quanto sappia dire.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "Sì, sì — il deserto non fa nessun favore alla faccia di uno. Ma tu, hermano? Cavolo, che gioia vederti. Mi è mancato quel tuo muso brutto.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "Siamo ancora in piedi tutti e due. È questo che conta.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Aspetta. La mia moto. Ce l'hai ancora? Tutto questo tempo, l'hai tenuta?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "È nel mio garage, Jackie. Ti aspetta. Tieni — le tue chiavi.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Quindi te la tieni davvero, eh. (ride) Va bene, va bene — allora guidi TU, chica. Dai. Fammi vedere che è stata in buone mani.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Quindi te la tieni davvero, eh. (ride) Va bene — allora guidi TU, hermano. Dai. Fammi vedere che è stata in buone mani.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Sali, Jackie. Andiamo a casa.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "L'hai tenuta in moto per me. Tutto questo tempo... Cavolo, V. Quello è l'ultimo pezzo del vecchio me, proprio lì.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "Andiamo, hermano, e potrai farci un giro.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Dai, V. Andiamo a casa. ...E senti — niente più funerali. Per un bel pezzo, ok?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Dai, hermano. Andiamo a casa. ...E senti — niente più funerali. Per un bel pezzo, ok?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... ce l'abbiamo fatta. Ce l'abbiamo fatta davvero. Non ci credo, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(riprendi fiato) ...Già. Ce l'abbiamo fatta.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "Siamo vivi, chica. Tutti e due.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "Non ho quasi tirato il fiato da Konpeki. ...Fa bene fermarsi un secondo.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Eh... già. È vero. ...Peccato che nessuno saprà mai che siamo stati noi lassù.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "A proposito -- dove hai messo la valigetta?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...Jackie?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Ce l'avevo. Proprio tra le mani, V, giuro che ce l'avevo...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie! Il biochip -- quella cazzo di valigetta col biochip, dov'è?!",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "Ho cercato di tenerla, giuro. Smasher -- quel hijo de puta... La valigetta ha preso un colpo, si è spaccata di netto. Il chip è fuso. Così l'ho mollata. ...Mi dispiace, V. Davvero.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "Cazzo! Quello era il nostro biglietto, Jackie! Tutto quello per cui abbiamo lavorato!",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "Sinceramente? Quella cosa probabilmente avrebbe dato più guai di quanto valesse.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "Respiriamo ancora tutti e due, cabrón. È l'unico bottino che conta.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "Sì... lo so. Chinga'o. Ma senti -- sei ancora qui a incazzarti per questo, no?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Io e te. Abbiamo fatto fuori Smasher e siamo usciti a piedi da Konpeki Plaza. Nessuno ci crederà mai.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...Già. Forse hai ragione. La tecnologia corpo così ti compra solo una vita più corta.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Ehe già. Una storia da tramandare, V!  \\n(Una pausa) Allora... Cosa c'è dopo?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "Quello che vogliamo, hermano. Per una volta, nessuno scrive la nostra storia tranne noi.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Eh. Mi piace come suona. Dai, allora. Night City non si conquista da sola!",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Bar dei noodle.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(angolo segreto per il pisolino).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V: Non trascino Jackie in questo casino. Non dopo tutto quello che ha passato.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "Non posso chiamare Jackie durante una missione principale — non lo trascino in questa storia.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "Oh, merda...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "Per fortuna è tutto tranquillo per ora. Però non conviene restare.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "È... è Adam Smasher quello?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "Oh, MERDA!",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "Non moriremo — non oggi!",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. L'AV del vecchio Arasaka dovrebbe essere ancora parcheggiato sul tetto.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Dai, V — filiamo via di qui.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — installato",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik ha chiamato. Ha lasciato un messaggio. Dice che ha qualcosa da dirti su Jackie — qualcosa che non ha voluto dire al telefono.\\n\\nVai a trovarlo alla sua clinica.\\n\\n(Per le impostazioni della mod vai su Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik:",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Avrei dovuto dirtelo molto tempo fa, e mi dispiace di non averlo fatto. Jackie non è morto sul mio tavolo quella notte. Gli ho fatto tornare il battito, ho chiesto un favore, l'ho portato via prima che l'Arasaka venisse a cercare il corpo. È vivo, V — nascosto là fuori nei Badlands, e così deve restare. Il ragazzo non aveva alcuna possibilità di sopravvivere a quello a cui è sopravvissuto. E quando ha potuto parlare di nuovo, la prima cosa che ha chiesto è stata se tu te la fossi cavata. Prima non era sicuro dirtelo, V. Mi dispiace. Ti segno il posto sulla mappa. Vallo a riportare a casa.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Avrei dovuto dirtelo molto tempo fa, e mi dispiace di non averlo fatto. Jackie non è morto sul mio tavolo quella notte. Gli ho fatto tornare il battito, ho chiesto un favore, l'ho portato via prima che l'Arasaka venisse a cercare il corpo. Prima non era sicuro dirtelo, V. È vivo. Nascosto là fuori nei Badlands — e così deve restare. Ti ha aspettata. Ti segno il posto sulla mappa. Vallo a riportare a casa.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Chip — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Se stai leggendo questo, V, allora il doc ha mantenuto la parola e ti ha mandato fin qui. Sono io. Sono vivo.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik mi ha rimesso in sesto e mi ha fatto uscire di nascosto prima che 'Saka potesse incidere il mio nome su una lapide. Da allora me ne sto nascosto.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mama Welles si è arrabbiata tantissimo quando l'ha saputo. Credo che mi ammazzerebbe se tornassi a fare lavori — forse ha ragione. Ho chiuso con la vita da mercenario, V. Sul serio. Ma non potevo lasciarti credere di avermi seppellito.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Chiamami quando leggi questo. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Trova Jackie — Rocky Ridge, i Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Chiama Jackie",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Aspetta Jackie",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie è tornato.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Chip — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Ora tengo la carta della Morte girata a faccia in giù. Non riuscivo a guardarla — per mesi è stata l'unica cosa che vedevo chiudendo gli occhi.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Quando Vik mi ha detto che ce l'aveva fatta, che era là fuori a respirare nei Badlands, mi sono seduta sul pavimento del negozio e ho pianto finché l'incenso non si è consumato.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "Non farò finta di essere solo felice, V. Certe notti sono così arrabbiata che potrei urlare. È entrato in quel colpo sapendo il rischio. Per poco non ci lasciava. Per poco non mi lasciava.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Ma le carte non si sbagliavano. Il suo filo non si è spezzato. Si è solo sfilacciato... e ha tenuto.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Vacci piano con lui. E grazie — per essere andata a riportarlo a casa. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Chip — Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "Allora. Il mio Jackie è vivo, e io sono l'ultima a saperlo. Aspetta di essere madre, V, e che qualcuno ti nasconda una cosa del genere — poi parleremo di perdono.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "Ho acceso una candela per quel ragazzo ogni singolo giorno. Ho cucinato per un fantasma. E per tutto questo tempo lui era là nella polvere, a respirare, lasciando che lo piangessi. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "Eppure — è VIVO. Il mio ragazzo è vivo. Non ho smesso di ringraziare la Madonna da quando l'ho saputo. Mi fanno male le ginocchia per quanto ho pregato.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Ma ascoltami bene una volta, V: se accetta di nuovo un lavoro come quel colpo — se rischia la vita per gli eddies e la gloria un'altra volta — non aspetterò che questa città se lo prenda. Lo ammazzo io stessa.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Portamelo alla mia tavola. C'è un piatto che aspetta. C'è sempre stato un piatto che aspetta. — Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Parla",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Parla con Jackie   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Sto chiamando Jackie...",
    ["No answer."] = "Nessuna risposta.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Eccola. Siediti, prendi fiato — sei sempre in movimento.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Eccolo. Siediti, prendi fiato — sei sempre in movimento.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "Speravo passassi. Non dirlo a nessuno.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Ehi. ...Nah, niente. È solo bello vederti lì in piedi, tutto qui.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Vieni qua.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "Com'è davvero la vita tranquilla?",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "Ti piace stare dietro al bancone?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "Heywood sa ancora di casa?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "Ti manca, ogni tanto? La vita.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "E il corpo, regge? Sinceramente.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "Cosa ricordi di quella notte?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "Vai ancora da Vik?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "Avevi paura?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "Dai la colpa a me?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "Cosa vuoi adesso, Jackie?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Dillo. Qualunque cosa sia quella che continui a non dire.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Bene. Lenta. Il lento è un adattamento, ma va bene.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Certi giorni bene. Certi altri mi siedo nel mezzo del pomeriggio perché lo dice il corpo, e non discuto più con lui.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "Sinceramente? Non dormo bene. Verso le quattro sono sveglio, e resto lì ad ascoltare il palazzo. ...Ma sono qui per non dormire. È il patto, e lo rifarei.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "Il bar, soprattutto. E la gente mi trova con i suoi problemi. Piccoli. Mi piacciono quelli piccoli.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Un ragazzino dell'isolato doveva ritrovare suo fratello. Mi ci sono voluti due giorni e un sacco di parole, e non ha sparato nessuno. Il lavoro migliore che abbia mai fatto, e non paga niente.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "Ah, è... tranquilla. Eh. È questa la battuta, no? Si scopre che la calma è un'abilità. All'inizio ero pessimo.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "Mi becco ancora ad ascoltare se qualcosa va storto. In piedi al bar alle due del pomeriggio con uno straccio in mano, ad aspettare una sparatoria che non arriva. Sta migliorando.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Ci prenderai la mano.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Meglio dell'alternativa.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Potresti sempre tornare alla vita.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...No. No, V. Da lì mi hanno portato via di peso. Mama ha ricevuto una chiamata nella notte. Non glielo faccio due volte, e non lo faccio nemmeno a te. Non chiedermelo mai più.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Scusa. Hai ragione.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Lo capisco.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "Mi sta addosso. Mi rimpinza. Fa finta di non avere paura, ed è esattamente così che so che ne ha.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Accende una candela per me. Per ME. Sono seduto lì al suo tavolo e lei la accende lo stesso. Dice che è per la versione di me che non ce l'ha fatta.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "Non sa nemmeno metà di quello che è successo quella notte e non lo saprà mai. È una cosa che porto io così lei non deve. Lo capisci, vero?",
    ["I understand."] = "La porterebbe con te, se glielo lasciassi fare.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "È onesto. Nessuno mi ha mai puntato una pistola per una birra spillata male.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "So cosa beve ognuno e metà dei loro guai. Si scopre che anche quello è un tipo di potere. Solo quello lento.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Sempre. Gli stessi angoli, le stesse abuelas che urlano dalle stesse finestre.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Però adesso lo cammino diverso. Prima camminavo come se un giorno sarebbe stato mio. Adesso... cammino e basta.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...Sì. Sì, mi manca. Non gli spari. Il *noi*. Farci venire in mente una stupidaggine alle due di notte e farla alle quattro.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Mi manca essere quello che poteva sistemare tutto solo entrando dalla porta. È quella la parte che non guarisce, chica — non le costole. Le costole sono guarite.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Mi manca essere quello che poteva sistemare tutto solo entrando dalla porta. È quella la parte che non guarisce, hermano — non le costole. Le costole sono guarite.",
    ["We're still us."] = "Siamo ancora noi.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "Non sei mai stato solo quello.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "Sinceramente? Rigido. Le mattine fredde sono il peggio. Vik dice che è permanente e che dovrei farci amicizia.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "Ho una placca dentro, V. Sento dove finisce. Certe notti resto sdraiato con la mano sopra, solo per controllare che stia ancora facendo il suo lavoro. È quello che ho al posto di una cicatrice di cui vantarsi.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "Non devi per forza farci una battuta.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "Sei ancora in piedi.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Pezzi. La macchina. Tu che urlavi qualcosa che non sentivo. La voce di Dex sulla linea e tutto che stava già andando storto.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Mi ricordo che avevo freddo e che mi sembrava strano, perché era una notte calda. E mi ricordo di aver deciso di non dire niente, perché tu ne avevi già abbastanza. ...È stato stupido. Avrei dovuto dire qualcosa.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "Avresti dovuto dire qualcosa.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Cercavi di proteggermi.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "Non facciamolo.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Una volta al mese. Non mi fa pagare, il che mi fa impazzire, così gli porto qualcosa dalla cucina di Mama e siamo pari.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Quell'uomo ha tenuto la bocca chiusa a lungo perché io potessi restare morto. Sai cosa costa a uno come Vik? Se l'è portata da solo. Gli devo più delle costole.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...Sì. Non sul momento — sul momento c'è solo rumore e poi silenzio. Dopo. Svegliarmi in una stanza che non conoscevo, non riuscire a muovermi, non sapere se tu eri uscita. È quella la paura che è rimasta. Ci ho messo tanto a dirlo ad alta voce.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Sono contenta che tu l'abbia detto.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "Avevo paura anch'io.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "Di cosa? Del lavoro? V, io lo *volevo* quel lavoro. Metà te l'ho venduta IO. Te la porti dietro da tutto questo tempo pensando che te ne farei una colpa? ...Nah. No. Nemmeno una volta. Nemmeno per un secondo.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "Avevo bisogno di sentirlo.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Me la porto ancora dietro.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "Allora posala. Qui, adesso — non devi più trascinartela. Sono in piedi davanti a te. Guardami. Sono in piedi proprio qui.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...Va bene.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Qualcosa di piccolo, credo. Il bar. La domenica da Mama. Magari un posto con una finestra senza sbarre. Una volta volevo il mio nome su qualcosa. Adesso voglio restare abbastanza a lungo da annoiarmi. Suona patetico?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Suona come una vita.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "Non c'è niente di patetico.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...È la prima cosa che ho chiesto a Vik. Prima del mio stesso nome, prima di cosa mi fosse successo. Gli ho chiesto se tu eri uscita. Ha detto di sì, e sono tornato sotto per due giorni. Qualunque altra cosa si sia presa quella notte, quella non se l'è presa. È questa la cosa che continuo a non dire.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "Anch'io ho chiesto di te, ogni giorno.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Vai pure. Non vado da nessuna parte — è tutto il senso di me, adesso.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Ehi. Torna, eh? Non farci passare un mese.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Un Tequila Old Fashioned con uno spruzzo di cerveza e una guarnizione al peperoncino.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Uno shot di vodka con ghiaccio, succo di lime, ginger beer e, soprattutto... uno spruzzo d'amore.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Tequila doppia con granatina e lime. Niente di meglio per annegare i nervi.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "Ah, comunque, mi chiamo Jackie Welles. Vuoi segnarti la mia ricetta?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "Ti sei proprio costruito un numero.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "Come ti tratta Night City?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "Ahhhh, adoro questa città. La città delle opportunità infinite. E dell'odio fraterno.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "È importante avere gente a cui rivolgersi. Sai, tipo, ehm, una famiglia. Magari trovi la tua qui a Night City.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Puoi togliere il ratto dalla corpo, ma non toglierai mai la corpo dal ratto.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "Sai com'è... effetto farfalla o roba del genere.",
    ["I found mine."] = "La mia l'ho trovata.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Sono leale, costante nei miei affetti…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Ti ha aspettato, sai.",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "Cosa stai guardando ultimamente?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames! Un'iguana vera! Una, ehm, delle Piccole Antille, credo.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "Sì! Ho visto un documentario su di loro in TV. Estinte tipo trent'anni fa. Vengono dalle Piccole Antille.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "Ne hai fatta di strada, amico squamoso.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "Ti va un po' di tiro al bersaglio in VR?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "Ora sei uno da documentari sulla natura.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Un'iguana.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "Ultimamente è venuto qualcuno da te con un problema?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón deve imparare... che alla gente di Heywood non si fanno certi scherzi.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "Quello è pur sempre lavoro da fixer, Jackie.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Heywood è fortunata ad averti.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "Il ragazzino due porte più in là doveva dei soldi alla persona sbagliata. Non serviva una pistola — serviva qualcuno che si sedesse in una stanza ed essere la cosa più grossa lì dentro. A quanto pare quello sono ancora io.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Nessuno lo mette per iscritto. Niente fixer, niente percentuale, nessun nome su una bacheca. Solo una signora che bussa alla porta del bar alle undici di sera perché non ha altro posto dove andare. ...Il lavoro migliore che abbia mai fatto, e mi vergognerei a chiamarlo lavoro.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Parlami del tuo vecchio.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "Di sicuro meglio che essere il figlio di Raúl Welles.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Se n'è andato. È tutta qui la storia, e mi ci sono voluti trent'anni per accorciarla così. Mama non ha mai parlato male di lui, nemmeno una volta — si è semplicemente messa lì, in silenzio, e li è diventati entrambi.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "Non gli somigli per niente.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Ha fatto un lavoro pazzesco.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "Da dove ti viene il tuo codice, Jackie?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Prendi i Valentinos. Seguono Dio e la Santa Madre. L'onore per loro significa qualcosa.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "Il mondo delle gang non è tanto complicato. La forza è legge, i forti sopravvivono.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Oggi ti fanno azzerare qualcuno. Domani faranno azzerare te a qualcun altro.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "Ci vivi ancora secondo quello?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "È per questo che ne sei uscito, vero?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "Ci credi ancora a tutto questo? Dio, i santi?",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre diceva sempre che la pazienza paga, quindi…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Io sono morto, V. Comunque tu voglia dirlo — il cuore si è fermato e le mani di qualcuno l'hanno rimesso in moto. Se ci credo? Credo che QUALCOSA abbia tenuto la porta per un secondo. Non ho bisogno di sapere di chi fosse la mano.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "A Mama farebbe piacere sentirlo.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "Pensi mai al morire?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "La morte... non è che l'ultimo svolazzo.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Prima lo dicevo come se fosse una battuta furba. L'ho detto in un bar, una volta, col bicchiere in mano — tutti dobbiamo andarcene prima o poi, tanto vale farlo con stile. Poi me ne sono andato, V. Si scopre che di stile non ce n'è. C'è solo una stanza e qualcun altro che fa il lavoro di tenerti qui.",
    ["You're here now."] = "Adesso sei qui.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "Non andartene di nuovo, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "È ora che ci muoviamo, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "Muoviamoci, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "Sei con me, chica?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "Sei con me, mano?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "Hermano! Finalmente!",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "Non preoccuparti per me. Me la cavo.",
    ["You order."] = "Ordina tu.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Magari dopo.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "State insieme da un po' con Misty, eh?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "Ok, pronti. Andiamo.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "Anche a me fa piacere vederti, Jack. Come stai?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "Mi serve una mano, Jack. C'è del lavoro.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "Prima devo sistemare una cosa.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "Muoviamoci. Non ha senso aspettare.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Stammi bene, amigo.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "Cosa c'è di buono?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "Come va? A parte il lavoro, intendo.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "Anzi, devo andare.",
    ["See you around."] = "Ci vediamo.",
    ["Need your help."] = "Mi serve il tuo aiuto.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "Come sta la Señora Welles?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "Ci starebbe un drink.",
    ["Take care."] = "Stammi bene.",
    ["To this."] = "A questo.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "A un drink gratis non dico di no.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "Alla serie A!",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "Che combini?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Salutami Misty.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Giààà…",
    ["How's things?"] = "Come butta?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "Cos'hai da bere?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "Come sta tua madre?",
    ["Talk later."] = "Ci sentiamo dopo.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Niente che valga la pena scrivere. Ed è proprio quello il bello, chica.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Niente che valga la pena scrivere. Ed è proprio quello il bello, hermano.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Un drink lo prendo.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "Piccole Antil-che?",
    ["Later."] = "A dopo.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Stammi bene, amico.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Ti richiamo dopo.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "Ne parliamo dopo.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "Sì, ci si vede.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Devo scappare.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "Ci vediamo in serie A, Jack.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Addio, vecchio amico.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Volevo solo sapere come, insomma, te la passi.",
    ["Come on."] = "Andiamo.",
    ["You got me too."] = "E io ho te.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Mi prendo questa vittoria.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Ti si addice, Jackie.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "Anche i piccoli contano.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "È ancora il tuo territorio.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Sono contento che tu sia qui a dirlo.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Vik è una brava persona.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "Si può dire anche così.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Amen.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "Sedersi è ancora in lavorazione",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "Resteranno in piedi al tavolo invece di sedersi.\n\nL'animazione da seduti non è ancora legata ai mobili reali: viene riprodotta dove si trova il personaggio, quindi farlo sedere automaticamente lo lascia quasi sempre sospeso sopra la sedia. In piedi rendeva meglio che fluttuante, quindi in piedi è l'impostazione predefinita.\n\nPuoi farli sedere tu, e finiscono esattamente dove li metti: apri l'overlay CET, cerca «NCLives - Companions» -> «Sitting - seat them by hand». Mettiti sulla sedia rivolto nella direzione giusta, premi «Seat them here», poi allontanati e regola i cursori di altezza e angolo.\n\nFalli rialzare dallo stesso pannello prima di mandarli a casa.",
  },
  ["pl"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "To pachnie grubą aferą, V. Poczekam minutę — ale odpuść, albo mnie tu nie ma.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "Zegar tyka, hermana. Odpuść grubą rybę, albo mnie tu nie ma.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Tak jest, moja dziewczyna. Korpo-bajzel może poczekać — zostaję z tobą.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "Mod jest wczytany, ale nie udało mu się odczytać twoich postępów w fabule, więc nie uruchomi questa Jackiego samodzielnie.\n\nGdy skok będzie już za tobą, odpal go z Esc -> Ustawienia -> Mody -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Mów do mnie, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "Nie zaglądasz tu często, co? Heheh. Dobrze cię widzieć, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "Jak się czujesz? W porządku?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "Lepiej być nie może, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "Gotowa, żeby się ruszyć?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "No to zróbmy swoje.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "Czas ruszać w drogę, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "Ruszamy, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Ktoś coś tu dla ciebie zostawił...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — dziękujemy, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Zapłaciłeś 3 847 eddiesów z własnej kieszeni, żeby przejechać całą tę drogę do Rocky Ridge — tylko po to, żeby się przekonać, czy Jackie naprawdę wciąż tu oddycha. A potem poszedłeś i opowiedziałeś o tym całemu światu.\\n\\nWięc masz z powrotem swoje 3 847 eddiesów, zwrócone DZIESIĘCIOKROTNIE: 38 470. A Arch Jackie'ego w komplecie.\\n\\nNikt nie przejeżdża tylu kilometrów dla moda, którego nie kocha. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie i ekipa Jackie Lives",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "Chcesz skoczyć coś zjeść?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Zjedz coś z Jackiem: Idź do %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...a potem mówię, żeby uderzyć do Afterlife, hahaha... No wiesz, walnąć parę setek.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Spotkajmy się u Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Jasna sprawa, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "No więc, co jest grane?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "Czemu, co za pośpiech?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Chodź, skoczmy coś zjeść.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "Tak, mam dość jak na jeden dzień, mówię ci.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(Może następnym razem.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Ej, to jest to. Żadnych zleceń, żadnej strzelaniny — tylko ty i ja.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Mógłbym się przyzwyczaić do tego spokojnego życia, wiesz?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Dobrze tak posiedzieć chwilę, co, chica?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Dobrze tak posiedzieć chwilę, co, hermano?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "Tak czy siak... co ci chodzi po głowie, V?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "Tęsknisz czasem za życiem najemnika, Jackie?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "To miasto ostatnio mnie wykańcza.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "Myślisz, że Arasaka kiedyś zapłaci za to, co zrobiła?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "Tęsknię? Czasem. Za adrenaliną, za ekipą... ale zabrało mi więcej, niż dało, V. Wiesz to lepiej niż ktokolwiek.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "Za życiem? Nie. Za dobrymi robotami, może. Nie za zakończeniami — oboje widzieliśmy, jak to się kończy.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "Tak. Ale wyszliśmy z tego cało.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City ma gdzieś, czy żyjesz, czy giniesz, chica. Jedyne, co możesz zrobić, to znaleźć swoich ludzi i trzymać się ich mocno.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City ma gdzieś, czy żyjesz, czy giniesz, mano. Jedyne, co możesz zrobić, to znaleźć swoich ludzi i trzymać się ich mocno.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "To miasto przeżuwa każdego. Sztuką jest nie dać się połknąć w całości. Masz mnie, ja mam ciebie — na tym polega sztuka.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka? Ha. Takie grube ryby nigdy nie płacą, V. Ale wciąż oddychamy, a oni nie znają naszych imion. To już wygrana.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "Korpo-szczury zawsze spadają na cztery łapy. Najlepsza zemsta to żyć dobrze — jak teraz, z pełnym talerzem przed sobą.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty to moja kotwica, V. Sprawia, że patrzę w górę, kiedy chce mi się patrzeć w dół. Nie wiem, kim byłbym bez niej.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "Ja i Misty? Solidnie. Ona czyta te swoje karty, mówi, że gwiazdy mają plan. Ja jej tylko mówię, że ona jest moim planem.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "Siedziała z Mamą co tydzień, kiedy mnie nie było, wiesz? Co tydzień. Nigdy nie zdołam jej się odwdzięczyć.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Dobrze ci z nią.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Ha, dobra. Ruszajmy, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Ha, dobra. Ruszajmy, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "Tak, mamy miasto pod opieką. Vamonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Tuż za tobą, hermano. Ruszajmy.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Od razu do interesów, co, mano?",
    ["Let's go."] = "Chodźmy.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, jak się czujesz? W porządku?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Ech, wiesz jak jest, nie narzekam. Ale nie po to tu jesteśmy, żeby gadać o mnie.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mama mi mówiła, że dobre rzeczy przychodzą do tych, co potrafią czekać, a niektóre są nawet niezłe!",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "To moja krew, jasne. Coyote to jej speluna.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale, napijmy się.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hej, V, żyjesz? Jak tam w tym gnieździe żmij?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "Tu rodzą się legendy.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Od razu do interesów, co, chica?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "Tęsknisz za tym? Za życiem najemnika?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "To fach, V. Każdy ma krew na rękach. Godzisz się z tym i idziesz dalej.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "To zrób jeszcze jedną ostatnią, łatwą, na boku, ze mną.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Heheh, za to wypiję!",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "Ach, dzięki, Misty. Jesteś najlepsza.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "Czy Misty to przewidziała? Że się z tego wywiniesz?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Teraz wracam, znajduję Misty i robimy coś, co znów sprawi, że poczuję się żywy.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Zanim to zrobisz — mam zlecenie na boku, jeśli masz ochotę.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty wiedziała... Misty zawsze wie...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "Karty mówią, że pomożesz mi przy robocie?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Jestem tuż za tobą.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "No i? Gotowa?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V, hej! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "Nie zaglądasz tu często, co? Heheh. Dobrze cię widzieć, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hej, V – żyjesz? Jak tam w tym gnieździe żmij?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica! Nareszcie!",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "Nie zaglądasz tu często, co? Heheh. Dobrze cię widzieć, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Hej V - żyjesz? Jak tam w tym gnieździe żmij?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V, hej! Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Najwyższy czas.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "Sprawdzasz, czy nie gniję w jakimś śmietniku, jak większość chłopaków Wellesów?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Nieważne.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Trzymaj się, V, już idę.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "Tak, OK.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "Dobra, dobra, dobra.",
    ["You're all right."] = "Jesteś w porządku.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Nareszcie coś się dzieje...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Za późno, żeby się teraz wycofać. Chodź, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "I lepiej się pospieszmy.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "Idziesz? Czas jest cenny.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "Skręcimy im karki, zanim się zorientują.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Ha, ratusz powinien nam, kurwa, dziękować!",
    ["Finally!"] = "Nareszcie!",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...Jackie? Czy to naprawdę ty?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "To ja, V. Wpatruję się w ten telefon od wieków, zastanawiając się, czy kiedyś zadzwonisz.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Ty sukinsynu. Ty ŻYJESZ?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Pochowałam cię. OPŁAKAŁAM cię.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Tak. Tak, żyję, chica. I przepraszam. Chciałem dzwonić tysiąc razy — Vik mi nie pozwolił. Mówił, że 'Saka namierzy nas oboje w mig.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Tak. Tak, żyję, mano. I przepraszam. Chciałem dzwonić tysiąc razy — Vik mi nie pozwolił. Mówił, że 'Saka namierzy nas oboje w mig.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Tygodnie, Jackie. Pozwoliłeś mi myśleć, że CIĘ NIE MA.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Jestem tak na ciebie wściekła, że nie mogę—  ...  nic ci nie jest?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Wiem. WIEM. Zasłużyłem na każde słowo. No dawaj — wal we mnie. Zniosę to lepiej niż płytę w kostnicy Vika, ha.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...Naprawdę mnie przestraszyłeś, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "No więc... mów do mnie, V. Od czego w ogóle zaczniemy, co?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "Tak. Jestem tu. Tym razem nigdzie się nie wybieram. Co jeszcze ci chodzi po głowie?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(cicho) Coś jeszcze, chica?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(cicho) Coś jeszcze, mano?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Dość gadania. Chodź tu — muszę cię zobaczyć na własne oczy.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "Twój motor. Wciąż stoi w moim garażu, wiesz?",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "Było ciężko, odkąd cię zabrakło, człowieku...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "No to jak sobie radzisz tam na pustyni?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...Moja maszyna. Dios mío, nie chciałem pytać. No dawaj, nie męcz mnie, V — ten motor to jedyny kawałek dawnego mnie, jaki mi został. Powiedz mi wprost. Nic jej nie jest?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Spokojnie, hermano. Jest cała i zdrowa. Przyjedź po nią.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "No właśnie... przyzwyczaiłam się do niej, Jackie. Zatrzymuję ją.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Uff... Gracias, V. Nie masz pojęcia, ile to dla mnie znaczy. Trzymałaś ją dla mnie przy życiu przez cały ten czas.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "Jest twoja, Jackie. Zawsze była.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Ha. (długa pauza) Nie, nie — wiesz co? Zatrzymaj ją. Tak to widzę: to ona trzymała CIEBIE przy życiu, kiedy ja nie mogłem. Zasłużyła na ciebie, a ty na nią. Tylko nie pozwól jej stać, V. Nienawidzi tego.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Ha. (długa pauza) Nie — wiesz co? Zatrzymaj ją, hermano. Trzymała CIEBIE przy życiu, kiedy ja nie mogłem. Tylko nie pozwól jej stać, V. Nienawidzi tego.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...Będę o nią dbać. Obiecuję.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "Ciężko, czyli jak? Mów do mnie, V. Co jest grane?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Wszystko się posypało po Konpeki. To... skomplikowane. Długa historia.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "Straciłam tamtej nocy więcej, niż myślisz. O mało nie straciłam też samej siebie.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...No tak. Zawsze milkłaś przy ciężkich sprawach, chica. Dobra. Nie będę naciskał. Na razie.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...No tak. Zawsze milkłeś przy ciężkich sprawach, mano. Dobra. Nie będę naciskał. Na razie.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Opowiem ci wszystko. Tylko... nie przez telefon.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(westchnienie) Szczerze? Ta konspira tutaj wykańcza mnie do reszty, V. Tęsknię za miastem. Za światłami, hałasem, gotowaniem Mamy. Chcę wrócić do domu. Ale to nie takie proste.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "Czemu nie? Co cię tam trzyma?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Ten chip... to, co zostało w środku, wciąż działa. Jakiś ochronny soft Arasaki - nadaje moje położenie jak latarnia. Tak by mnie 'Saka znalazła — dlatego muszę być poza zasięgiem. Vik próbował go wyciąć. Nie dał rady.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "To znajdziemy kogoś, kto DA radę. Netrunnera, rippera — kogokolwiek.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "Wyciągniemy go z ciebie. Nie zamierzam stracić cię drugi raz, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Naprawdę byś to zrobiła? ... No jasne, że tak. Dobra, chica. Znajdziemy kogoś, kto skasuje to coś. Może odzyskam swoje życie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Naprawdę byś to zrobił? ... No jasne, że tak. Dobra, mano. Znajdziemy kogoś, kto skasuje to coś. Może odzyskam swoje życie.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "Załatwimy to. Ale to na jutro — chodź tu. Już.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "Załatwimy to. Bez obaw. Do tego czasu cię pilnuję.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Muszę być z tobą szczery, choom. Po tym, co się stało... nie mogę już brać poważnych zleceń. Ciało nie wytrzyma. A Mama? (śmiech) Dokończyłaby to, co 'Saka zaczęła, gdybym tylko spróbował.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Nikt cię o to nie prosi. A teraz przestań zwlekać i chodź tu, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Dobrze. Dość już wykrwawiłeś się za to miasto.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...Tak. Tak, dobra. Dość gadania. Gdzie jesteś? Nie — nie ruszaj się, już jadę do ciebie. Trzymaj się, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...Tak. Tak, dobra. Dość gadania. Gdzie jesteś? Nie — nie ruszaj się, już jadę do ciebie. Trzymaj się, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "Dobra. Będę tu. Pospiesz się.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Już jadę, V. Nigdzie się nie ruszaj. ...Spotkamy się przy stacji benzynowej.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Sam też lepiej wyglądałeś, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(patrzysz na niego przez chwilę) ...To ty.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "Tak, tak — pustynia nie robi facetowi dobrze na urodzie. Ale ty? ...Cholera. Miód na oczy, V. Tęskniłem za tą twarzą bardziej, niż potrafię wyrazić.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "Tak, tak — pustynia nie robi facetowi dobrze na urodzie. Ale ty, hermano? Cholera, ależ widok. Tęskniłem za tą twoją brzydką gębą.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "Oboje wciąż stoimy na nogach. To się liczy.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Chwila. Mój motor. Wciąż go masz? Przez cały ten czas trzymałaś go?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "Jest w moim garażu, Jackie. Czeka na ciebie. Masz — twoje kluczyki.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Czyli naprawdę go zatrzymujesz, co? (śmieje się) Dobra, dobra — to TY prowadzisz, chica. Chodź. Pokaż mi, że był w dobrych rękach.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Czyli naprawdę go zatrzymujesz, co? (śmieje się) Dobra — to TY prowadzisz, hermano. Chodź. Pokaż mi, że był w dobrych rękach.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Wsiadaj, Jackie. Wracajmy do domu.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "Trzymałaś go dla mnie na chodzie. Przez cały ten czas... Cholera, V. To ostatni kawałek dawnego mnie, o tu.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "Chodźmy, hermano, a ty se ją przejedziesz.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Chodź, V. Wracajmy do domu. ...I słuchaj — koniec z pogrzebami. Przez dobry kawał czasu, dobra?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Chodź, hermano. Wracajmy do domu. ...I słuchaj — koniec z pogrzebami. Przez dobry kawał czasu, dobra?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... udało się. Naprawdę się udało. Nie mogę w to uwierzyć, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(łapiesz oddech) ...Tak. Udało się.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "Żyjemy, chica. Oboje.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "Ledwo złapałem oddech od czasu Konpeki. ...Dobrze tak zatrzymać się na sekundę.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Ha... no. Właśnie. ...Szkoda, że nikt się nigdy nie dowie, że to byliśmy my tam na górze.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "A tak przy okazji -- gdzie schowałeś tę walizkę?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...Jackie?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Miałem ją. Trzymałem ją w rękach, V, przysięgam, że miałem...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie! Biochip -- ta pieprzona walizka z biochipem, gdzie ona jest?!",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "Próbowałem ją utrzymać, przysięgam. Smasher -- ten hijo de puta... W walizkę trafiła kula, rozpruła się na oścież. Chip to złom. Więc ją rzuciłem. ...Przepraszam, V. Naprawdę.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "Kurwa! To był nasz bilet, Jackie! Wszystko, na co zapracowaliśmy!",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "Szczerze? To coś pewnie i tak przysporzyłoby więcej kłopotu, niż było warte.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "Oboje oddychamy, cabrón. To jedyny łup, który się liczy.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "Tak... wiem. Chinga'o. Ale hej -- wciąż tu jesteś, żeby się o to wkurwić, no nie?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Ty i ja. Zdjęliśmy Smashera i wyszliśmy z Konpeki Plaza na własnych nogach. Nikt nigdy w to nie uwierzy.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...Tak. Może masz rację. Taka korpo-technologia kupuje ci tylko krótsze życie.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Hehe no. Historia na wieki, V!  \\n(pauza) No więc... Co teraz?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "Cokolwiek zechcemy, hermano. Choć raz nikt nie pisze naszej historii oprócz nas.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Ha. Podoba mi się, jak to brzmi. No to chodź. Night City samo się nie zawojuje!",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Bar z makaronem.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(sekretne miejsce na drzemkę).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V: Nie wciągam Jackie'ego w ten bajzel. Nie po tym wszystkim, co przeszedł.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "Nie mogę dzwonić do Jackie'ego w trakcie głównej misji — nie wciągam go w to.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "O, cholera...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "Na szczęście na razie czysto. Ale nie ma co się tu zatrzymywać.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "Czy to je— czy to Adam Smasher?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "O, CHOLERA!",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "Nie umrzemy — nie dzisiaj!",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. AV starego Arasaki powinien wciąż stać na dachu.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Chodź, V — zwiewajmy stąd.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — zainstalowano",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik dzwonił. Zostawił wiadomość. Mówi, że ma ci coś do powiedzenia o Jackiem — coś, czego nie chciał zdradzić przez telefon.\\n\\nOdwiedź go w jego klinice.\\n\\n(Ustawienia moda znajdziesz w Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik:",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Powinienem był powiedzieć ci to dawno temu i przepraszam, że tego nie zrobiłem. Jackie nie umarł tamtej nocy na moim stole. Przywróciłem mu puls, poprosiłem o przysługę, wywiozłem go, zanim Arasaka przyszła szukać ciała. Żyje, V — ukrywa się tam w Badlands i tak musi zostać. Dzieciak nie miał prawa przeżyć tego, co przeżył. A kiedy znów mógł mówić, pierwsze, o co zapytał, to czy ty się wydostałaś. Wcześniej po prostu nie było bezpiecznie ci powiedzieć, V. Przepraszam. Zaznaczam ci to miejsce na mapie. Jedź i sprowadź go z powrotem.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Powinienem był powiedzieć ci to dawno temu i przepraszam, że tego nie zrobiłem. Jackie nie umarł tamtej nocy na moim stole. Przywróciłem mu puls, poprosiłem o przysługę, wywiozłem go, zanim Arasaka przyszła szukać ciała. Wcześniej po prostu nie było bezpiecznie ci powiedzieć, V. Żyje. Ukrywa się tam w Badlands — i tak musi zostać. Czekał na ciebie. Zaznaczam ci to miejsce na mapie. Jedź i sprowadź go z powrotem.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Shard — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Jeśli to czytasz, V, to znaczy, że doktor dotrzymał słowa i wysłał cię tutaj. To ja. Żyję.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik mnie pozszywał i przemycił, zanim 'Saka zdążyła wykuć moje imię na płycie nagrobnej. Od tamtej pory się ukrywam.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mama Welles była taka wściekła, kiedy się dowiedziała. Chyba by mnie zabiła, gdybym wrócił do zleceń — może i ma rację. Koniec z życiem najemnika dla mnie, V. Naprawdę. Ale nie mogłem pozwolić, żebyś dalej myślała, że mnie pochowałaś.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Zadzwoń, jak to przeczytasz. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Znajdź Jackie'ego — Rocky Ridge, Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Zadzwoń do Jackie'ego",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Zaczekaj na Jackie'ego",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie wrócił.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Shard — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Trzymam teraz kartę Śmierci odwróconą do dołu. Nie mogłam na nią patrzeć — przez miesiące widziałam tylko ją, ilekroć zamykałam oczy.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Kiedy Vik powiedział mi, że mu się udało, że jest tam gdzieś, oddycha w Badlands, usiadłam na podłodze sklepu i płakałam, aż dopaliło się kadzidło.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "Nie będę udawać, że jestem tylko szczęśliwa, V. Niektórych nocy jestem tak wściekła, że mogłabym krzyczeć. Wszedł w ten skok, znając ryzyko. O mało nas nie zostawił. O mało nie zostawił mnie.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Ale karty się nie myliły. Jego nić się nie przerwała. Tylko się przetarła... i wytrzymała.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Bądź dla niego wyrozumiała. I dziękuję — że pojechałaś sprowadzić go do domu. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Shard — Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "No więc. Mój Jackie żyje, a ja dowiaduję się o tym ostatnia. Poczekaj, aż zostaniesz matką, V, i ktoś zatai przed tobą coś takiego — wtedy pogadamy o wybaczeniu.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "Zapalałam za tego chłopca świeczkę każdego dnia. Gotowałam dla ducha. A on przez cały ten czas był tam w pyle, oddychał, pozwalał mi go opłakiwać. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "A jednak — on ŻYJE. Mój chłopiec żyje. Odkąd się dowiedziałam, nie przestałam dziękować Najświętszej Panience. Aż mnie od tego kolana bolą.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Ale posłuchaj mnie ten jeden raz, V: jeśli jeszcze kiedyś weźmie zlecenie takie jak ten skok — jeśli jeszcze raz zaryzykuje życie dla eddiesów i chwały — nie będę czekać, aż to miasto go zabierze. Zabiję go sama.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Przyprowadź go do mojego stołu. Czeka talerz. Zawsze czekał talerz. — Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Rozmawiaj",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Porozmawiaj z Jackiem   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Dzwonię do Jackie'ego...",
    ["No answer."] = "Brak odpowiedzi.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "O, jest. Siadaj, złap oddech — ciągle jesteś w biegu.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "O, jest. Siadaj, złap oddech — ciągle jesteś w biegu.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "Liczyłem, że wpadniesz. Nie mów nikomu, że to powiedziałem.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Hej. ...Nie, nic. Po prostu dobrze cię widzieć na nogach, tyle.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Chodź tu.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "Jak ci naprawdę idzie z tym spokojnym życiem?",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "Lubisz robotę za barem?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "Heywood wciąż jest jak dom?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "Tęsknisz czasem? Za tym życiem.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "Jak ciało daje radę? Szczerze.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "Co pamiętasz z tamtej nocy?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "Zaglądasz jeszcze do Vika?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "Bałeś się?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "Obwiniasz mnie?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "Czego teraz chcesz, Jackie?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Powiedz to. Cokolwiek to jest, czego ciągle nie mówisz.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Dobrze. Wolno. Wolno to zmiana, do której trzeba przywyknąć, ale jest dobrze.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Bywają dobre dni. Bywają takie, że siadam w środku popołudnia, bo ciało tak mówi, a ja się z nim już nie kłócę.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "Szczerze? Źle sypiam. Koło czwartej już nie śpię, leżę i słucham kamienicy. ...Ale po to tu jestem, żeby nie spać. Taki układ, i wziąłbym go jeszcze raz.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "Głównie bar. I ludzie znajdują mnie ze swoimi problemami. Małymi. Lubię te małe.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Dzieciak z ulicy szukał brata. Zeszły mi dwa dni i mnóstwo gadania, i nikt nie oberwał. Najlepsza robota, jaką zrobiłem, i nic za nią nie ma.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "Ech, jest... cicho. Heh. To jest ten żart, nie? Okazuje się, że cisza to umiejętność. Na początku byłem w tym kiepski.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "Wciąż łapię się na tym, że nasłuchuję, czy coś nie pójdzie źle. Stoję w barze o drugiej po południu ze szmatą w ręku i czekam na strzelaninę, która nie nadchodzi. Jest coraz lepiej.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Załapiesz, o co w tym chodzi.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Lepsze to niż alternatywa.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Zawsze możesz wrócić do tego życia.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...Nie. Nie, V. Mnie stamtąd wynieśli. Mama dostała telefon w nocy. Nie zrobię jej tego drugi raz, i tobie też nie. Nigdy więcej mnie o to nie pytaj.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Przepraszam. Masz rację.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Rozumiem.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "Skacze koło mnie. Karmi. Udaje, że się nie boi, i właśnie po tym wiem, że się boi.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Zapala za mnie świeczkę. Za MNIE. Siedzę przy jej stole, a ona i tak ją zapala. Mówi, że za tę wersję mnie, która stamtąd nie wyszła.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "Nie zna nawet połowy tego, co się stało tamtej nocy, i nigdy nie pozna. To niosę ja, żeby ona nie musiała. Rozumiesz to, prawda?",
    ["I understand."] = "Niosłaby to razem z tobą, gdybyś jej pozwolił.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "To uczciwe. Nikt jeszcze nie wyciągnął na mnie spluwy za źle nalane piwo.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "Znam drink każdego i połowę ich zmartwień. Okazuje się, że to też jest rodzaj władzy. Tylko ten powolny.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Zawsze był. Te same rogi, te same abuelas wrzeszczące z tych samych okien.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Tyle że teraz chodzę po nim inaczej. Kiedyś chodziłem tak, jakbym miał go kiedyś mieć na własność. Teraz po prostu... chodzę.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...Tak. Tak, tęsknię. Nie za strzelaniem. Za tym *my*. Wymyślić coś głupiego o drugiej w nocy i zrobić to o czwartej.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Tęsknię za byciem gościem, który naprawiał sprawę samym wejściem do drzwi. To jest ta część, która się nie goi, chica — nie żebra. Żebra się zrosły.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Tęsknię za byciem gościem, który naprawiał sprawę samym wejściem do drzwi. To jest ta część, która się nie goi, hermano — nie żebra. Żebra się zrosły.",
    ["We're still us."] = "Wciąż jesteśmy sobą.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "Nigdy nie byłeś tylko tym.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "Szczerze? Sztywno. Zimne poranki są najgorsze. Vik mówi, że to już zostanie i że mam się z tym zaprzyjaźnić.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "Mam w sobie płytkę, V. Czuję, gdzie się kończy. W niektóre noce leżę z ręką na niej i sprawdzam, czy dalej robi swoje. To mam zamiast blizny, którą można się chwalić.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "Nie musisz z tego robić żartu.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "Wciąż stoisz na nogach.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Kawałki. Samochód. Ty krzyczysz coś, czego nie słyszałem. Głos Dexa na linii i wszystko już się sypie.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Pamiętam, że było mi zimno i że wydało mi się to dziwne, bo noc była ciepła. I pamiętam, że postanowiłem nic nie mówić, bo ty i tak miałaś już dość na głowie. ...To było głupie. Powinienem był coś powiedzieć.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "Powinieneś był coś powiedzieć.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Chciałeś mnie chronić.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "Nie róbmy tego.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Raz w miesiącu. Nie bierze ode mnie kasy, co doprowadza mnie do szału, więc przynoszę mu coś z kuchni Mamy i mówimy, że jesteśmy kwita.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Ten człowiek długo trzymał gębę na kłódkę, żebym mógł zostać martwy. Wiesz, ile to kosztuje kogoś takiego jak Vik? Niósł to sam. Jestem mu winien więcej niż żebra.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...Tak. Nie wtedy — wtedy jest tylko głośno, a potem cicho. Później. Obudzić się w pokoju, którego nie znam, nie móc się ruszyć, nie wiedzieć, czy ty wyszłaś. To ten strach, który został. Długo mi zeszło, zanim powiedziałem to na głos.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Cieszę się, że to powiedziałeś.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "Ja też się bałam.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "Za co? Za robotę? V, ja *chciałem* tej roboty. Połowę z niej sam ci wcisnąłem. Nosiłaś to w sobie cały ten czas, myśląc, że mam ci to za złe? ...Nie. Nie. Ani razu. Ani przez sekundę.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "Musiałam to usłyszeć.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Wciąż to noszę.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "To odłóż. Tu i teraz — nie musisz tego już ze sobą taszczyć. Stoję przed tobą. Popatrz na mnie. Stoję dokładnie tutaj.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...Dobra.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Coś małego, chyba. Bar. Niedziela u Mamy. Może mieszkanie z oknem bez krat. Kiedyś chciałem, żeby moje imię było na czymś. Teraz chcę pożyć na tyle długo, żeby się znudzić. Brzmi żałośnie?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Brzmi jak życie.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "Nie ma w tym nic żałosnego.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...O to zapytałem Vika najpierw. Przed własnym imieniem, przed tym, co się ze mną stało. Zapytałem, czy ty wyszłaś. Powiedział, że tak, i odpłynąłem na dwa dni. Cokolwiek innego zabrała tamta noc, tego nie zabrała. To jest to, czego ciągle nie mówię.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "Ja też o ciebie pytałam, codziennie.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Idź. Nigdzie się nie wybieram — o to teraz we mnie chodzi.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Hej. Wróć, co? Nie rób z tego miesiąca.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Tequila Old Fashioned z odrobiną cervezy i papryczką chili.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Kieliszek wódki z lodem, sok z limonki, piwo imbirowe i, co najważniejsze... odrobina miłości.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Podwójna tequila z grenadyną i limonką. Nic lepszego na stargane nerwy.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "A, przy okazji, nazywam się Jackie Welles. Chcesz zapisać mój przepis?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "Masz cały numer w zanadrzu.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "Jak cię traktuje Night City?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "Ahhhh, kocham to miasto. Miasto nieskończonych możliwości. I braterskiej nienawiści.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "Ważne jest mieć ludzi, do których możesz się zwrócić. No wiesz, takich jak... rodzina. Może znajdziesz swoją tu, w Night City.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Można wyciągnąć szczura z korpo, ale korpo ze szczura nigdy.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "No wiesz... efekt motyla czy coś.",
    ["I found mine."] = "Ja swoją znalazłem.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Jestem wierny, stały w uczuciach…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Ona czekała, wiesz.",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "Co ostatnio oglądasz?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames! Prawdziwa iguana! Taka, yyy, z Małych Antyli, chyba.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "Tak! Widziałem o nich program w telewizji. Wymarły jakieś trzydzieści lat temu. Są z Małych Antyli.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "Kawał drogi przebyłeś, łuskaty przyjacielu.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "Masz ochotę postrzelać do tarczy w VR?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "Teraz jesteś fanem dokumentów przyrodniczych.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Iguana.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "Przychodził ostatnio ktoś do ciebie z problemem?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón musi się nauczyć... że ludzi z Heywood się nie robi w konia.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "To wciąż robota fixera, Jackie.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Heywood ma szczęście, że cię ma.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "Dzieciak dwa domy dalej był winien kasę niewłaściwemu gościowi. Nie trzeba było spluwy — trzeba było kogoś, kto usiądzie w pokoju i będzie w nim największy. Okazuje się, że to wciąż ja.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Nikt tego nie zapisuje. Żadnego fixera, żadnej działki, żadnego nazwiska na tablicy. Tylko kobieta pukająca do drzwi baru o jedenastej w nocy, bo nie ma dokąd pójść. ...Najlepsza robota, jaką w życiu zrobiłem, a wstyd mi nazywać to robotą.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Opowiedz mi o swoim starym.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "Na pewno lepsze niż bycie synem Raúla Wellesa.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Odszedł. To cała historia, a zajęło mi trzydzieści lat, żeby ją tak skrócić. Mama nigdy o nim źle nie powiedziała, ani razu — po prostu po cichu stała się nimi obojgiem.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "W niczym go nie przypominasz.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Odwaliła kawał dobrej roboty.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "Skąd masz swój kodeks, Jackie?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Weź Valentinos. Idą za Bogiem i Santa Madre. Honor coś dla nich znaczy.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "Świat gangów nie jest zbyt skomplikowany. Siła ma rację, silni przeżywają.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Dziś każą ci kogoś wyzerować. Jutro każą komuś innemu wyzerować ciebie.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "Wciąż się tego trzymasz?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "Dlatego się wycofałeś, prawda?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "Nadal w to wszystko wierzysz? W Boga, w świętych?",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre zawsze mówiła, że cierpliwość popłaca, więc…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Ja umarłem, V. Jakkolwiek to nazwiesz — serce mi stanęło, a czyjeś ręce znowu je uruchomiły. Czy wierzę? Wierzę, że COŚ przytrzymało drzwi przez sekundę. Nie muszę wiedzieć, czyja to była ręka.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "Mama ucieszyłaby się, słysząc to.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "Myślisz o umieraniu?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "Śmierć... to nic więcej niż ostatni ozdobnik.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Kiedyś mówiłem to tak, jakby to było błyskotliwe. Powiedziałem to raz w barze z drinkiem w ręce — każdy kiedyś musi odejść, więc czemu nie z klasą. A potem odszedłem, V. Okazuje się, że nie ma w tym żadnej klasy. Jest tylko pokój i ktoś inny, kto odwala robotę utrzymania cię przy życiu.",
    ["You're here now."] = "Teraz tu jesteś.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "Nie odchodź znowu, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "Czas w drogę, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "Ruszamy, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "Jesteś ze mną, chica?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "Jesteś ze mną, mano?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "Hermano! Nareszcie!",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "Nie martw się o mnie. Poradzę sobie.",
    ["You order."] = "Ty zamawiaj.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Może później.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "Jesteś z Misty już kawał czasu, co?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "Dobra, gotowe. Ruszamy.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "Ciebie też miło widzieć, Jack. Co słychać?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "Potrzebuję twojej pomocy, Jack. Mam robotę.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "Najpierw muszę coś załatwić.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "Jedziemy. Nie ma na co czekać.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Trzymaj się, amigo.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "Co tu dobrego do jedzenia?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "Co słychać? Poza robotą, znaczy.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "Właściwie to muszę lecieć.",
    ["See you around."] = "Do zobaczenia.",
    ["Need your help."] = "Potrzebuję twojej pomocy.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "Co słychać u Señory Welles?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "Przydałby się drink.",
    ["Take care."] = "Uważaj na siebie.",
    ["To this."] = "Za to.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "Darmowemu drinkowi nie odmówię.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "Za wejście do wyższej ligi!",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "Co porabiasz?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Pozdrów Misty ode mnie.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Jaaasne…",
    ["How's things?"] = "Jak leci?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "Co masz do picia?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "Co u twojej mamy?",
    ["Talk later."] = "Pogadamy później.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Nic wartego zapisania. I o to właśnie chodzi, chica.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Nic wartego zapisania. I o to właśnie chodzi, hermano.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Poproszę drinka.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "Małe Anty-co?",
    ["Later."] = "Na razie.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Trzymaj się, stary.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Oddzwonię później.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "Pogadamy innym razem.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "Jasne, na razie.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Muszę lecieć.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "Do zobaczenia w wyższej lidze, Jack.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Żegnaj, stary przyjacielu.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Chodziło tylko o to, jak się trzymasz.",
    ["Come on."] = "Chodź.",
    ["You got me too."] = "A ja ciebie.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Biorę to zwycięstwo.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Pasuje ci to, Jackie.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "Te małe też się liczą.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "Wciąż twój teren.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Cieszę się, że jesteś tu, żeby to powiedzieć.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Vik to porządny gość.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "Można to tak nazwać.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Amen.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "Siadanie jest wciąż w budowie",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "Przy stole będą stać, zamiast usiąść.\n\nAnimacja siadania nie jest jeszcze powiązana z prawdziwymi meblami — odtwarza się tam, gdzie postać akurat stoi, więc automatyczne sadzanie zwykle zostawia ją unoszącą się nad krzesłem. Stanie wyglądało lepiej niż lewitowanie, więc stanie jest domyślne.\n\nMożesz posadzić ich samodzielnie i trafi dokładnie tam, gdzie ustawisz: otwórz nakładkę CET, znajdź „NCLives - Companions” -> „Sitting - seat them by hand”. Stań na krześle, zwrócony w stronę, w którą mają patrzeć, wciśnij „Seat them here”, cofnij się i dopracuj suwakami wysokość i kąt.\n\nPodnieś ich tym samym panelem, zanim odeślesz ich do domu.",
  },
  ["ptbr"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "Isso tá cheirando a encrenca grande, V. Espero um minuto — mas larga isso, ou eu vou embora.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "O relógio tá correndo, hermana. Larga o peixe grande ou eu vou embora.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Essa é a minha garota. A treta corpo que espere — eu continuo com você.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "O mod está carregado, mas não conseguiu ler o seu progresso na história, então não vai iniciar a missão do Jackie sozinho.\n\nQuando o assalto ficar para trás, inicie em Esc -> Configurações -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Fala comigo, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "Não aparece muito por aqui, né? Heheh. Que bom te ver, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "Como você tá? Tudo certo?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "Não tem nada melhor, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "Pronta pra dar no pé?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "Então vamos fazer o que a gente faz.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "Já tá na hora da gente ir, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "Bora se mexer, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Deixaram uma coisa aqui pra você...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — obrigado, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Você pagou 3.847 eddies do próprio bolso pra dirigir até Rocky Ridge — só pra descobrir se o Jackie estava mesmo respirando aqui fora. Depois foi lá e contou pro mundo inteiro.\\n\\nEntão aqui estão seus 3.847 eddies de volta, devolvidos DEZ VEZES: 38.470. E a Arch do Jackie junto.\\n\\nNinguém roda tanta estrada assim por um mod que não ama. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie e a equipe do Jackie Lives",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "Quer comer alguma coisa?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Comer algo com o Jackie: Vá até %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...aí eu digo pra gente cair no Afterlife, hahaha... Sabe, virar umas doses.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Me encontra no Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Isso aí, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "Enfim, o que tá rolando?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "Por quê, qual é a pressa?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Ândale, vamos comer alguma coisa.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "É, já deu por hoje, pode acreditar.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(Talvez na próxima.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Cara, isso cai bem demais. Sem trampos, sem tiroteio — só você e eu.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Dava pra se acostumar com essa de vida tranquila, sabe?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Bom só sentar um pouco, né, chica?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Bom só sentar um pouco, né, hermano?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "Enfim... o que tá passando pela sua cabeça, V?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "Você sente falta da vida de mercenário, Jackie?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "Essa cidade tem me acabado ultimamente.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "Acha que a Arasaka um dia paga pelo que fez?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "Sentir falta? Alguns dias. A adrenalina, a equipe... mas tirou mais do que deu, V. Você sabe disso melhor que ninguém.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "A vida? Nah. Os bons trampos, talvez. Os finais não — a gente viu como eles acabam.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "É. Mas a gente saiu com vida.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City não liga se você vive ou morre, chica. A única coisa que dá pra fazer é achar a sua gente e segurar firme.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City não liga se você vive ou morre, mano. A única coisa que dá pra fazer é achar a sua gente e segurar firme.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "Essa cidade mastiga todo mundo. O truque é não deixar ela te engolir inteiro. Você tem a mim, eu tenho você — esse é o truque.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka? Heh. Peixe grande desse tipo nunca paga, V. Mas a gente segue respirando e eles não sabem nossos nomes. Isso é ganhar.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "Ratos corpo sempre caem de pé. A melhor vingança é viver bem — tipo agora, com o prato cheio na nossa frente.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "A Misty é minha âncora, V. Me faz olhar pra cima quando eu quero olhar pra baixo. Nem sei o que eu seria sem ela.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "Eu e a Misty? Firmes. Ela lê as cartas, diz que as estrelas têm um plano. Eu só digo pra ela que ela é o meu plano.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "Ela sentou com a Mama toda semana que eu fiquei fora, sabe. Toda semana. Nunca vou conseguir retribuir isso.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Ela te faz bem.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Heh, beleza. Bora, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Heh, beleza. Bora, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "É, a gente tem uma cidade pra cuidar. Vamonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Bem atrás de você, hermano. Bora se mexer.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Direto ao ponto, hein, mano?",
    ["Let's go."] = "Vamos.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, como você tá? Tudo certo?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Eh, você sabe como é, não posso reclamar. Mas a gente não veio aqui pra jogar conversa fora sobre mim.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "A Mama me dizia que as coisas chegam pra quem sabe esperar, e algumas até são boas!",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "É do meu sangue, claro. O Coyote é o boteco dela.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale, vamos beber.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Ei, V, tá viva? Como vão as coisas no ninho de cobra?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "É aqui que nascem as lendas.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Direto ao ponto, hein, chica?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "Você sente falta? Da vida de mercenário?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "É o ramo, V. Todo mundo tem sangue nas mãos. Você aceita e segue em frente.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "Então faz um último fácil, um trampo extra, comigo.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Heheh, brindo a isso!",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "Ah, valeu, Misty. Você é a melhor.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "A Misty viu isso vindo? Que você ia escapar?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Agora eu volto, acho a Misty e a gente faz alguma coisa que me faça sentir vivo de novo.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Antes disso — tenho um trampo extra, se você topar.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "A Misty sabia... A Misty sempre sabe...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "As cartas dizem que você vai me ajudar num trampo?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Tô bem atrás de você.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "E aí? Tá pronta?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V, ei! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "Não aparece muito por aqui, né? Heheh. Que bom te ver, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Ei, V – tá viva? Como vão as coisas no ninho de cobra?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica! Finalmente!",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "Não aparece muito por aqui, né? Heheh. Que bom te ver, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Ei V - tá viva? Como vão as coisas no ninho de cobra?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V, ei! Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Já não era sem tempo.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "Veio ver se eu não tô apodrecendo numa lixeira, tipo a maioria dos Welles?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Deixa pra lá.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Aguenta aí, V, tô indo.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "É, tá bom.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "Beleza, beleza, beleza.",
    ["You're all right."] = "Você é gente boa.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Finalmente tá acontecendo alguma coisa...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Tarde demais pra voltar atrás agora. Ândale, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "E é bom a gente ser rápido.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "Você vem? Tempo é precioso.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "A gente quebra o pescoço deles antes que percebam.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Heh, a prefeitura devia é agradecer a gente, porra!",
    ["Finally!"] = "Finalmente!",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...Jackie? É você mesmo?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "Sou eu, V. Faz séculos que eu tô olhando pra esse telefone me perguntando se um dia você ia ligar.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Seu filho da puta. Você tá VIVO?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Eu te enterrei. Eu guardei LUTO por você.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "É. É, tô vivo, chica. E me desculpa. Quis ligar mil vezes — o Vik não deixou. Disse que a 'Saka ia rastrear direto pra nós dois.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "É. É, tô vivo, mano. E me desculpa. Quis ligar mil vezes — o Vik não deixou. Disse que a 'Saka ia rastrear direto pra nós dois.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Semanas, Jackie. Você me deixou achando que você tinha SE IDO.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Tô com tanta raiva de você que eu não consigo—  ...  você tá bem?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Eu sei. EU SEI. Mereço cada palavra. Ândale — manda ver. Aguento melhor que uma maca no necrotério do Vik, heh.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...Você me assustou pra caramba, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "Então... fala comigo, V. Por onde a gente começa, hein?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "É. Tô aqui. Dessa vez não vou a lugar nenhum. O que mais tá passando pela sua cabeça?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(baixinho) Mais alguma coisa, chica?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(baixinho) Mais alguma coisa, mano?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Chega de conversa. Vem pra cá — preciso te ver com os meus próprios olhos.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "Sua moto. Ela ainda tá na minha garagem, sabe.",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "Tem sido difícil desde que você foi embora, cara...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "E como você tem aguentado lá no deserto?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...Minha nave. Dios mío, eu não queria perguntar. Ândale, não me tortura, V — essa moto é a única coisa que me sobrou do Jackie de antes. Me diz logo a verdade. Ela tá bem?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Relaxa, hermano. Ela tá sã e salva. Vem buscar ela.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "Sobre isso... me acostumei com ela, Jackie. Vou ficar com ela.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Ufa... Gracias, V. Você não tem ideia do que isso significa pra mim. Manteve ela viva por mim esse tempo todo.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "Ela é sua, Jackie. Sempre foi.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Heh. (uma longa pausa) Nah, nah — quer saber? Fica com ela. Do jeito que eu vejo, ela manteve VOCÊ viva enquanto eu não pude. Ela te conquistou, e você a conquistou. Só não deixa ela parada, V. Ela odeia isso.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Heh. (uma longa pausa) Nah — quer saber? Fica com ela, hermano. Ela manteve VOCÊ vivo enquanto eu não pude. Só não deixa ela parada, V. Ela odeia isso.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...Vou cuidar dela. Prometo.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "Difícil como? Fala comigo V. O que tá rolando?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Tudo desandou depois do Konpeki. É... complicado. História longa.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "Perdi mais do que você imagina naquela noite. Quase me perdi também.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...Certo. Você sempre ficava calada com as coisas pesadas, chica. Tá bom. Não vou insistir. Por enquanto.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Hmm. ...Certo. Você sempre ficava calado com as coisas pesadas, mano. Tá bom. Não vou insistir. Por enquanto.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Vou te contar tudo. Só que... não por telefone.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(suspiro) A verdade? Ficar escondido aqui tá me acabando até não sobrar nada, V. Sinto falta da cidade. As luzes, o barulho, a comida da Mama. Quero voltar pra casa. Mas não é tão simples.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "Por que não? O que te prende aí?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Aquele chip... o que sobrou lá dentro ainda tá rodando. Um software de segurança da Arasaka - mandando minha localização feito um farol. É assim que a 'Saka ia me achar — por isso tenho que ficar fora de alcance. O Vik tentou tirar. Não conseguiu.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "Então a gente acha alguém que CONSIGA. Um netrunner, um ripper — qualquer um.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "A gente vai tirar isso de você. Não vou te perder duas vezes, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Você faria isso mesmo? ... Claro que faria. Beleza, chica. A gente acha alguém que consiga apagar essa coisa. Talvez eu recupere a minha vida.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Você faria isso mesmo? ... Claro que faria. Beleza, mano. A gente acha alguém que consiga apagar essa coisa. Talvez eu recupere a minha vida.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "A gente vai conseguir. Mas isso é pra amanhã — vem pra cá. Agora.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "A gente vai conseguir. Não se preocupa. Te cubro até lá.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Preciso ser sincero com você, choom. Depois do que aconteceu... não posso mais fazer trampos pesados. O corpo não aguenta. E a Mama? (risinho) Ela terminaria o que a 'Saka começou se eu ao menos tentasse.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Ninguém tá te pedindo isso. Agora para de enrolar e vem pra cá, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Bom. Você já sangrou o suficiente por essa cidade.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...É. É, tá bom. Chega de conversa. Onde você tá? Nah — não se move, já tô indo pra aí. Aguenta firme, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...É. É, tá bom. Chega de conversa. Onde você tá? Nah — não se move, já tô indo pra aí. Aguenta firme, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "Tá bom. Vou tar bem aqui. Se apressa.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Já tô a caminho, V. Não vai a lugar nenhum. ...Te vejo perto do posto de gasolina.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Você também não tá lá essas coisas, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(só olha pra ele um momento) ...É você.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "É, é — o deserto não faz nenhum favor à cara de um cara. Mas você? ...Caramba. Um alívio pros olhos, V. Senti falta dessa cara mais do que consigo dizer.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "É, é — o deserto não faz nenhum favor à cara de um cara. Mas você, hermano? Caramba, que gosto de te ver. Senti falta dessa sua cara feia.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "A gente dois ainda tá de pé. É isso que conta.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Espera aí. Minha moto. Você ainda tá com ela? Esse tempo todo, você guardou ela?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "Ela tá na minha garagem, Jackie. Esperando por você. Toma — suas chaves.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Então você vai ficar com ela mesmo, hein. (ri) Beleza, beleza — então VOCÊ dirige, chica. Ândale. Me mostra que ela tava em boas mãos.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Então você vai ficar com ela mesmo, hein. (ri) Beleza — então VOCÊ dirige, hermano. Ândale. Me mostra que ela tava em boas mãos.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Sobe, Jackie. Vamos pra casa.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "Você manteve ela rodando por mim. Esse tempo todo... Caramba, V. Esse é o último pedaço do Jackie de antes, bem aí.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "Vamos, hermano, e você pode dar uma volta com ela.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Ândale, V. Vamos pra casa. ...E ei — chega de funeral. Por um bom tempo, tá?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Ândale, hermano. Vamos pra casa. ...E ei — chega de funeral. Por um bom tempo, tá?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... a gente conseguiu. A gente conseguiu mesmo. Não acredito, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(recupera o fôlego) ...É. A gente conseguiu.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "A gente tá vivo, chica. Nós dois.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "Mal parei pra respirar desde o Konpeki. ...Sabe bem só parar um segundo.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Heh... é. Sabe mesmo. ...Pena que ninguém nunca vai saber que fomos a gente lá em cima.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "A propósito -- onde você guardou a maleta?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...Jackie?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Eu tava com ela. Bem nas minhas mãos, V, juro que tava...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie! O biochip -- a porra da maleta com o biochip, cadê?!",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "Tentei segurar ela, juro. O Smasher -- aquele hijo de puta... A maleta levou um tiro, abriu de vez. O chip virou sucata. Aí eu larguei. ...Me desculpa, V. De verdade.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "Porra! Aquilo era a nossa passagem, Jackie! Tudo pelo que a gente trabalhou!",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "Sinceramente? Aquilo provavelmente ia dar mais dor de cabeça do que valia.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "A gente dois tá respirando, cabrón. Esse é o único butim que importa.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "É... eu sei. Chinga'o. Mas ei -- você ainda tá aqui pra ficar puta com isso, né?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Você e eu. Derrubamos o Smasher e saímos andando do Konpeki Plaza. Ninguém nunca vai acreditar nisso.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...É. Talvez você tenha razão. Tecnologia corpo desse tipo só te compra uma vida mais curta.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Hehe é. Uma história pra posteridade, V!  \\n(Uma pausa) Então... E agora?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "O que a gente quiser, hermano. Pela primeira vez, ninguém escreve a nossa história além de nós.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Heh. Gostei de como isso soa. Ândale, então. Night City não vai se conquistar sozinha!",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Bar de lámen.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(cantinho secreto pra soneca).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V: Não vou arrastar o Jackie pra essa confusão. Não depois de tudo que ele passou.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "Não dá pra ligar pro Jackie durante uma missão principal — não vou arrastar ele pra isso.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "Ah, merda...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "Por sorte tá tudo limpo por enquanto. Mas não é bom ficar por aqui.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "É a— é aquele o Adam Smasher?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "Ah, MERDA!",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "A gente não vai morrer — hoje não!",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. O AV do velho Arasaka ainda deve tar estacionado no telhado.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Ândale, V — vamos dar o fora daqui.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — instalado",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "O Vik ligou. Deixou uma mensagem. Diz que tem uma coisa pra te contar sobre o Jackie — uma coisa que ele não quis dizer por telefone.\\n\\nVai ver ele na clínica.\\n\\n(Pra configurações do mod vá em Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik:",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Eu devia ter te contado há muito tempo, e sinto muito por não ter contado. O Jackie não morreu na minha mesa naquela noite. Recuperei o pulso dele, pedi um favor, tirei ele de lá antes da Arasaka vir procurar o corpo. Ele tá vivo, V — escondido lá nos Badlands, e tem que continuar assim. O garoto não tinha como sobreviver ao que sobreviveu. E quando ele conseguiu falar de novo, a primeira coisa que perguntou foi se você tinha escapado. Só não era seguro te contar antes, V. Sinto muito. Tô marcando o lugar no seu mapa. Vai trazer ele de volta.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Eu devia ter te contado há muito tempo, e sinto muito por não ter contado. O Jackie não morreu na minha mesa naquela noite. Recuperei o pulso dele, pedi um favor, tirei ele de lá antes da Arasaka vir procurar o corpo. Só não era seguro te contar antes, V. Ele tá vivo. Escondido lá nos Badlands — e tem que continuar assim. Ele tá esperando por você. Tô marcando o lugar no seu mapa. Vai trazer ele de volta.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Chip — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Se você tá lendo isso, V, então o doc cumpriu a palavra e te mandou pra cá. Sou eu. Tô vivo.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "O Vik me remendou e me tirou escondido antes que a 'Saka pudesse gravar meu nome numa lápide. Ando escondido desde então.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "A Mama Welles ficou tão brava quando soube. Acho que ela me mataria se eu voltasse a fazer trampos — talvez ela tenha razão. Acabou a vida de mercenário pra mim, V. É sério. Mas eu não podia deixar você continuar achando que tinha me enterrado.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Me liga quando ler isso. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Encontrar o Jackie — Rocky Ridge, os Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Ligar pro Jackie",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Esperar o Jackie",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "O Jackie voltou.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Chip — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Agora eu mantenho a carta da Morte virada pra baixo. Não conseguia olhar pra ela — por meses foi tudo o que eu via quando fechava os olhos.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Quando o Vik me disse que ele tinha conseguido, que estava lá fora respirando nos Badlands, eu sentei no chão da loja e chorei até o incenso apagar.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "Não vou fingir que só estou feliz, V. Algumas noites estou com tanta raiva que podia gritar. Ele entrou naquele assalto sabendo do risco. Quase nos deixou. Quase me deixou.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Mas as cartas não estavam erradas. O fio dele não se cortou. Só se desfiou... e aguentou.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Pega leve com ele. E obrigada — por ir trazer ele pra casa. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Chip — Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "Então. Meu Jackie está vivo, e eu sou a última a saber. Espere até ser mãe, V, e alguém esconder uma coisa dessas de você — aí a gente conversa sobre perdão.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "Acendi uma vela pra aquele menino todo santo dia. Cozinhei pra um fantasma. E esse tempo todo ele lá na poeira, respirando, me deixando chorar a morte dele. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "E mesmo assim — ele está VIVO. Meu menino está vivo. Não parei de agradecer à Virgem desde que soube. Até meus joelhos doem de tanto rezar.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Mas me escute uma vez, V: se ele aceitar de novo um trampo como aquele assalto — arriscar a vida por eddies e glória mais uma vez — não vou esperar essa cidade levar ele. Eu mesma o mato.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Traz ele pra minha mesa. Tem um prato esperando. Sempre teve um prato esperando. — Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Falar",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Falar com o Jackie   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Ligando pro Jackie...",
    ["No answer."] = "Não atende.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Lá está ela. Senta, respira um pouco — você tá sempre em movimento.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "Lá está ele. Senta, respira um pouco — você tá sempre em movimento.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "Tava torcendo pra você aparecer. Não conta pra ninguém que eu disse isso.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Ei. ...Nah, nada. Só é bom te ver aí de pé, é só isso.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Vem cá.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "E a vida tranquila, tá te tratando bem mesmo?",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "Você curte trabalhar no bar?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "Heywood ainda parece casa?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "Você não sente falta? Da vida.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "E o corpo, aguenta? Sinceramente.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "Do que você lembra daquela noite?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "Você ainda vai ver o Vik?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "Você teve medo?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "Você me culpa?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "O que você quer agora, Jackie?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Fala. Seja lá o que for que você vive não falando.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Boa. Devagar. O devagar é um ajuste, mas é bom.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Uns dias bons. Em outros eu sento no meio da tarde porque meu corpo manda, e eu não discuto mais com ele.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "Sincero? Não durmo direito. Lá pelas quatro eu tô acordado, deitado escutando o prédio. ...Mas eu tô aqui pra não dormir. É o acordo, e eu faria de novo.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "O bar, principalmente. E as pessoas me acham com os problemas delas. Pequenos. Eu gosto dos pequenos.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Um moleque da rua precisava achar o irmão. Levei dois dias e muita conversa, e ninguém levou tiro. O melhor trabalho que eu já fiz, e não paga nada.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "Ah, é... quieta. Heh. É essa a piada, né? Acontece que o silêncio é uma habilidade. No começo eu era péssimo nisso.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "Ainda me pego escutando pra ver se alguma coisa vai dar errado. De pé no bar às duas da tarde com um pano na mão, esperando um tiroteio que não vem. Tá melhorando.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Você vai pegar o jeito.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Melhor que a alternativa.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Você sempre pode voltar pra vida.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...Não. Não, V. Me carregaram pra fora daquele lugar. A Mama recebeu uma ligação de madrugada. Não faço isso com ela duas vezes, e nem com você. Nunca mais me pergunta isso.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Desculpa. Você tem razão.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Eu entendo.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "No meu pé. Me enchendo de comida. Fingindo que não tá com medo, que é justamente como eu sei que tá.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Ela acende uma vela pra mim. Pra MIM. Eu tô sentado ali na mesa dela e ela acende do mesmo jeito. Diz que é pra versão de mim que não saiu de lá.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "Ela não sabe nem metade do que aconteceu naquela noite e nunca vai saber. É uma coisa que eu carrego pra ela não ter que carregar. Você entende isso, né?",
    ["I understand."] = "Ela carregaria junto com você, se você deixasse.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "É honesto. Ninguém nunca apontou uma arma pra mim por causa de um chope mal tirado.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "Sei a bebida de cada um e metade dos problemas deles. Acontece que isso também é um tipo de poder. Só que o lento.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Sempre pareceu. As mesmas esquinas, as mesmas abuelas gritando das mesmas janelas.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Mas eu ando por ela diferente agora. Antes eu andava como se um dia fosse ser minha. Agora eu só... ando.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...É. É, sinto falta. Não do tiroteio. Do *nós*. Ter uma ideia idiota às duas da manhã e fazer às quatro.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Sinto falta de ser o cara que resolvia só de entrar pela porta. É essa parte que não sara, chica — não as costelas. As costelas sararam.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Sinto falta de ser o cara que resolvia só de entrar pela porta. É essa parte que não sara, hermano — não as costelas. As costelas sararam.",
    ["We're still us."] = "A gente ainda é a gente.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "Você nunca foi só isso.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "Sinceramente? Duro. As manhãs frias são o pior. O Vik diz que isso é permanente e que eu devia fazer amizade com isso.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "Tem uma placa dentro de mim, V. Eu sinto onde ela termina. Em certas noites eu fico deitado com a mão em cima, só conferindo se ela ainda tá fazendo o trabalho dela. É isso que eu tenho no lugar de uma cicatriz de se gabar.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "Você não precisa fazer piada disso.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "Você ainda tá de pé.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Pedaços. O carro. Você gritando alguma coisa que eu não conseguia ouvir. A voz do Dex na linha e tudo já indo pro buraco.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Lembro de sentir frio e achar estranho, porque era uma noite quente. E lembro de decidir que não ia falar nada, porque você já tinha o bastante nas costas. ...Foi burrice. Eu devia ter falado alguma coisa.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "Você devia ter falado alguma coisa.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Você tava tentando me proteger.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "Vamos deixar isso pra lá.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Uma vez por mês. Ele não me cobra, o que me deixa louco, então eu levo alguma coisa da cozinha da Mama e a gente diz que tá quite.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Aquele homem ficou de boca fechada um tempão pra eu poder continuar morto. Sabe o que isso custa pra um cara como o Vik? Ele carregou sozinho. Devo mais a ele do que as costelas.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...É. Na hora não — na hora é só barulho e depois silêncio. Depois. Acordar num quarto que eu não conhecia, sem conseguir me mexer, sem saber se você tinha saído. É esse o medo que ficou. Demorei muito pra dizer isso em voz alta.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Fico feliz que você tenha dito.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "Eu também tive medo.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "Por quê? Pelo trabalho? V, eu *queria* aquele trabalho. Metade dele fui EU que te convenci. Você carregou isso esse tempo todo achando que eu ia te culpar? ...Nah. Não. Nenhuma vez. Nem por um segundo.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "Eu precisava ouvir isso.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Eu ainda carrego isso.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "Então larga. Aqui, agora — você não precisa mais arrastar isso. Eu tô de pé na sua frente. Olha pra mim. Eu tô de pé bem aqui.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...Tá bom.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Alguma coisa pequena, eu acho. O bar. Domingo na casa da Mama. Talvez um lugar com uma janela sem grade. Antes eu queria meu nome em alguma coisa. Agora eu quero durar o suficiente pra ficar entediado. Isso soa patético?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Isso soa como uma vida.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "Não tem nada de patético nisso.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...Foi a primeira coisa que perguntei pro Vik. Antes do meu próprio nome, antes do que tinha acontecido comigo. Perguntei se você tinha saído. Ele disse que sim, e eu apaguei de novo por dois dias. Seja lá o que mais aquela noite levou, isso ela não levou. É essa a coisa que eu vivo não falando.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "Eu também perguntei de você, todo dia.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Vai lá. Eu não vou a lugar nenhum — é esse o sentido de mim agora.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Ei. Volta, tá? Não deixa passar um mês.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Um Tequila Old Fashioned com um respingo de cerveza e uma pimenta pra enfeitar.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Uma dose de vodca com gelo, suco de limão, cerveja de gengibre e, o mais importante... um respingo de amor.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Tequila dupla com granadina e limão. Nada melhor pra afogar os nervos.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "Ah, e a propósito, meu nome é Jackie Welles. Quer anotar minha receita?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "Você tem todo um número pronto.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "Como Night City tá te tratando?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "Ahhhh, eu amo essa cidade. A cidade das oportunidades infinitas. E do ódio fraternal.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "É importante ter gente pra quem recorrer. Sabe, tipo, ãh, família. Talvez você ache a sua aqui em Night City.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Dá pra tirar o rato da corporação, mas nunca a corporação do rato.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "Sabe como é... efeito borboleta ou sei lá.",
    ["I found mine."] = "Eu já achei a minha.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Eu sou leal, firme nos meus afetos…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Ela esperou, sabia?",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "O que você tem assistido?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames! Uma iguana de verdade! Uma, ãh, das Pequenas Antilhas, eu acho.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "Isso! Vi um programa sobre elas na TV. Foram extintas há uns trinta anos. São das Pequenas Antilhas.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "Você veio de longe, meu amigo escamoso.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "Topa um tiro ao alvo em RV?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "Agora você virou cara de documentário de natureza.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Uma iguana.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "Alguém veio te procurar com algum problema ultimamente?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón precisa aprender... que com o povo de Heywood não se faz sacanagem.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "Isso ainda é trabalho de fixer, Jackie.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Heywood tem sorte de ter você.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "O moleque duas portas abaixo devia pro cara errado. Não precisou de arma — precisou de alguém que sentasse numa sala e fosse a maior coisa lá dentro. Acontece que esse ainda sou eu.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Ninguém anota isso. Sem fixer, sem comissão, sem nome em quadro nenhum. Só uma senhora batendo na porta do bar às onze da noite porque não tem pra onde ir. ...O melhor trabalho que já fiz, e eu teria vergonha de chamar de trabalho.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Me fala do seu velho.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "Com certeza melhor do que ser filho do Raúl Welles.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Ele foi embora. Essa é a história inteira, e levei trinta anos pra resumir assim. A mamãe nunca falou mal dele, nem uma vez — ela só, quietinha, virou os dois.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "Você não é nada parecido com ele.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Ela fez um trabalho e tanto.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "De onde veio o seu código, Jackie?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Olha os Valentinos. Eles seguem Deus e a Santa Madre. Honra significa algo pra eles.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "O mundo das gangues não é tão complicado. A força manda, o forte sobrevive.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Hoje eles te mandam zerar alguém. Amanhã mandam outro zerar você.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "Você ainda vive por isso?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "Foi por isso que você saiu, né?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "Você ainda acredita nisso tudo? Deus, os santos?",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre sempre dizia que a paciência compensa, então…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Eu morri, V. Do jeito que você quiser dizer — meu coração parou e as mãos de alguém fizeram ele voltar. Então, se eu acredito? Eu acredito que ALGUMA COISA segurou a porta por um segundo. Não preciso saber de quem era a mão.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "A Mama ficaria feliz de ouvir isso.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "Você pensa em morrer?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "A morte... não passa do floreio final.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Eu costumava dizer isso como se fosse esperto. Falei uma vez num bar com um copo na mão — todo mundo tem que ir uma hora, por que não com estilo. Aí eu fui, V. Acontece que não tem estilo nenhum nisso. Tem só um quarto e outra pessoa fazendo o trabalho de te manter.",
    ["You're here now."] = "Você tá aqui agora.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "Não vá de novo, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "Tá na hora da gente ir, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "Bora se mexer, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "Tá comigo, chica?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "Tá comigo, mano?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "Hermano! Finalmente!",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "Não se preocupa comigo. Eu me viro.",
    ["You order."] = "Pede você.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Talvez depois.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "Faz um tempo que você tá com a Misty, né?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "Beleza, tudo pronto. Bora.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "Também é bom te ver, Jack. Como você tá?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "Preciso da sua ajuda, Jack. Tem um trampo.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "Antes eu tenho que resolver uma parada.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "Bora. Não adianta esperar.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Se cuida, amigo.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "O que é bom pra comer?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "Como você tá? Fora o trampo, digo.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "Na verdade, tenho que ir.",
    ["See you around."] = "A gente se vê.",
    ["Need your help."] = "Preciso da sua ajuda.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "E a Señora Welles, como tá?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "Um drink cairia bem.",
    ["Take care."] = "Se cuida.",
    ["To this."] = "A isso.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "Não vou recusar uma bebida de graça.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "A entrar pra elite!",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "O que você tá aprontando?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Manda um oi pra Misty.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Siiim, claro…",
    ["How's things?"] = "Como vão as coisas?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "O que você tem pra beber?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "Como tá sua mãe?",
    ["Talk later."] = "A gente fala depois.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Nada que valha a pena anotar. E é esse o ponto, chica.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Nada que valha a pena anotar. E é esse o ponto, hermano.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Aceito uma bebida.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "Pequenas Antil-quê?",
    ["Later."] = "Falou.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Se cuida, cara.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Te ligo depois.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "A gente conversa depois.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "É, falou.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Tenho que correr.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "A gente se vê na elite, Jack.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Adeus, velho amigo.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Só queria saber como você tá aguentando.",
    ["Come on."] = "Vamos.",
    ["You got me too."] = "E eu tenho você.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Aceito essa vitória.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Combina com você, Jackie.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "As pequenas também contam.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "Ainda é o seu território.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Que bom que você está aqui pra dizer isso.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "O Vik é gente boa.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "É um jeito de dizer.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Amém a isso.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "Sentar ainda está em desenvolvimento",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "Eles vão ficar de pé à mesa em vez de sentar.\n\nA animação de sentar ainda não está ligada aos móveis de verdade — ela toca onde o personagem estiver, então sentar automaticamente costuma deixá-lo flutuando acima da cadeira. De pé ficava melhor do que flutuando, então de pé é o padrão.\n\nVocê mesmo pode sentá-los, e fica exatamente onde você colocar: abra a sobreposição do CET, procure «NCLives - Companions» -> «Sitting - seat them by hand». Fique em cima da cadeira, virado para onde eles devem olhar, aperte «Seat them here», afaste-se e ajuste os controles de altura e ângulo.\n\nLevante-os pelo mesmo painel antes de mandá-los para casa.",
  },
  ["ru"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "Пахнет крупными неприятностями, V. Подожду минуту — но бросай это, или я ухожу.",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "Время идёт, hermana. Бросай крупную рыбу, или я ухожу.",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "Вот это моя девочка. Корпоративная возня подождёт — я всё ещё с тобой.",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "Мод загружен, но не смог прочитать ваш прогресс по сюжету, поэтому не запустит сюжетную линию Джеки сам.\n\nКогда ограбление останется позади, запустите её через Esc -> Настройки -> Моды -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\".",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "Говори со мной, choomba.",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "Нечасто сюда заглядываешь, а? Хе-хе. Рад тебя видеть, chica.",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "Как ты? В порядке?",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "Лучше не бывает, choom.",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "Готова двигать?",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "Так что давай займёмся нашим делом.",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "Пора нам в путь, mamita.",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego, V.",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "Погнали, mano.",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "Здесь кое-что для тебя оставили...",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives — спасибо, Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "Ты заплатил 3,847 эдди из собственного кармана, чтобы проехать весь путь до Rocky Ridge — только чтобы узнать, правда ли Jackie всё ещё дышит здесь. А потом взял и рассказал об этом всему миру.\\n\\nТак что вот твои 3,847 эдди обратно, возвращённые ДЕСЯТИКРАТНО: 38,470. И Arch Jackie в придачу.\\n\\nНикто не наматывает столько километров ради мода, который не любит. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie и команда Jackie Lives",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "Хочешь перекусить?",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "Перекусить с Jackie: Иди к %s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "...а потом, говорю, рванём в Afterlife, ха-ха-ха... Ну знаешь, дёрнем по стопке.",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Встретимся у Lizzie's.",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "Годится, chica.",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "В общем, что происходит?",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "А что, куда спешить?",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "Давай, пойдём перекусим.",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "Да, хватило на сегодня, уж поверь.",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "(Может, в следующий раз.)",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "Слушай, вот это самое то. Ни заказов, ни стрельбы — только ты да я.",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "Могу привыкнуть к этой тихой жизни, знаешь?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "Хорошо вот так посидеть минутку, да, chica?",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "Хорошо вот так посидеть минутку, да, hermano?",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "В общем... что у тебя на уме, V?",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "Ты когда-нибудь скучаешь по жизни наёмника, Jackie?",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "Этот город меня в последнее время просто изматывает.",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "Думаешь, Arasaka когда-нибудь заплатит за то, что сделала?",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "Скучаю ли? Иногда. По драйву, по команде... но она забрала больше, чем дала, V. Ты это знаешь лучше всех.",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "По жизни этой? Не-а. По удачным делам, может. Но не по финалам — мы оба видели, чем они кончаются.",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "Да. Но мы выбрались всё-таки.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City плевать, жив ты или мёртв, chica. Всё, что можешь — найти своих людей и держаться за них крепко.",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City плевать, жив ты или мёртв, mano. Всё, что можешь — найти своих людей и держаться за них крепко.",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "Этот город всех перемалывает. Фокус в том, чтобы не дать ему проглотить тебя целиком. У тебя есть я, у меня есть ты — вот и весь фокус.",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka? Хех. Такие крупные шишки никогда не платят, V. Но мы всё ещё дышим, а они не знают наших имён. Это победа.",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "Корпо-крысы всегда выходят сухими из воды. Лучшая месть — жить хорошо, вот как сейчас, с полной тарелкой перед нами.",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty — мой якорь, V. Заставляет меня смотреть вверх, когда хочется вниз. Не знаю, что бы со мной было без неё.",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "Мы с Misty? Крепко. Она читает свои карты, говорит, у звёзд есть план. А я ей просто говорю, что она и есть мой план.",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "Она сидела с Mama каждую неделю, что меня не было, знаешь. Каждую неделю. Никогда не смогу ей это отплатить.",
    ["She's good for you."] = "Она тебе на пользу.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "Хех, ладно. Погнали, chica.",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "Хех, ладно. Погнали, hermano.",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "Да, у нас есть город, за которым надо приглядеть. Vamonos.",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "Прямо за тобой, hermano. Двигаем.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "Сразу к делу, а, mano?",
    ["Let's go."] = "Пошли.",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V, как ты? В порядке?",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "Э, ну ты знаешь, как оно, не жалуюсь. Но мы тут не за тем, чтобы про меня трепаться.",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mama мне говорила, что всё приходит к тем, кто умеет ждать, и кое-что даже хорошее!",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "Она моя родная кровь, да. Coyote — её забегаловка.",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale, давай выпьем.",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Эй, V, ты жива? Как дела в змеином гнезде?",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "Здесь рождаются легенды.",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "Сразу к делу, а, chica?",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "Скучаешь по ней? По жизни наёмника?",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "Это ремесло, V. У всех руки в крови. Смиряешься и идёшь дальше.",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "Тогда сделай последнюю лёгкую, халтурку, со мной.",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "Хе-хе, за это выпью!",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "А, спасибо, Misty. Ты лучшая.",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "Misty это предвидела? Что ты выберешься?",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "Теперь я возвращаюсь, нахожу Misty, и мы делаем что-нибудь, чтобы я снова почувствовал себя живым.",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "Прежде чем ты уйдёшь — есть халтурка, если ты в деле.",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty знала... Misty всегда знает...",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "Карты говорят, что ты поможешь мне с работой?",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "Я прямо за тобой.",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "Ну что? Готова?",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V, эй! ¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "Нечасто сюда заглядываешь, а? Хе-хе. Рад тебя видеть, chica.",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Эй, V – ты жива? Как дела в змеином гнезде?",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica! Наконец-то!",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "Нечасто сюда заглядываешь, а? Хе-хе. Рад тебя видеть, cabrón.",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "Эй V - ты жива? Как дела в змеином гнезде?",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V, эй! Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "Давно пора.",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "Пришла проверить, не гнию ли я в каком-нибудь мусорном баке, как почти все парни из семьи Welles?",
    ["Never mind."] = "Забудь.",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "Держись, V, я иду.",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "Да, ладно.",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "Ладно, ладно, ладно.",
    ["You're all right."] = "Ты нормальная.",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "Наконец-то что-то происходит...",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "Уже поздно идти на попятную. Давай, V.",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "И лучше нам поторопиться.",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "Идёшь? Время дорого.",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "Свернём им шеи, прежде чем они поймут.",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "Хех, мэрия должна нам, чёрт возьми, спасибо сказать!",
    ["Finally!"] = "Наконец-то!",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "...Jackie? Это правда ты?",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "Это я, V. Целую вечность пялился на этот телефон, гадая, позвонишь ли ты когда-нибудь.",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "Ах ты сукин сын. Ты ЖИВ?",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie. Я тебя похоронила. Я по тебе ГОРЕВАЛА.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Да. Да, я жив, chica. И прости меня. Хотел позвонить тысячу раз — Vik не давал. Говорил, 'Saka тут же вычислит нас обоих.",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "Да. Да, я жив, mano. И прости меня. Хотел позвонить тысячу раз — Vik не давал. Говорил, 'Saka тут же вычислит нас обоих.",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "Недели, Jackie. Ты позволил мне думать, что тебя БОЛЬШЕ НЕТ.",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "Я так на тебя злюсь, что не могу—  ...  ты в порядке?",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "Знаю. ЗНАЮ. Я заслужил каждое слово. Давай — вываливай. Я это вынесу лучше, чем плиту в морге у Vik, хех.",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "...Ты меня правда напугал, choom.",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "Так что... говори со мной, V. С чего нам вообще начать, а?",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "Да. Я здесь. В этот раз никуда не денусь. Что ещё у тебя на уме?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "(тихо) Что-то ещё, chica?",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "(тихо) Что-то ещё, mano?",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "Хватит болтать. Приезжай сюда — мне надо увидеть тебя своими глазами.",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "Твой байк. Он всё ещё стоит у меня в гараже, знаешь.",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "Тяжело было с тех пор, как тебя не стало, дружище...",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "Так как ты там держишься, в пустыне?",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "...Моя лошадка. Dios mío, я не хотел спрашивать. Давай, не мучай меня, V — этот байк единственное, что осталось от прежнего меня. Скажи прямо. Она в порядке?",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "Расслабься, hermano. Она цела и невредима. Приезжай, забери её.",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "Насчёт этого... я к ней привыкла, Jackie. Я её оставляю себе.",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "Фух... Gracias, V. Ты не представляешь, что это для меня значит. Сохранила её живой для меня всё это время.",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "Она твоя, Jackie. Всегда была.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Хех. (долгая пауза) Не-а, не-а — знаешь что? Оставь её себе. Как по мне, это она сохранила ТЕБЯ живой, пока я не мог. Она тебя заслужила, а ты заслужила её. Только не давай ей простаивать, V. Она этого терпеть не может.",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "...Хех. (долгая пауза) Не-а — знаешь что? Оставь её себе, hermano. Она сохранила ТЕБЯ живым, пока я не мог. Только не давай ей простаивать, V. Она этого терпеть не может.",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "...Я о ней позабочусь. Обещаю.",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "Тяжело как? Говори со мной, V. Что происходит?",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Всё пошло наперекосяк после Konpeki. Это... сложно. Долгая история.",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "Я потеряла больше, чем ты думаешь, той ночью. Чуть саму себя не потеряла.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Хм. ...Ясно. Ты всегда замолкала, когда дело касалось тяжёлого, chica. Ладно. Не буду давить. Пока что.",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "Хм. ...Ясно. Ты всегда замолкал, когда дело касалось тяжёлого, mano. Ладно. Не буду давить. Пока что.",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "Я расскажу тебе всё. Только... не по телефону.",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "(вздох) Честно? Прятаться тут — меня это выматывает до нуля, V. Скучаю по городу. Огни, шум, стряпня Mama. Хочу домой. Но всё не так просто.",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "Почему нет? Что держит тебя там?",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "Этот чип... то, что осталось внутри, всё ещё работает. Какой-то охранный софт Arasaka — пингует, где я, как маяк. Вот так 'Saka меня и найдёт — потому мне и надо быть вне зоны. Vik пытался его вырезать. Не смог.",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "Тогда найдём того, кто СМОЖЕТ. Нетраннера, риппера — кого угодно.",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "Мы его из тебя вытащим. Я не потеряю тебя во второй раз, Jackie.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Ты правда сделаешь это? ... Конечно сделаешь. Ладно, chica. Найдём того, кто сотрёт эту штуку. Может, я верну себе жизнь.",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "Ты правда сделаешь это? ... Конечно сделаешь. Ладно, mano. Найдём того, кто сотрёт эту штуку. Может, я верну себе жизнь.",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "Мы с этим справимся. Но это на завтра — приезжай сюда. Сейчас.",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "Мы с этим справимся. Не переживай. До тех пор я прикрою тебе спину.",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "Должен быть с тобой честен, choom. После того, что случилось... я больше не могу браться за серьёзные заказы. Тело не выдержит. А Mama? (смешок) Она бы закончила то, что начала 'Saka, если бы я хоть попробовал.",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "Никто тебя и не просит. А теперь кончай тянуть и приезжай сюда, Jackie.",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "Хорошо. Ты достаточно пролил крови за этот город.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "...Да. Да, ладно. Хватит болтать. Ты где? Не-а — не двигайся, я уже еду к тебе. Держись, chica.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "...Да. Да, ладно. Хватит болтать. Ты где? Не-а — не двигайся, я уже еду к тебе. Держись, mano.",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "Ладно. Я буду здесь. Поторопись.",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "Я уже в пути, V. Никуда не уходи. ...Увидимся у заправки.",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "Ты и сам выглядел получше, choom.",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "(просто смотришь на него мгновение) ...Это ты.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "Да, да — пустыня мужику красоты не прибавляет. Но ты? ...Чёрт. Глаз радуется, V. Скучал по этому лицу больше, чем словами скажешь.",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "Да, да — пустыня мужику красоты не прибавляет. Но ты, hermano? Чёрт, ну и вид. Скучал по твоей уродливой роже.",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "Мы оба ещё на ногах. Вот что важно.",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "...Погоди. Мой байк. Он всё ещё у тебя? Всё это время ты его хранила?",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "Он у меня в гараже, Jackie. Ждёт тебя. Держи — твои ключи.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Так ты правда оставляешь её себе, а. (смеётся) Ладно, ладно — тогда ТЫ за рулём, chica. Давай. Покажи мне, что она была в хороших руках.",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "Так ты правда оставляешь её себе, а. (смеётся) Ладно — тогда ТЫ за рулём, hermano. Давай. Покажи мне, что она была в хороших руках.",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "Садись, Jackie. Поехали домой.",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "Ты держала её на ходу ради меня. Всё это время... Чёрт, V. Вот он, последний кусочек прежнего меня, прямо тут.",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "Поехали, hermano, и можешь прокатиться на ней.",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Давай, V. Поехали домой. ...И слушай — больше никаких похорон. Ещё очень долго, лады?",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "Давай, hermano. Поехали домой. ...И слушай — больше никаких похорон. Ещё очень долго, лады?",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole... мы сделали это. Мы правда сделали это. Не могу поверить, V.",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "(переводишь дух) ...Да. Сделали.",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "Мы живы, chica. Оба.",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "Едва вздохнуть успела с самого Konpeki. ...Хорошо вот так остановиться на секунду.",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "Хех... да. И правда хорошо. ...Жаль, что никто никогда не узнает, что это были мы там наверху.",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "Кстати -- куда ты дел кейс?",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "...Jackie?",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "Он был у меня. Прямо в руках, V, клянусь, был...",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie! Биочип -- чёртов кейс с биочипом, где он?!",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "Я пытался его удержать, клянусь. Smasher -- этот hijo de puta... В кейс попала пуля, раскололся напополам. Чип — металлолом. Так что я его бросил. ...Прости, V. Правда прости.",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "Чёрт! Это был наш билет, Jackie! Всё, ради чего мы работали!",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "Честно? Эта штука наверняка принесла бы больше проблем, чем того стоила.",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "Мы оба дышим, cabrón. Это единственный куш, который важен.",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "Да... знаю. Chinga'o. Но эй -- ты всё ещё здесь, чтобы злиться из-за этого, так?",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "Ты и я. Завалили Smasher и вышли из Konpeki Plaza. Никто никогда в это не поверит.",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "...Да. Может, ты и права. Корпо-технологии такого рода только и покупают тебе жизнь покороче.",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "Хе-хе да. История на века, V!  \\n(Пауза) Так... Что дальше?",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "Что захотим, hermano. Впервые нашу историю пишем только мы сами.",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "...Хех. Мне нравится, как это звучит. Тогда давай. Night City сам себя в одиночку не пройдёт!",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "Лапшичная.",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica.",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo.",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife.",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda.",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market.",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar.",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "(тайное местечко для дрёмы).",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V: Не втягиваю Jackie в эту заваруху. Не после всего, через что он прошёл.",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "Нельзя звонить Jackie во время основного задания — не втягиваю его в это.",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "О, чёрт...",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "К счастью, пока чисто. Но задерживаться не стоит.",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "Это то— это что, Adam Smasher?",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "О, ЧЁРТ!",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "Мы не сдохнем — не сегодня!",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado. AV старика Arasaka должен всё ещё стоять на крыше.",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "Давай, V — валим отсюда.",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives — установлено",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik звонил. Оставил сообщение. Говорит, у него есть что тебе рассказать про Jackie — что-то, чего он не хотел говорить по телефону.\\n\\nСходи к нему в клинику.\\n\\n(Настройки мода: Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik:",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Надо было сказать тебе давным-давно, и прости, что не сказал. Jackie не умер на моём столе той ночью. Я вернул ему пульс, попросил об одолжении, вывез его, прежде чем Arasaka явилась за телом. Он жив, V — залёг на дно в Badlands, и так должно и оставаться. Парню не суждено было выжить после того, что он пережил. И когда он снова смог говорить, первым делом спросил, выбралась ли ты. Просто раньше было небезопасно тебе говорить, V. Прости. Я отмечаю место на твоей карте. Иди верни его.",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "Надо было сказать тебе давным-давно, и прости, что не сказал. Jackie не умер на моём столе той ночью. Я вернул ему пульс, попросил об одолжении, вывез его, прежде чем Arasaka явилась за телом. Просто раньше было небезопасно тебе говорить, V. Он жив. Залёг на дно в Badlands — и так должно и оставаться. Он ждал тебя. Я отмечаю место на твоей карте. Иди верни его.",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "Чип — Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "Если ты читаешь это, V, значит, док сдержал слово и отправил тебя сюда. Это я. Я жив.",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik заштопал меня и тайком вывез, прежде чем 'Saka успела выбить моё имя на плите. С тех пор залёг на дно.",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mama Welles так разозлилась, когда узнала. Думаю, она бы меня убила, если бы я снова взялся за заказы — может, она и права. С жизнью наёмника для меня покончено, V. По-настоящему. Но я не мог позволить тебе и дальше думать, что ты меня похоронила.",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "Позвони мне, когда прочтёшь это. — Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "Найти Jackie — Rocky Ridge, Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "Позвонить Jackie",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "Подождать Jackie",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie вернулся.",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "Чип — Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "Теперь я держу карту Смерти рубашкой вверх. Не могла на неё смотреть — месяцами это было всё, что я видела, стоило закрыть глаза.",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Когда Vik сказал мне, что он выжил, что он там дышит, в Badlands, я села на пол в лавке и плакала, пока не догорели благовония.",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "Не буду делать вид, что я только счастлива, V. Иногда по ночам я так зла, что хочется кричать. Он пошёл на тот налёт, зная риск. Он чуть не бросил нас. Чуть не бросил меня.",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "Но карты не ошиблись. Его нить не оборвалась. Просто истрепалась... и выдержала.",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "Будь с ним помягче. И спасибо тебе — за то, что поехала вернуть его домой. — Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "Чип — Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "Так вот. Мой Jackie жив, а я узнаю об этом последней. Подожди, пока сама станешь матерью, V, и кто-нибудь скроет от тебя такое — тогда и поговорим о прощении.",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "Я каждый божий день зажигала свечу за этого мальчика. Я готовила для призрака. А всё это время он там, в пыли, дышал, позволяя мне его оплакивать. Dios mío.",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "И всё же — он ЖИВ. Мой мальчик жив. Я не перестаю благодарить Деву с тех пор, как узнала. Аж колени болят от этого.",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "Но услышь меня один раз, V: если он ещё хоть раз возьмётся за такое дело, как тот налёт — рискнёт жизнью ради эдди и славы ещё хоть раз — я не стану ждать, пока этот город его заберёт. Я убью его сама.",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "Приведи его к моему столу. Тарелка ждёт. Тарелка ждала всегда. — Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "Поговорить",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "Поговорить с Jackie   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "Звоним Jackie...",
    ["No answer."] = "Нет ответа.",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "А вот и она. Садись, отдышись — ты вечно на ходу.",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "А вот и он. Садись, отдышись — ты вечно на ходу.",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "Надеялся, что зайдёшь. Только никому не говори, что я это сказал.",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "Эй. ...Не, ничего. Просто приятно видеть, что ты стоишь здесь, вот и всё.",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana. Иди сюда.",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "Как тебе на самом деле эта тихая жизнь?",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "Тебе нравится работать за стойкой?",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "Хейвуд всё ещё как дом?",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "Скучаешь иногда? По той жизни.",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "Как тело держится? Честно.",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "Что ты помнишь о той ночи?",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "Ты ещё заходишь к Вику?",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "Тебе было страшно?",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "Ты винишь меня?",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "Чего ты хочешь теперь, Джеки?",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "...Скажи это. Что бы это ни было, о чём ты всё время молчишь.",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "Хорошо. Медленно. К медленному надо привыкнуть, но это хорошо.",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "Бывают хорошие дни. А бывает, сажусь посреди дня, потому что тело так велит, и я с ним больше не спорю.",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "Честно? Сплю плохо. Часам к четырём уже не сплю, лежу и слушаю дом. ...Но я и здесь-то ради того, чтобы не спать. Такая сделка, и я бы пошёл на неё снова.",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "В основном бар. И люди находят меня со своими проблемами. Мелкими. Мне нравятся мелкие.",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "Пацан с моей улицы искал брата. Ушло два дня и куча разговоров, и никого не подстрелили. Лучшая работа в моей жизни, и платят за неё ноль.",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "А, тут... тихо. Хех. В этом и шутка, да? Оказывается, тишина — это навык. Сначала он мне не давался.",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "До сих пор ловлю себя на том, что прислушиваюсь, не пойдёт ли что-то не так. Стою в баре в два часа дня с тряпкой в руке и жду перестрелки, которой не будет. Становится лучше.",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "Ты научишься.",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "Всяко лучше альтернативы.",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "Ты всегда можешь вернуться в ту жизнь.",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "...Нет. Нет, V. Меня оттуда вынесли на руках. Маме позвонили ночью. Я не сделаю ей этого второй раз, и тебе тоже. Больше никогда меня об этом не спрашивай.",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "Прости. Ты прав.",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "Я понимаю.",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "Хлопочет. Кормит. Делает вид, что не боится, — вот по этому я и понимаю, что боится.",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "Она ставит за меня свечку. За МЕНЯ. Я сижу прямо у неё за столом, а она всё равно ставит. Говорит, это за ту версию меня, которая оттуда не вышла.",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "Она и половины не знает о том, что случилось той ночью, и не узнает никогда. Это я несу, чтобы ей не пришлось. Ты же это понимаешь, да?",
    ["I understand."] = "Она бы понесла это вместе с тобой, если бы ты позволил.",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "Это честно. Никто ещё не наставлял на меня ствол за плохо налитое пиво.",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "Я знаю, кто что пьёт, и половину их бед. Оказывается, это тоже своего рода власть. Просто медленная.",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "Всегда был. Те же углы, те же abuelas орут из тех же окон.",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "Только хожу я по нему теперь иначе. Раньше ходил так, будто однажды он станет моим. А теперь просто... хожу.",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "...Да. Да, скучаю. Не по стрельбе. По *нам*. Придумать какую-нибудь глупость в два ночи и сделать её к четырём.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Скучаю по тому парню, который мог всё уладить, просто войдя в дверь. Вот эта часть не заживает, chica — не рёбра. Рёбра-то срослись.",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "Скучаю по тому парню, который мог всё уладить, просто войдя в дверь. Вот эта часть не заживает, hermano — не рёбра. Рёбра-то срослись.",
    ["We're still us."] = "Мы всё ещё мы.",
    ["You were never just that."] = "Ты никогда не был только этим.",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "Честно? Всё деревенеет. Хуже всего холодные утра. Вик говорит, это навсегда и что мне пора с этим подружиться.",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "Во мне пластина, V. Я чувствую, где она кончается. Иногда лежу ночью, положив на неё руку, — просто проверяю, что она ещё делает своё дело. Вот что у меня вместо шрама, которым можно хвастаться.",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "Не обязательно превращать это в шутку.",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "Ты всё ещё на ногах.",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "Кусками. Машина. Ты кричишь что-то, чего я не расслышал. Голос Декса на линии, и всё уже летит к чертям.",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "Помню, что мне было холодно и что это показалось странным, потому что ночь была тёплая. И помню, как решил ничего не говорить, потому что на тебе и так уже висело достаточно. ...Глупо было. Надо было сказать.",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "Надо было сказать.",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "Ты пытался меня защитить.",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "Давай не будем.",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "Раз в месяц. Денег с меня не берёт, чем сводит с ума, так что я приношу ему что-нибудь с кухни Мамы, и мы считаем, что квиты.",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "Этот человек долго держал рот на замке, чтобы я мог оставаться мёртвым. Знаешь, чего это стоит такому, как Вик? Он нёс это один. Я должен ему больше, чем рёбра.",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "...Да. Не в тот момент — в тот момент только громко, а потом тихо. Потом. Очнуться в комнате, которой не знаешь, не мочь пошевелиться, не знать, выбралась ли ты. Вот этот страх и остался. Мне долго было не сказать этого вслух.",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "Я рада, что ты это сказал.",
    ["I was scared too."] = "Мне тоже было страшно.",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "За что? За дело? V, я *хотел* эту работу. Половину я тебе сам и втюхал. Ты всё это время носила это в себе, думая, что я поставлю тебе это в вину? ...Не. Нет. Ни разу. Ни на секунду.",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "Мне нужно было это услышать.",
    ["I still carry it."] = "Я всё равно это ношу.",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "Тогда положи. Прямо здесь, прямо сейчас — тебе больше не нужно это таскать. Я стою перед тобой. Посмотри на меня. Я стою прямо здесь.",
    ["...Okay."] = "...Ладно.",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "Что-нибудь маленькое, наверное. Бар. Воскресенье у Мамы. Может, квартира с окном без решёток. Раньше я хотел, чтобы моё имя было на чём-нибудь. Теперь хочу продержаться достаточно долго, чтобы заскучать. Звучит жалко?",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "Звучит как жизнь.",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "Ничего жалкого в этом нет.",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "...Это первое, что я спросил у Вика. Раньше собственного имени, раньше того, что со мной случилось. Я спросил, выбралась ли ты. Он сказал — да, и я отрубился ещё на двое суток. Что бы та ночь ни забрала, этого она не забрала. Вот об этом я всё время и молчу.",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "Я тоже спрашивала о тебе, каждый день.",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "Иди. Я никуда не денусь — теперь в этом весь я.",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "Эй. Возвращайся, а? Не пропадай на месяц.",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "Текила Олд Фэшнд, плеснуть сервесы и чили для украшения.",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "Стопка водки со льдом, сок лайма, имбирное пиво и, самое главное... капелька любви.",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "Двойная текила с гренадином и лаймом. Лучшее средство, чтоб утопить нервы.",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "А, кстати, меня зовут Джеки Уэллс. Записать тебе рецепт?",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "У тебя целый номер заготовлен.",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "Как тебе Найт-Сити?",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "А-а-ах, обожаю этот город. Город бесконечных возможностей. И братской ненависти.",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "Важно, чтоб было к кому обратиться. Ну знаешь, вроде... семьи. Может, ты свою здесь, в Найт-Сити, и найдёшь.",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "Крысу из корпорации вытащить можно, а вот корпорацию из крысы — никогда.",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "Ну знаешь... эффект бабочки, или как там.",
    ["I found mine."] = "Свою я нашёл.",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "Я верный, постоянный в чувствах…",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "Она ждала, знаешь.",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "Что смотришь в последнее время?",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "¡No mames! Настоящая игуана! Такая, э-э, с Малых Антильских, кажется.",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "Ага! Видел про них передачу по телику. Вымерли лет тридцать назад. Они с Малых Антильских.",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "Далеко ты забрался, чешуйчатый друг.",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "Как насчёт пострелять по мишеням в VR?",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "Теперь ты по документалкам о природе.",
    ["...An iguana."] = "...Игуана.",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "Кто-нибудь приходил к тебе с проблемой в последнее время?",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "El cabrón должен усвоить... что с людьми из Хейвуда так не поступают.",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "Это всё ещё работа фиксера, Джеки.",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "Хейвуду повезло с тобой.",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "Пацан через две двери задолжал не тому человеку. Ствол для этого не понадобился — понадобился кто-то, кто сядет в комнате и будет там самым большим. Оказалось, это всё ещё я.",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "Никто это не записывает. Ни фиксера, ни доли, ни имени на доске. Просто женщина, которая стучит в дверь бара в одиннадцать вечера, потому что ей больше некуда. ...Лучшая работа в моей жизни, и мне было бы стыдно назвать её работой.",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "Расскажи мне о своём старике.",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "Уж точно лучше, чем быть сыном Рауля Уэллса.",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "Он ушёл. Вот и вся история, и мне понадобилось тридцать лет, чтобы уложить её в это. Мама ни разу о нём плохо не сказала, ни единого раза — просто тихо взяла и стала ими обоими.",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "Ты совсем не такой, как он.",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "Она чертовски хорошо справилась.",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "Откуда у тебя твой кодекс, Джеки?",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "Взять Валентинос. Они следуют за Богом и Санта-Мадре. Честь для них что-то значит.",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "Мир банд не такой уж сложный. Сила — это право, выживают сильные.",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "Сегодня они заставят тебя обнулить кого-то. Завтра заставят кого-то другого обнулить тебя.",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "Ты всё ещё этим живёшь?",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "Поэтому ты и завязал, да?",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "Ты всё ещё во всё это веришь? В Бога, в святых?",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "Mi madre всегда говорила, что терпение вознаграждается, так что…",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén.",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "Я умер, V. Как ни назови — сердце встало, и чьи-то руки запустили его снова. Верю ли я? Верю, что ЧТО-ТО придержало дверь на секунду. Мне не нужно знать, чья это была рука.",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "Мама была бы рада это услышать.",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "Ты думаешь о смерти?",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "Смерть... это всего лишь последний росчерк.",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "Раньше я говорил это так, будто это остроумно. Сказал как-то в баре со стаканом в руке — все когда-нибудь уходят, так почему не красиво. А потом я ушёл, V. Оказалось, никакой красоты там нет. Есть только комната и кто-то другой, кто делает работу — удерживает тебя.",
    ["You're here now."] = "Ты здесь. Сейчас.",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "Не уходи снова, hermano.",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "Hasta luego.",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "Пора нам двигать, carnal.",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "Двигаем, chica.",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "Ты со мной, chica?",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "Ты со мной, mano?",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "Hermano! Наконец-то!",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "Не переживай за меня. Я справлюсь.",
    ["You order."] = "Заказывай ты.",
    ["Maybe later."] = "Может, позже.",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "Вы с Мисти уже давно вместе, да?",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "Всё, готово. Идём.",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "И я тебя, Джек. Как ты?",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "Нужна твоя помощь, Джек. Есть дельце.",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "Сначала надо кое-что уладить.",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "Погнали. Чего ждать.",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "Бывай, амиго.",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "Что тут вкусного?",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "Как жизнь? Не считая дел.",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "Хотя нет, мне пора.",
    ["See you around."] = "Ещё увидимся.",
    ["Need your help."] = "Нужна твоя помощь.",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "Как там сеньора Уэллс?",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "Выпить бы.",
    ["Take care."] = "Береги себя.",
    ["To this."] = "За это.",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "От бесплатной выпивки не откажусь.",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "За выход в высшую лигу!",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "Чем занимаешься?",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "Передавай Мисти привет.",
    ["Riiight…"] = "Ну-ну…",
    ["How's things?"] = "Как дела?",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "Что есть выпить?",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "Как твоя мама?",
    ["Talk later."] = "Поговорим позже.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "Ничего, что стоило бы записывать. В том и смысл, чика.",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "Ничего, что стоило бы записывать. В том и смысл, эрмано.",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "Выпью, пожалуй.",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "Малые Анти... что?",
    ["Later."] = "Давай.",
    ["Take care, man."] = "Береги себя, дружище.",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "Перезвоню позже.",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "Поговорим потом.",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "Ага, бывай.",
    ["Gotta run."] = "Мне пора.",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "Увидимся в высшей лиге, Джек.",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "Прощай, старый друг.",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "Просто интересно, как ты держишься.",
    ["Come on."] = "Пойдём.",
    ["You got me too."] = "А я — тебя.",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "Приму эту победу.",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "Тебе идёт, Джеки.",
    ["Small ones count."] = "Мелкие тоже считаются.",
    ["Still your turf."] = "Всё ещё твой район.",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "Рад, что ты здесь и можешь это сказать.",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Вик — хороший человек.",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "Можно и так сказать.",
    ["Amen to that."] = "Аминь.",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "Посадка ещё в разработке",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "За столом они будут стоять, а не сидеть.\n\nАнимация сидения пока не привязана к настоящей мебели — она проигрывается там, где персонаж стоит, поэтому автоматическая посадка обычно оставляет его парящим над стулом. Стоять выглядело лучше, чем парить, поэтому по умолчанию они стоят.\n\nВы можете усадить их вручную, и они окажутся ровно там, куда вы их поставите: откройте оверлей CET, найдите «NCLives - Companions» -> «Sitting - seat them by hand». Встаньте на стул лицом в нужную сторону, нажмите «Seat them here», отойдите и подгоните ползунки высоты и угла.\n\nПоднимите их той же панелью, прежде чем отправлять домой.",
  },
  ["zhcn"] = {
    ["This smells like main-event trouble, V. I'll hang back a minute — but drop it, or I'm out."] = "这闻着就是大事的麻烦，V。我等一分钟——但你不撒手，我就走了。",
    ["Clock's runnin', hermana. Ditch the big fish or I'm gone."] = "时间不多了，hermana。放掉那条大鱼，不然我就走了。",
    ["That's my girl. Let the corpo mess wait — I'm still with you."] = "这才是我的姑娘。公司的破事先放着——我还在你身边。",
    ["The mod is loaded, but it couldn't read your story progress, so it won't start Jackie's questline on its own.\\n\\nOnce the heist is behind you, start it from Esc -> Settings -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \\\"Start the search for Jackie\\\"."] = "模组已加载，但无法读取你的剧情进度，因此不会自动开始杰基的任务线。\n\n等你完成了那场抢劫，请从 Esc -> 设置 -> Mods -> JackieLives -> \"Start the search for Jackie\" 开始。",
    ["Talk to me, choomba."] = "跟我说说话，choomba。",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. Good to see you, chica."] = "不常来这儿吧？嘿嘿。见到你真高兴，chica。",
    ["How you feel? You all right?"] = "感觉怎么样？你还好吧？",
    ["Does not get any higher, choom."] = "没有比这更爽的了，choom。",
    ["Ready to mosey?"] = "准备好出发了吗？",
    ["So let's do our thing."] = "那咱们就干咱们该干的事吧。",
    ["Time we were on our way, mamita."] = "该上路了，mamita。",
    ["Ahí luego, V."] = "Ahí luego，V。",
    ["Make moves, mano."] = "动身吧，mano。",
    ["Something's been left here for you..."] = "这儿有东西留给你……",
    ["Jackie Lives — thank you, Reverend Flash"] = "Jackie Lives——谢谢你，Reverend Flash",
    ["You paid 3,847 eddies out of your own pocket to ride all the way out to Rocky Ridge — just to find out whether Jackie was really still breathin' out here. Then you went and told the world about it.\\n\\nSo here's your 3,847 eddies back, returned TEN FOLD: 38,470. And Jackie's Arch with it.\\n\\nNobody puts in road miles like that for a mod they don't love. Gracias, Reverend. — Jackie & the Jackie Lives team"] = "你自掏腰包付了3,847欧元币，一路开到Rocky Ridge——就为了弄清楚Jackie是不是真的还在这儿喘着气。然后你还把这事告诉了全世界。\\n\\n所以这是还给你的3,847欧元币，十倍奉还：38,470。还有Jackie的Arch一并送上。\\n\\n没人会为一个自己不爱的模组跑那么多路。Gracias，Reverend。——Jackie和Jackie Lives团队",
    ["Wanna get something to eat?"] = "想去吃点东西吗？",
    ["Grab some food with Jackie: Go to %s"] = "和Jackie一起吃点东西：前往%s",
    ["...then I say we hit the Afterlife, hahaha... You know, do some shots."] = "……然后我说咱们就去Afterlife，哈哈哈……你懂的，喝几杯烈的。",
    ["Meet me at Lizzie's."] = "Lizzie's见。",
    ["Right on, chica."] = "没问题，chica。",
    ["Anyway, what's goin' on?"] = "话说回来，出什么事了？",
    ["Why, what's the rush?"] = "怎么，急什么？",
    ["C'mon, let's go have some lunch."] = "走吧，咱们去吃点午饭。",
    ["Yeah, had enough for one day, lemme tell you."] = "是啊，今天真是够了，我跟你说。",
    ["(Maybe next time.)"] = "（也许下次吧。）",
    ["Man, this hits the spot. No gigs, no gunfire — just you an' me."] = "老兄，这真是太对味儿了。没有活儿，没有枪火——就你和我。",
    ["Could get used to this quiet-life thing, y'know?"] = "我都能习惯这种平静日子了，你懂吗？",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, chica?"] = "就这么坐一会儿真好，是吧，chica？",
    ["Good to just sit a minute, huh, hermano?"] = "就这么坐一会儿真好，是吧，hermano？",
    ["Anyway... what's on your mind, V?"] = "话说回来……你在想什么，V？",
    ["You ever miss the merc life, Jackie?"] = "你有想过那种雇佣兵的日子吗，Jackie？",
    ["This city's been grindin' me down lately."] = "这座城市最近把我磨得够呛。",
    ["Think Arasaka ever pays for what they did?"] = "你觉得Arasaka有一天会为他们干的事付出代价吗？",
    ["Miss it? Some days. The rush, the crew... but it took more than it gave, V. You know that better'n anyone."] = "想念？有时候吧。那种刺激，那帮兄弟……可它拿走的比给的多，V。这一点你比谁都清楚。",
    ["The life? Nah. The good runs, maybe. Not the endings — we both seen how those go."] = "那种日子？不。好的活儿，也许吧。可不是那些结局——咱俩都见过那是什么下场。",
    ["Yeah. We made it out, though."] = "是啊。不过咱们活着出来了。",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, chica. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City才不在乎你是死是活，chica。你能做的就是找到你的人，然后紧紧抓住。",
    ["Night City don't care if you live or die, mano. All you can do is find your people and hold on tight."] = "Night City才不在乎你是死是活，mano。你能做的就是找到你的人，然后紧紧抓住。",
    ["This town chews everybody up. Trick's not lettin' it swallow ya whole. You got me, I got you — that's the trick."] = "这座城把每个人都嚼碎了。窍门就是别让它把你整个吞下去。你有我，我有你——这就是窍门。",
    ["'Saka? Heh. Big fish like that never pays, V. But we're still breathin' and they don't know our names. That's a win."] = "'Saka？嘿。那种大鱼从来不付代价的，V。可咱们还喘着气，他们也不知道咱们的名字。这就算赢了。",
    ["Corpo rats always land on their feet. Best revenge's livin' good — like right now, full plate in front of us."] = "那些企业里的耗子总能落地。最好的报复就是活得好——就像现在，面前摆着满满一盘。",
    ["Misty's my anchor, V. Keeps me lookin' up when I wanna look down. Dunno what I'd be without her."] = "Misty是我的锚，V。在我想往下看的时候让我抬起头。真不知道没有她我会是什么样。",
    ["Me an' Misty? Solid. She reads them cards, says the stars got a plan. I just tell her she's my plan."] = "我和Misty？稳得很。她读那些牌，说星星有安排。我就跟她说，她就是我的安排。",
    ["She sat with Mama every week I was gone, y'know. Every week. Ain't never gonna be able to pay that back."] = "我不在的每一周她都陪着Mama坐着，你知道吗。每一周。这份情我这辈子都还不清。",
    ["She's good for you."] = "她对你很好。",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, chica."] = "嘿，好吧。走吧，chica。",
    ["Heh, alright. Let's roll, hermano."] = "嘿，好吧。走吧，hermano。",
    ["Yeah, we got a city to look after. Vamonos."] = "是啊，咱们还有座城要照看。Vamonos。",
    ["Right behind ya, hermano. Let's move."] = "就跟在你后头，hermano。走吧。",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, mano?"] = "直接谈正事，嗯，mano？",
    ["Let's go."] = "走吧。",
    ["V, how you feel? You all right?"] = "V，你感觉怎么样？你还好吧？",
    ["Eh, you know how it is, can't complain. But we ain't here to shoot the shit about me."] = "唉，你知道是怎么回事，不能抱怨。不过咱们可不是来闲扯我的事的。",
    ["Mama told me things come to those who wait, and some're even good!"] = "Mama跟我说过，好东西留给会等的人，有些还真不赖！",
    ["She's my blood, all right. Coyote's her dive."] = "她是我的血亲，没错。Coyote是她的小破酒馆。",
    ["Andale, let's drink."] = "Andale，咱们喝一杯。",
    ["Hey, V, you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "嘿，V，你还活着吗？那毒蛇窝里怎么样了？",
    ["Legends are born here."] = "传奇就是在这儿诞生的。",
    ["Straight to biz, eh, chica?"] = "直接谈正事，嗯，chica？",
    ["You miss it? The merc life?"] = "你想念它吗？那种雇佣兵的日子？",
    ["It's the biz, V. Everyone's got blood on their hands. You deal with it, you move on."] = "这就是这行，V。每个人手上都沾着血。你接受它，然后往前走。",
    ["Then do one last easy one, side gig, with me."] = "那就再干最后一票轻松的，外快活儿，跟我一起。",
    ["Heheh, I'll drink to that!"] = "嘿嘿，我为这个干一杯！",
    ["Ah, thanks, Misty. You're the best."] = "啊，谢了，Misty。你最棒了。",
    ["Did Misty see it comin'? You makin' it out?"] = "Misty料到了吗？你能活着出来这事？",
    ["Now I go back, find Misty and we do somethin' to make me feel alive again."] = "现在我回去，找到Misty，咱们做点让我重新觉得自己还活着的事。",
    ["Before you do — got a side gig, if you're up for it."] = "在你去之前——我有个外快活儿，要是你愿意的话。",
    ["Misty knew... Misty always knows..."] = "Misty早就知道了……Misty总是知道……",
    ["Cards say you'll help me on a job?"] = "牌说你会帮我干一票？",
    ["¿Qué onda?"] = "¿Qué onda?",
    ["Got me right behind you."] = "我就跟在你后头。",
    ["So? You ready?"] = "怎么样？你准备好了吗？",
    ["V, hey! ¿Cómo te sientes?"] = "V，嘿！¿Cómo te sientes?",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, chica."] = "不常来这儿吧？嘿嘿。见到你真高兴，chica。",
    ["Hey, V – you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "嘿，V——你还活着吗？那毒蛇窝里怎么样了？",
    ["Chica! Finally!"] = "Chica！终于来了！",
    ["Don't come here often, do ya? Heheh. It's good to see you, cabrón."] = "不常来这儿吧？嘿嘿。见到你真高兴，cabrón。",
    ["Hey V - you alive? How's things in the viper pit?"] = "嘿V——你还活着吗？那毒蛇窝里怎么样了？",
    ["V, hey! Como te sientes?"] = "V，嘿！Como te sientes?",
    ["Que onda?"] = "Que onda?",
    ["About time."] = "总算来了。",
    ["Checkin' to see if I'm not rotting in some dumpster, like most o' the Welles boys?"] = "来看看我是不是烂在哪个垃圾箱里了，跟大多数Welles家的男人一样？",
    ["Never mind."] = "算了。",
    ["Hold on, V, I'm comin'."] = "撑住，V，我来了。",
    ["Yeah, OK."] = "行，好吧。",
    ["All right, all right, all right."] = "好嘞，好嘞，好嘞。",
    ["You're all right."] = "你人不错。",
    ["Shit's finally happenin'..."] = "总算他妈有事儿发生了……",
    ["Too late to back out now. Come on, V."] = "现在退缩已经太晚了。来吧，V。",
    ["And we'd best be quick."] = "而且咱们最好快点。",
    ["You comin'? Time's precious."] = "你来吗？时间很宝贵。",
    ["Si, si, me acuerdo."] = "Si, si, me acuerdo.",
    ["We'll snap their necks before they realize."] = "咱们在他们反应过来之前拧断他们的脖子。",
    ["Heh, City Hall should be fuckin' thankin' us!"] = "嘿，市政厅他妈的应该谢谢咱们才对！",
    ["Finally!"] = "终于！",
    ["...Jackie? Is that really you?"] = "……Jackie？真的是你吗？",
    ["It's me, V. Been starin' at this phone for ages wonderin' if you'd ever ring it."] = "是我，V。盯着这电话老半天了，一直在想你会不会打过来。",
    ["You son of a bitch. You're ALIVE?"] = "你这狗娘养的。你还活着？",
    ["Jackie. I buried you. I MOURNED you."] = "Jackie。我埋了你。我为你哀悼过。",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, chica. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "是啊。是啊，我还活着，chica。对不起。我想打电话打了上千次——Vik不让我打。他说'Saka会顺着电话直接追到咱们俩。",
    ["Yeah. Yeah, I'm alive, mano. And I'm sorry. Wanted to call a thousand times — Vik wouldn't let me. Said 'Saka'd trace it straight to the both of us."] = "是啊。是啊，我还活着，mano。对不起。我想打电话打了上千次——Vik不让我打。他说'Saka会顺着电话直接追到咱们俩。",
    ["Weeks, Jackie. You let me think you were GONE."] = "好几个星期，Jackie。你让我以为你已经没了。",
    ["I'm so mad at you I can't—  ...  you're okay?"] = "我气你气得不行，我没法——……你没事吧？",
    ["I know. I KNOW. I earned every word. C'mon — hit me with it. I can take it better'n a slab in Vik's morgue, heh."] = "我知道。我知道。每一句我都活该。来吧——尽管冲我来。我承受得住，比躺在Vik停尸房的板子上强多了，嘿。",
    ["...You really scared me, choom."] = "……你真把我吓坏了，choom。",
    ["So... talk to me, V. Where do we even start, huh?"] = "那么……跟我说说，V。咱们到底从哪儿说起，嗯？",
    ["Yeah. I'm here. Ain't goin' nowhere this time. What else is on your mind?"] = "是啊。我在这儿。这次哪儿也不去。你还想着什么？",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, chica?"] = "（轻声）还有别的事吗，chica？",
    ["(quiet) Somethin' else, mano?"] = "（轻声）还有别的事吗，mano？",
    ["Enough talkin'. Get over here — I gotta see you with my own eyes."] = "别说了。过来这儿——我得亲眼看看你。",
    ["Your bike. She's still sittin' in my garage, y'know."] = "你的摩托。它还停在我车库里呢，你知道吧。",
    ["It's been tough since you were gone, man..."] = "你走了以后日子一直很难熬，老兄……",
    ["So how you been holdin' up out there in the desert?"] = "那你在那片沙漠里过得怎么样？",
    ["...My wheels. Dios mío, I didn't wanna ask. C'mon, don't tease me, V — that bike's the one piece o' the old me I got left. Just tell me straight. Is she okay?"] = "……我的车。Dios mío，我都不敢问。来吧，别逗我了，V——那辆摩托是我身上剩下的唯一一块以前的我。直接告诉我。它还好吗？",
    ["Relax, hermano. She's safe and sound. Come pick her up."] = "放心，hermano。它安然无恙。来把它取走吧。",
    ["About that... I've gotten used to her, Jackie. I'm keepin' her."] = "关于这个……我都习惯它了，Jackie。我要留着它。",
    ["Phew... Gracias, V. You got no idea what that means to me. Kept her breathin' for me all this time."] = "呼……Gracias，V。你不知道这对我意味着什么。这么久了你一直替我让它活着。",
    ["She's yours, Jackie. Always was."] = "它是你的了，Jackie。一直都是。",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah, nah — you know what? Keep her. Way I see it she kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. She's earned you, an' you earned her. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "……嘿。（长长一顿）不，不——你知道吗？留着吧。照我看，是它在我做不到的时候让你活了下来。它赢得了你，你也赢得了它。只是别让它闲着，V。它讨厌那样。",
    ["...Heh. (a long beat) Nah — you know what? Keep her, hermano. She kept YOU breathin' while I couldn't. Just don't let her sit, V. She hates that."] = "……嘿。（长长一顿）不——你知道吗？留着它吧，hermano。是它在我做不到的时候让你活了下来。只是别让它闲着，V。它讨厌那样。",
    ["...I'll take care of her. Promise."] = "……我会照顾好它的。我保证。",
    ["Tough how? Talk to me V. What's goin on?"] = "难熬成什么样？跟我说说，V。出什么事了？",
    ["Everything went sideways after Konpeki. It's .. complicated. Long story."] = "Konpeki之后一切都乱套了。这……很复杂。说来话长。",
    ["I lost more than you know that night. Damn near lost myself too."] = "那晚我失去的比你知道的多。我差点连自己都弄丢了。",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, chica. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "嗯。……好吧。碰上重的事你总是不吭声，chica。行。我不逼你。暂时不逼。",
    ["Hmm. ...Right. You always did go quiet on the heavy stuff, mano. A'ight. I won't push. For now."] = "嗯。……好吧。碰上重的事你总是不吭声，mano。行。我不逼你。暂时不逼。",
    ["I'll tell you everything. Just... not over a phone."] = "我会把一切都告诉你。只是……不能在电话里说。",
    ["(sigh) Honest? Layin' low out here's wearin' me down to nothin', V. Miss the city. The lights, the noise, Mama's cookin'. I wanna come home. But it ain't that simple."] = "（叹气）说实话？在这儿躲着快把我耗成一无所有了，V。想念那座城。那些灯光，那些喧闹，Mama做的饭。我想回家。可没那么简单。",
    ["Why not? What's keepin' you stuck out there?"] = "为什么不行？是什么把你困在那儿的？",
    ["That chip ... whatever got left behind's still runnin'. Some Arasaka security soft - pingin' out where I am like a beacon. That's how 'Saka'd find me — why I gotta stay outta range. Vik tried to cut it. Couldn't."] = "那块芯片……残留下来的东西还在运行。是某种Arasaka的安全软件——像信标一样把我的位置发出去。'Saka就是这么找到我的——所以我得待在信号范围之外。Vik试过把它切掉。切不掉。",
    ["Then we find someone who CAN. A netrunner, a ripper — anyone."] = "那咱们就找一个能切的人。一个网络黑客，一个义体医生——谁都行。",
    ["We'll get it out of you. I'm not losin' you twice, Jackie."] = "咱们会把它从你身上弄出来。我不会再失去你第二次的，Jackie。",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, chica. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "你真的愿意那么做？……你当然会。行，chica。咱们找个能抹掉这玩意儿的人。也许我能拿回我的人生。",
    ["You'd really do that? ... 'Course you would. A'ight, mano. We find someone who can wipe this thing. Maybe I get my life back."] = "你真的愿意那么做？……你当然会。行，mano。咱们找个能抹掉这玩意儿的人。也许我能拿回我的人生。",
    ["We'll get it done. But that's for tomorrow — get over here. Now."] = "咱们会办成的。不过那是明天的事——过来这儿。现在。",
    ["We'll get it done. No worries. I got your back till then."] = "咱们会办成的。别担心。在那之前我给你撑腰。",
    ["Gotta be straight with ya, choom. After what happened... I can't run serious gigs no more. Body won't take it. An' Mama? (chuckle) She'd finish what 'Saka started if I even tried."] = "得跟你说实话，choom。出了那事之后……我再也接不了正经的大活儿了。身子撑不住。还有Mama？（轻笑）我要是敢试，她会把'Saka没干完的事干完。",
    ["Nobody's askin' you to. Now quit stallin' and get over here, Jackie."] = "没人要你干那个。别磨蹭了，过来这儿，Jackie。",
    ["Good. You've bled enough for this city."] = "好。你为这座城流的血已经够多了。",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, chica."] = "……是啊。是啊，好。别说了。你在哪儿？不——别动，我已经在往你那儿去了。撑住，chica。",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, okay. Enough chattin'. Where you at? Nah — don't move, I'm already headed your way. Hang tight, mano."] = "……是啊。是啊，好。别说了。你在哪儿？不——别动，我已经在往你那儿去了。撑住，mano。",
    ["Okay. I'll be right here. Hurry up."] = "好。我就在这儿。快点。",
    ["I'm already movin', V. Don't you go nowhere. ...I'll see you by the gas station."] = "我已经在路上了，V。你哪儿也别去。……咱们加油站旁边见。",
    ["You've looked better yourself, choom."] = "你自己看着也没好到哪儿去，choom。",
    ["(just look at him a moment) ...It's you."] = "（就这么看了他一会儿）……是你。",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you? ...Damn. Sight for sore eyes, V. Missed that face more'n I got words for."] = "是啊，是啊——沙漠可不会给人的长相帮什么忙。可你呢？……我天。看到你真是养眼，V。我想念这张脸想得没法用言语说。",
    ["Yeah, yeah — desert don't do a man's looks any favors. But you, hermano? Damn, you're a sight. Missed that ugly mug o' yours."] = "是啊，是啊——沙漠可不会给人的长相帮什么忙。可你呢，hermano？我天，看到你真好。我想念你那张丑脸了。",
    ["We're both still standin'. That's what counts."] = "咱俩都还站着。这才是要紧的。",
    ["...Hold up. My bike. You still got her? All this time, you kept her?"] = "……等等。我的摩托。你还留着它？这么久，你一直留着？",
    ["She's in my garage, Jackie. Waiting for you. Here — your keys."] = "它在我车库里，Jackie。等着你呢。给——你的钥匙。",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight, a'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', chica. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "所以你真的要留着它，嗯。（大笑）行，行——那你来开，chica。来吧。让我看看它有没有被好好照顾。",
    ["So you really are keepin' her, huh. (laughs) A'ight — then YOU'RE drivin', hermano. C'mon. Show me she's been in good hands."] = "所以你真的要留着它，嗯。（大笑）行——那你来开，hermano。来吧。让我看看它有没有被好好照顾。",
    ["Get on, Jackie. Let's go home."] = "上车，Jackie。咱们回家。",
    ["You kept her runnin' for me. All this time... Damn, V. That's the last piece o' the old me, right there."] = "你替我让它一直跑着。这么久……我天，V。那可是以前的我最后剩下的一块，就在那儿。",
    ["Let's go, hermano, and you can take her for a spin."] = "走吧，hermano，你可以骑它兜一圈。",
    ["C'mon, V. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "来吧，V。咱们回家。……还有，嘿——别再办葬礼了。好长一段时间都别，行吗？",
    ["C'mon, hermano. Let's go home. ...And hey — no more funerals. Not for a good long while, yeah?"] = "来吧，hermano。咱们回家。……还有，嘿——别再办葬礼了。好长一段时间都别，行吗？",
    ["Híjole... we made it. We actually made it. Can't believe it, V."] = "Híjole……咱们成功了。咱们真的成功了。简直不敢信，V。",
    ["(catch your breath) ...Yeah. We did."] = "（喘口气）……是啊。咱们成功了。",
    ["We're alive, chica. Both of us."] = "咱们活着，chica。咱俩都是。",
    ["Barely caught a breath since Konpeki. ...Feels good to just stop a second."] = "从Konpeki之后几乎没喘过一口气。……能就这么停一秒钟真好。",
    ["Heh... yeah. It does. ...Shame nobody's ever gonna know it was us up there."] = "嘿……是啊。确实好。……可惜永远没人会知道那上头是咱俩干的。",
    ["By the way -- where'd you store the case?"] = "对了——你把那箱子放哪儿了？",
    ["...Jackie?"] = "……Jackie？",
    ["I had it. Right in my hands, V, I swear I did..."] = "它在我手里的。就在我手里，V，我发誓真在……",
    ["Jackie! The biochip -- the fucking case with the biochip, where is it?!"] = "Jackie！那生物芯片——他妈的装着生物芯片的箱子，它在哪儿？！",
    ["I tried to hold onto it, I swear. Smasher -- that hijo de puta... Case took a round, cracked wide open. Chip's slag. So I dropped it. ...I'm sorry, V. I really am."] = "我拼了命想抓住它，我发誓。Smasher——那个hijo de puta……箱子中了一枪，整个裂开了。芯片成了废渣。所以我把它扔了。……对不起，V。真的对不起。",
    ["Fuck! That was our ticket Jackie! Everything we worked for!"] = "操！那可是咱们的门票，Jackie！咱们拼死拼活换来的一切！",
    ["Honestly? Thing probably woulda been more trouble than it was worth."] = "说实话？那玩意儿带来的麻烦八成比它值的钱还多。",
    ["We're both breathing, cabrón. That's the only score that matters."] = "咱俩都还喘着气，cabrón。这才是唯一要紧的战果。",
    ["Yeah... I know. Chinga'o. But hey -- you're still here to be pissed about it, right?"] = "是啊……我知道。Chinga'o。可是嘿——你还在这儿能为这事发火，对吧？",
    ["You and me. Took down Smasher and walked outta Konpeki Plaza. Nobody's ever gonna believe it."] = "就你和我。干掉了Smasher，从Konpeki Plaza走了出来。永远没人会信。",
    ["...Yeah. Maybe you're right. Corpo tech like that only ever buys you a shorter life."] = "……是啊。也许你说得对。那种企业科技换来的只会是更短的命。",
    ["Hehe yeah. A tale for the ages V!  \\n(A pause) So... What's next?"] = "嘿嘿是啊。一段流芳百世的故事，V！  \\n（一顿）那么……接下来干嘛？",
    ["Whatever we want, hermano. For once, nobody's writing our story but us."] = "咱们想干嘛就干嘛，hermano。这一回，写咱们故事的人只有咱们自己。",
    ["...Heh. I like the sound o' that. C'mon, then. Night City's aint gonna solo itself!"] = "……嘿。这话我爱听。那走吧。Night City可不会自己一个人搞定！",
    ["Noodle bar."] = "面馆。",
    ["Misty's Esoterica."] = "Misty's Esoterica。",
    ["El Coyote Cojo."] = "El Coyote Cojo。",
    ["Afterlife."] = "Afterlife。",
    ["Ginger Panda."] = "Ginger Panda。",
    ["Redwood Market."] = "Redwood Market。",
    ["Lizzie's Bar."] = "Lizzie's Bar。",
    ["(secret nap spot)."] = "（秘密打盹点）。",
    ["V: Not draggin' Jackie into this mess. Not after everything he went through."] = "V：不能把Jackie扯进这摊乱子里。尤其是在他经历了那一切之后。",
    ["Can't call Jackie during a main mission — not draggin' him into this."] = "主线任务期间没法给Jackie打电话——不能把他扯进这事里。",
    ["Shigure"] = "Shigure",
    ["Oh, shit..."] = "噢，该死……",
    ["Estamos bien chingados!"] = "Estamos bien chingados!",
    ["¡Muerte, cabrón!"] = "¡Muerte, cabrón!",
    ["Luckily all clear for now. Shouldn't stick around, though."] = "幸好现在暂时清场了。不过不该在这儿逗留。",
    ["Is tha— is that Adam Smasher?"] = "那是——那是Adam Smasher吗？",
    ["Oh, SHIT!"] = "噢，该死！",
    ["We ain't dyin' — not today!"] = "咱们不会死的——今天不会！",
    ["Bien pensado. Old man Arasaka's AV should still be parked on the roof."] = "Bien pensado。Arasaka那老头的AV应该还停在屋顶上。",
    ["C'mon, V — let's get outta here."] = "来吧，V——咱们离开这儿。",
    ["Jackie Lives — installed"] = "Jackie Lives——已安装",
    ["Vik called. Left a message. Says he's got somethin' to tell you about Jackie — somethin' he wouldn't say over the phone.\\n\\nGo see him at his clinic.\\n\\n(For mod settings go to Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives) "] = "Vik打来过电话。留了条口信。说他有件关于Jackie的事要告诉你——一件他不肯在电话里说的事。\\n\\n去他的诊所找他。\\n\\n（模组设置请到 Esc -> Mods -> JackieLives） ",
    ["Vik:"] = "Vik：",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. He's alive, V — layin' low out in the Badlands, and it's gotta stay that way. Kid had no business survivin' what he survived. And when he could talk again, the first thing he asked was whether you got out. It just wasn't safe before to tell you V. I'm sorry. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "我早该告诉你的，很抱歉我没有。那晚Jackie并没有死在我的手术台上。我把他的脉搏救了回来，托了个人情，在Arasaka来找尸体之前把他转移走了。他还活着，V——躲在Badlands，而且必须一直这样躲着。这孩子本没道理能挺过他挺过的那些。等他又能说话时，第一句问的就是你有没有逃出来。之前告诉你实在不安全，V。对不起。我把地点标在你地图上了。去把他带回来。",
    ["I shoulda told you a long time ago, and I'm sorry I didn't. Jackie didn't die on my table that night. I got a pulse back, called in a favor, moved him out before Arasaka came lookin' for the body. It just wasn't safe before to tell you, V. He's alive. Layin' low out in the Badlands — and it's gotta stay that way. He's been waitin' on you. I'm markin' the spot on your map. Go bring him back."] = "我早该告诉你的，很抱歉我没有。那晚Jackie并没有死在我的手术台上。我把他的脉搏救了回来，托了个人情，在Arasaka来找尸体之前把他转移走了。之前告诉你实在不安全，V。他还活着。躲在Badlands——而且必须一直这样躲着。他一直在等你。我把地点标在你地图上了。去把他带回来。",
    ["Shard — Jackie Welles"] = "记忆碎片——Jackie Welles",
    ["If you're readin' this, V, then the doc kept his word and sent you out here. It's me. I'm alive."] = "如果你在读这个，V，那就说明doc守住了他的承诺，把你送到这儿来了。是我。我还活着。",
    ["Vik patched me up and smuggled me out before 'Saka could stamp my name on a slab. Been layin' low ever since."] = "Vik把我救好，在'Saka能把我的名字刻上墓碑之前偷偷把我送了出来。从那以后我就一直躲着。",
    ["Mama Welles was so mad when she heard. Think she'd kill me if I went back doin' gigs — maybe she's right. I'm done with the merc life, V. For real. But I couldn't let you go on thinkin' you buried me."] = "Mama Welles听说的时候气坏了。我看要是我再回去接活儿，她会杀了我——也许她说得对。我不干雇佣兵这行了，V。说真的。可我没法让你一直以为你把我埋了。",
    ["Give me a call when you read this. — Jackie"] = "读到这个就给我打个电话。——Jackie",
    ["Find Jackie — Rocky Ridge, the Badlands"] = "找到Jackie——Rocky Ridge，Badlands",
    ["Call Jackie"] = "打电话给Jackie",
    ["Wait for Jackie"] = "等待Jackie",
    ["Jackie's back."] = "Jackie回来了。",
    ["Shard — Misty"] = "记忆碎片——Misty",
    ["I keep the Death card turned face-down now. Couldn't look at it — for months it was all I saw when I shut my eyes."] = "现在我把死神牌翻过来扣着。我没法看它——有好几个月，一闭上眼睛看到的全是它。",
    ["When Vik told me he'd made it, that he was out there breathin' in the Badlands, I sat down on the shop floor and cried till the incense burned out."] = "Vik告诉我他挺过来了，说他就在Badlands那儿喘着气，我一屁股坐到店里的地板上，哭到线香都烧尽了。",
    ["I won't pretend I'm only happy, V. Some nights I'm so angry I could scream. He walked into that heist knowin' the risk. He almost left us. Almost left me."] = "我不会假装我只有高兴，V。有些夜里我气得能尖叫出来。他明知道风险还是走进了那场劫案。他差点离开了我们。差点离开了我。",
    ["But the cards weren't wrong. His thread didn't cut. It just frayed... and held."] = "可那些牌没有错。他的线没有断。它只是磨损了……却撑住了。",
    ["Go easy on him. And thank you — for goin' to bring him home. — Misty"] = "对他宽容点。还有谢谢你——谢谢你去把他带回家。——Misty",
    ["Shard — Mama Welles"] = "记忆碎片——Mama Welles",
    ["So. My Jackie is alive, and I am the last to hear of it. You wait until you are a mother, V, and someone keeps a thing like this from you — then we will talk about forgiveness."] = "所以。我的Jackie还活着，而我是最后一个知道的。等你哪天当了妈妈，V，有人把这样的事瞒着你——到那时候咱们再来谈原谅。",
    ["I lit a candle for that boy every single day. I cooked for a ghost. And all the while he is out in the dust, breathin', lettin' me grieve. Dios mío."] = "我每一天都为那孩子点一支蜡烛。我给一个鬼魂做饭。而这整段时间里他在那片尘土里，喘着气，任由我为他悲恸。Dios mío。",
    ["And yet — he is ALIVE. My boy is alive. I have not stopped thankin' the Virgin since I heard. My knees are sore from it."] = "可即便如此——他还活着。我的孩子还活着。自打听说以后我就没停止过感谢圣母。我的膝盖都跪酸了。",
    ["But hear me once, V: if he ever takes a gig like that heist again — risks his life for eddies and glory one more time — I will not wait for this city to take him. I will kill him myself."] = "可你给我听好这一次，V：要是他再接一个像那场劫案一样的活儿——再为了eddies和风光去拿命冒一次险——我不会等这座城把他带走。我会亲手杀了他。",
    ["Bring him to my table. There is a plate waitin'. There has always been a plate waitin'. — Mama Welles"] = "把他带到我的餐桌前。有一副碗筷等着。一直都有一副碗筷等着。——Mama Welles",
    ["Talk"] = "谈谈",
    ["Talk to Jackie   [ "] = "跟Jackie谈谈   [ ",
    ["Jackie"] = "Jackie",
    ["Calling Jackie..."] = "正在呼叫Jackie……",
    ["No answer."] = "无人接听。",
  
    -- v1.65 familiarity: Jackie's tiered conversation hub.
    ["There she is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "你来啦。坐下，喘口气——你老是闲不住。",
    ["There he is. Sit down, take a breath — you're always movin'."] = "你来啦。坐下，喘口气——你老是闲不住。",
    ["Was hopin' you'd come by. Don't tell nobody I said that."] = "还盼着你能来一趟呢。别跟人说我说过这话。",
    ["Hey. ...Nah, nothin'. Just good to see you standin' there, is all."] = "嘿。……没什么。就是看着你好好站在那儿，挺好的，就这样。",
    ["Mi hermana. C'mere."] = "Mi hermana。过来。",
    ["How's the quiet life really treatin' ya?"] = "这种安稳日子，说实话过得怎么样？",
    ["You like workin' the bar?"] = "你喜欢在吧台后面干活吗？",
    ["Heywood still feel like home?"] = "海伍德还像家吗？",
    ["You ever miss it? The life."] = "你会想念吗？那种生活。",
    ["How's the body holdin' up? Honestly."] = "身体撑得住吗？说实话。",
    ["What do you remember about that night?"] = "那天晚上的事，你还记得多少？",
    ["You ever go see Vik?"] = "你还去看维克吗？",
    ["Were you scared?"] = "你当时害怕吗？",
    ["Do you blame me?"] = "你怪我吗？",
    ["What do you want now, Jackie?"] = "你现在想要什么，杰基？",
    ["...Say it. Whatever it is you keep not sayin'."] = "……说出来吧。不管那是什么，你一直没说出口的那件事。",
    ["Good. Slow. Slow's an adjustment, but it's good."] = "挺好。慢。慢是得适应，但挺好。",
    ["Some days good. Some days I sit down in the middle of the afternoon 'cause my body says so and I don't argue with it no more."] = "有些日子挺好。有些日子大下午的我就得坐下，因为身体这么说，我也不跟它争了。",
    ["Honest? I don't sleep right. I get to about four and I'm awake, and I lie there listenin' to the building. ...But I'm here to not sleep. That's the trade, and I'd take it again."] = "说实话？睡不踏实。差不多四点就醒了，躺着听这栋楼的动静。……可我留下来，就是为了能这么睡不着。这是交换，再来一次我还换。",
    ["Bar, mostly. And people keep findin' me with problems. Small ones. I like the small ones."] = "多半是吧台。还有人带着自己的麻烦来找我。小麻烦。我喜欢小的。",
    ["Kid down the block needed his brother found. Took me two days and a lotta talkin' and nobody got shot. Best work I ever did, and it don't pay nothin'."] = "街那头有个孩子要找他哥。花了我两天，说了一堆话，谁也没挨枪子儿。这是我干过最好的活儿，一分钱不挣。",
    ["Ah, it's... quiet. Heh. That's the joke, right? Turns out quiet's a skill. I wasn't good at it at first."] = "啊，就是……安静。嘿。这就是笑话的地方，对吧？原来安静是门本事。一开始我一点都不行。",
    ["I keep catchin' myself listenin' for somethin' to go wrong. Standin' in the bar at two in the afternoon with a rag in my hand, waitin' on a firefight that ain't comin'. It's gettin' better."] = "我到现在还老是发现自己在听——听是不是要出事了。下午两点站在吧台里，手里攥着抹布，等一场根本不会来的枪战。不过在好起来了。",
    ["You'll get the hang of it."] = "你会慢慢习惯的。",
    ["Beats the alternative."] = "总比另一种下场强。",
    ["You could always come back to the life."] = "你随时可以回到那种生活。",
    ["...No. No, V. I got carried out of that place. Mama got a call in the night. I ain't doin' that to her twice, and I ain't doin' it to you neither. Don't ask me that again."] = "……不。不行，V。我是被人抬出那地方的。妈妈半夜接到了那通电话。这种事我不会让她再经历一次，也不会让你经历。别再问我这个。",
    ["I'm sorry. You're right."] = "对不起。你说得对。",
    ["Fussin'. Feedin' me. Actin' like she ain't scared, which is how I know she's scared."] = "我明白。",
    ["She lights a candle for me. For ME. I'm sittin' right there at her table and she's still lightin' it. Says it's for the version of me that didn't make it out."] = "围着我转。喂我吃东西。装作自己不害怕——我就是这么知道她害怕的。",
    ["She don't know the half of what happened that night and she never will. That's a thing I carry so she don't have to. You understand that, right?"] = "她为我点蜡烛。为我啊。我就坐在她桌边，她还是点。她说那是为那个没能走出来的我点的。",
    ["She'd carry it with you if you let her."] = "那晚发生的事她连一半都不知道，也永远不会知道。这是我替她扛着的东西，让她不用扛。你懂的，对吧？",
    ["I understand."] = "如果你肯让她扛，她会和你一起扛的。",
    ["It's honest. Nobody's ever pulled a gun on me over a bad pour."] = "这活儿干净。还没人为了一杯酒倒得不好就拿枪指我。",
    ["I know everybody's drink and half their troubles. Turns out that's a kind of power too. Just the slow kind."] = "我知道每个人喝什么，还知道他们一半的烦心事。原来那也是一种力量。只是慢的那种。",
    ["Always did. Same corners, same abuelas yellin' out the same windows."] = "一直都是。还是那些街角，还是那些abuelas从同样的窗户里喊人。",
    ["I walk it different now, though. Used to walk it like I was gonna own it one day. Now I just... walk it."] = "不过我现在走在里头不一样了。以前走路那架势，像是总有一天要把它拿下。现在就只是……走走。",
    ["...Yeah. Yeah, I miss it. Not the shootin'. The *us*. Comin' up with somethin' stupid at two in the mornin' and doin' it by four."] = "……是啊。是，我想念。不是想念开枪。是想念那个*我们*。凌晨两点想出个蠢主意，四点就去干了。",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, chica — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "我想念那个一进门就能把事儿摆平的人。不愈合的是那一块，chica——不是肋骨。肋骨早长好了。",
    ["I miss bein' the guy who could fix it by walkin' in the door. That's the part that don't heal, hermano — not the ribs. The ribs healed."] = "我想念那个一进门就能把事儿摆平的人。不愈合的是那一块，hermano——不是肋骨。肋骨早长好了。",
    ["We're still us."] = "我们还是我们。",
    ["You were never just that."] = "你从来不只是那样。",
    ["Honestly? Stiff. Cold mornings are the worst of it. Vik says that's permanent and I should make friends with it."] = "说实话？发僵。最难受的是冷天早上。维克说这是永久的，让我学着跟它做朋友。",
    ["There's a plate in me, V. I can feel where it ends. Some nights I lie there with my hand on it just checkin' it's still doin' its job. That's what I got instead of a scar you could brag about."] = "我身体里有块钢板，V。我能摸出它到哪儿为止。有些晚上我就躺着把手放在上面，就是确认一下它还在干活。别人有能拿出来吹的疤，我有的是这个。",
    ["You don't have to make it a joke."] = "你不用把它当笑话讲。",
    ["You're still standin'."] = "你还站着呢。",
    ["Pieces. The car. You yellin' somethin' I couldn't hear. Dex's voice on the line and the whole thing already goin' sideways."] = "一片一片的。那辆车。你在喊什么，我听不清。德克斯的声音在通讯里，整件事那时候就已经在往下掉了。",
    ["I remember bein' cold and thinkin' that was strange, 'cause it was a warm night. And I remember decidin' I wasn't gonna say anything about it 'cause you had enough on you already. ...That was dumb. I shoulda said somethin'."] = "我记得我冷，还觉得奇怪，因为那是个暖和的夜里。我还记得我决定什么都不说，因为你身上背的已经够多了。……那是傻。我该说点什么的。",
    ["You should've said somethin'."] = "你当时该说点什么的。",
    ["You were tryin' to protect me."] = "你是想保护我。",
    ["Let's not do this."] = "我们别聊这个了。",
    ["Once a month. He don't charge me, which drives me crazy, so I bring him somethin' from Mama's kitchen and we call it square."] = "一个月一次。他不收我钱，这快把我逼疯了，所以我就从妈妈厨房带点东西给他，算两清。",
    ["That man kept his mouth shut for a long time so I could stay dead. You know what that costs a guy like Vik? He carried it alone. I owe him more than the ribs."] = "那个人闭了很久的嘴，就为了让我能一直「死」着。你知道这对维克那样的人来说是什么代价吗？他一个人扛着。我欠他的，可不止这几根肋骨。",
    ["...Yeah. Not at the time — at the time it's just loud and then it's quiet. After. Wakin' up in a room I didn't know, not able to move, not knowin' if you got out. That's the scared that stuck. Took me a long time to say that out loud."] = "……怕。当时不怕——当时只是很吵，然后就安静了。是之后。在一个不认识的屋子里醒过来，动不了，也不知道你出没出来。留下来的就是那种怕。我花了很久才能把这话说出口。",
    ["I'm glad you said it."] = "我很高兴你说出来了。",
    ["I was scared too."] = "我当时也害怕。",
    ["For what? For the job? V, I *wanted* that job. I talked YOU into half of it. You been carryin' that around this whole time thinkin' I'd hold it against you? ...Nah. No. Never once. Not for a second."] = "为什么？为那单活儿？V，那单活儿我是*想*干的。有一半还是我说动你的。你这一路都揣着这个，以为我会记恨你？……不。没有。一次都没有。一秒钟都没有。",
    ["I needed to hear that."] = "我需要听到这句话。",
    ["I still carry it."] = "我还是放不下。",
    ["Then put it down. Right here, right now — you don't gotta haul that around no more. I'm standin' in front of you. Look at me. I'm standin' right here."] = "那就放下。就在这儿，就现在——你不用再拖着它了。我就站在你面前。看着我。我就好好站在这儿。",
    ["...Okay."] = "……好。",
    ["Somethin' small, I think. The bar. Sunday at Mama's. Maybe a place with a window that ain't got bars on it. Used to be I wanted my name on somethin'. Now I want to be around long enough to get bored. That sound pathetic?"] = "小一点的东西吧，我想。这个吧台。星期天去妈妈家。也许再有个窗户上没铁栏杆的地方。以前我想把名字刻在什么东西上。现在我只想活得够久，久到觉得无聊。听着很可悲吗？",
    ["That sounds like a life."] = "听着像是一种生活。",
    ["Nothing pathetic about it."] = "这一点都不可悲。",
    ["...First thing I asked Vik. Before my own name, before what happened to me. I asked him if you got out. He said yeah, and I went back under for two days. Whatever else that night took, it didn't take that. That's the thing I keep not sayin'."] = "……那是我问维克的第一件事。比我自己的名字还早，比我出了什么事还早。我问他你有没有出来。他说出来了，然后我又昏过去两天。那一晚不管还夺走了什么，这一样它没夺走。这就是我一直没说出口的事。",
    ["I asked about you too, every day."] = "我也天天问起你。",
    ["Go on. I'm not goin' anywhere — that's the whole point of me now."] = "去吧。我哪儿也不去——现在我这个人存在的意义就是这个。",
    ["Hey. Come back, huh? Don't make it a month."] = "嘿。再回来啊？别隔上一个月。",
    ["A Tequila Old Fashioned with a splash of cerveza and a chili garnish."] = "一杯龙舌兰古典鸡尾酒，加一点啤酒，配上辣椒装饰。",
    ["Shot of vodka on the rocks, lime juice, ginger beer and, most importantly... a splash of love."] = "一杯加冰伏特加，青柠汁，姜汁啤酒，最重要的是……再来一点爱。",
    ["Double tequila with grenadine and lime. Nothin' better for drownin' nerves."] = "双份龙舌兰配石榴糖浆和青柠。没什么比这更能压住紧张了。",
    ["Oh, and by the way, name's Jackie Welles. You wanna write down my recipe?"] = "哦，顺便说一句，我叫杰克·威尔斯。要不要记下我的配方？",
    ["You've got a whole bit."] = "你这套词儿都练熟了啊。",
    ["How's Night City treatin' ya?"] = "夜之城待你怎么样？",
    ["Ahhhh, I love this town. The city of endless opportunity. And brotherly hate."] = "啊啊啊，我爱这座城。机会无穷的城市。还有兄弟相残的城市。",
    ["'S important to have people you can turn to. Y'know, like, uh, family. Maybe you'll find your own down in Night City."] = "有能依靠的人很重要。你懂的，就像……家人。也许你能在夜之城找到自己的。",
    ["You can kick the rat outta the corp, but you'll never kick the corp outta the rat."] = "你能把耗子从公司里赶出来，但永远赶不走耗子身上的公司味儿。",
    ["Y'know... butterfly effect or whatever."] = "你知道的……蝴蝶效应什么的。",
    ["I found mine."] = "我已经找到我的了。",
    ["I'm loyal, stable in my affections…"] = "我这人忠诚，感情也稳定……",
    ["She waited, y'know."] = "她一直在等，你知道吗。",
    ["What've you been watchin'?"] = "你最近在看什么？",
    ["¡No mames! A real iguana! A, uh, Lesser Antillean, I think."] = "不是吧！真的鬣蜥！是，呃，小安的列斯的那种，我想。",
    ["Yeah! Watched a thing on TV about 'em. Went extinct like thirty years ago. They're from the Lesser Antilles."] = "对！我在电视上看过讲它们的节目。大概三十年前就灭绝了。它们来自小安的列斯群岛。",
    ["You come a long way, my scaly friend."] = "你可走了不少路啊，我的鳞片朋友。",
    ["Down for some target practice in VR?"] = "想不想在VR里练练枪？",
    ["You're a nature-doc guy now."] = "你现在成自然纪录片迷了。",
    ["...An iguana."] = "……鬣蜥啊。",
    ["Anybody come to you with a problem lately?"] = "最近有人带着麻烦来找你吗？",
    ["El cabrón's gotta learn... he don't do people in Heywood dirty."] = "那个混蛋得学学……别对海伍德的人下作。",
    ["That's still fixin', Jackie."] = "那还是中间人的活儿啊，杰克。",
    ["Heywood's lucky to have ya."] = "海伍德有你真是走运。",
    ["Kid two doors down owed the wrong guy. Didn't need a gun for it — needed somebody who'd sit in a room and be the biggest thing in it. Turns out that's still me."] = "隔两户的那孩子欠了不该欠的人。这事儿不需要枪——需要的是一个坐进那个房间、并且是里头最大块头的人。结果那还是我。",
    ["Nobody writes it down. No fixer, no cut, no name on a board. Just a lady knockin' on the bar door at eleven at night 'cause she's got nowhere else. ...Best work I've ever done and I'd be embarrassed to call it work."] = "没人会记下来。没有中间人，没有抽成，板子上也没名字。只有一个女人半夜十一点敲酒吧的门，因为她没别的地方可去。……这是我做过最好的活儿，可我都不好意思管它叫活儿。",
    ["Tell me about your old man."] = "跟我说说你老爸。",
    ["Sure as shit better'n bein' the son of Raúl Welles."] = "总他妈比当劳尔·威尔斯的儿子强。",
    ["He left. That's the whole story, and it took me thirty years to get it that short. Mama never bad-mouthed him once, not one time — she just quietly went and became both of 'em."] = "他走了。整个故事就这些，我花了三十年才把它说得这么短。妈妈从来没说过他一句坏话，一次都没有——她只是默默地，把两个人的角色都担了下来。",
    ["You're nothin' like him."] = "你一点也不像他。",
    ["She did a hell of a job."] = "她做得真是了不起。",
    ["Where'd you get your code, Jackie?"] = "你的那套规矩是哪儿来的，杰克？",
    ["Take the Valentinos. They follow God and the Santa Madre. Honor means something to 'em."] = "看看瓦伦提诺帮。他们信上帝，信圣母。荣誉对他们是有分量的。",
    ["Gang world ain't too complicated. Might's right, the strong survive."] = "帮派的世界没那么复杂。谁拳头硬谁有理，强者才活得下来。",
    ["Today, they got you to zero somebody. Tomorrow, they'll get somebody else to zero you."] = "今天他们让你去干掉别人。明天他们就会让别人来干掉你。",
    ["You still live by it?"] = "你现在还照这个活吗？",
    ["That's why you got out, isn't it?"] = "所以你才收手的，对吧？",
    ["You still believe in all that? God, the saints?"] = "你还信那些吗？上帝，圣人什么的。",
    ["Mi madre always said patience pays off, so…"] = "我妈总说耐心总有回报，所以……",
    ["En el nombre del Padre, del Hijo y del Espíritu Santo, amén."] = "以圣父、圣子、圣灵之名，阿门。",
    ["I died, V. However you wanna say it — my heart quit and somebody's hands started it again. So do I believe? I believe SOMETHIN' held the door for a second. I don't need to know whose hand it was."] = "我死过，V。随你怎么说——我的心跳停了，是别人的手把它重新弄回来的。所以我信不信？我信有什么东西替我把门撑了那么一秒。至于那是谁的手，我不需要知道。",
    ["Mama'd be glad to hear it."] = "妈妈听了会高兴的。",
    ["You think about dyin'?"] = "你会想死这件事吗？",
    ["Death... s'nothin' but the final flourish."] = "死亡……不过是最后那一笔花哨罢了。",
    ["Used to say that like it was clever. Said it in a bar once with a drink in my hand — everyone's gotta go sometime, why not in style. Then I went, V. Turns out there's no style in it. There's just a room and somebody else doin' the work of keepin' you."] = "我以前说这话，像是在耍聪明。有一次在酒吧，手里端着酒就这么说了——人总有一天要走，为什么不走得漂亮点。后来我走了，V。结果发现那里头没有半点漂亮。只有一个房间，和另一个人替你干着把你留住的活儿。",
    ["You're here now."] = "你现在就在这儿。",
    ["Don't go again, hermano."] = "别再走了，兄弟。",
    ["Hasta luego."] = "回头见。",
    ["Time we were on our way, carnal."] = "该走了，兄弟。",
    ["Make moves, chica."] = "行动吧，姑娘。",
    ["You with me, chica?"] = "跟上了吗，姑娘？",
    ["You with me, mano?"] = "跟上了吗，兄弟？",
    ["Hermano! Finally!"] = "兄弟！可算来了！",
    ["Don't worry about me. I'll manage on my own."] = "别担心我，我自己能行。",
    ["You order."] = "你来点。",
    ["Maybe later."] = "也许下次吧。",
    ["You been with Misty a while, huh?"] = "你和蜜丝蒂在一起有段时间了吧？",
    ["OK, ready. Let's move."] = "好了，准备好了。走吧。",
    ["It's good to see you, too, Jack. How ya been?"] = "我也很高兴见到你，杰克。最近怎么样？",
    ["Need your help, Jack. Got some biz."] = "需要你帮忙，杰克。有活儿。",
    ["Somethin' I gotta take care of first."] = "我得先处理点事。",
    ["Let's roll. No point in waitin'."] = "走吧，没必要等。",
    ["Take it easy, amigo."] = "保重，amigo。",
    ["What's good to eat?"] = "有什么好吃的？",
    ["How ya been? 'Sides the biz, I mean."] = "最近怎么样？我是说除了生意。",
    ["Actually, gotta go."] = "算了，我得走了。",
    ["See you around."] = "回头见。",
    ["Need your help."] = "需要你帮忙。",
    ["What's new with Señora Welles?"] = "韦尔斯太太最近怎么样？",
    ["Could use a drink."] = "来一杯正好。",
    ["Take care."] = "保重。",
    ["To this."] = "敬这个。",
    ["Won't say no to a free drink."] = "免费的酒我可不拒绝。",
    ["To hittin' the major leagues!"] = "敬我们打进大联盟！",
    ["What're you up to?"] = "你在忙什么呢？",
    ["Tell Misty I said \\\"Hi.\\\""] = "替我向蜜丝蒂问好。",
    ["Riiight…"] = "是——吗……",
    ["How's things?"] = "最近如何？",
    ["Whatcha got in the way of drink?"] = "有什么喝的？",
    ["How's your mom?"] = "你妈还好吗？",
    ["Talk later."] = "回头再聊。",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, chica."] = "没什么值得记下来的。这才是重点，chica。",
    ["Nothin' worth writin' down. Which is the point, hermano."] = "没什么值得记下来的。这才是重点，hermano。",
    ["I'll take a drink."] = "我来一杯。",
    ["Lesser Antil-what?"] = "小安的列……什么？",
    ["Later."] = "回见。",
    ["Take care, man."] = "保重，老兄。",
    ["Call ya back later."] = "我待会儿回你电话。",
    ["We'll talk later."] = "我们回头再谈。",
    ["Yeah, see ya."] = "嗯，回见。",
    ["Gotta run."] = "我得走了。",
    ["See ya in the major leagues, Jack."] = "大联盟见，杰克。",
    ["G'bye, old friend."] = "再见了，老朋友。",
    ["Just wanted to know how, you know, you were holdin' up."] = "就是想知道你，你懂的，撑得怎么样。",
    ["Come on."] = "走吧。",
    ["You got me too."] = "我也有你。",
    ["I'll take that win."] = "这胜利我收下了。",
    ["Suits you, Jackie."] = "挺适合你的，Jackie。",
    ["Small ones count."] = "小事也算数。",
    ["Still your turf."] = "还是你的地盘。",
    ["Glad you're here to say it."] = "很高兴你还在这儿说这话。",
    ["Vik's good people."] = "Vik 是好人。",
    ["That's one word for it."] = "也可以这么说。",
    ["Amen to that."] = "说得没错。",
    ["Sitting down is still a work in progress"] = "坐下功能仍在完善中",
    ["They'll stand at the table rather than sit.\\n\\nThe sit animation isn't tied to real furniture yet — it plays wherever the character is standing, so an automatic sit usually leaves them hovering above the chair. Standing looked better than floating, so standing is the default.\\n\\nYou can seat them yourself, and it lands exactly where you put it: open the CET overlay, find \\\"NCLives - Companions\\\" -> \\\"Sitting - seat them by hand\\\". Stand on the chair facing the way they should face, press \\\"Seat them here\\\", then step back and nudge the height and angle sliders until it looks right.\\n\\nStand them up again with the same panel before you send them home."] = "他们会站在桌边，而不是坐下。\n\n坐下动画目前还没有和真实家具绑定——它会在角色所站的位置直接播放，所以自动坐下往往会让他们悬在椅子上方。站着比浮空好看，因此默认是站着。\n\n你可以自己安排他们坐下，位置完全由你决定：打开 CET 覆盖层，找到「NCLives - Companions」->「Sitting - seat them by hand」。站到椅子上，面朝他们该面对的方向，按下「Seat them here」，然后退开，用高度和角度滑块微调到合适为止。\n\n送他们回家前，请用同一面板让他们重新站起来。",
  },
}
